window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2701,"title":"Chapter 2701 - Mu Yan, the Great Doctor","paragraphs":["How could she remove Master Mu Yan’s disguise?","Jupiter worshiped Mu Yan for her exceptional medical skills, but he had begun to panic.","Feng Wu said casually, “I want to know the truth as soon as possible. Sorry about this.”","She then handed a box to Shao Xiao.","“Inside are five bottles of truth serum. Do you know what that is?”","“Truth serum?” The others were amazed.","They weren’t stupid, and of course, they knew what that was. Students could purchase the serum with their points in the academy, but usually, no one was dumb enough to buy it.","The serum was insanely expensive.","The students would rather use the points on their own cultivation instead of buying some useless potion. It wasn’t as if they would be interrogating people every other day.","However, the truth serum was going to be very useful today.","Jupiter smirked at Feng Wu.","The Dongsang Kingdom had similar potions as well.","They were much better at medical refinement.","The same went with formations.","Despite being a much stronger country, the Junwu Empire lagged behind in these aspects.","It was also why Dongsang, a small kingdom, dared to wage war against the Junwu Empire.","Shao Xiao saw a smirk on Jupiter’s face.","“What are you sneering at?” Shao Xiao frowned.","Jupiter opened his mouth. “Give me the truth serum. Bring it on!”","Ling Hao frowned and wondered why the man didn’t seem scared. “Is he immune to the serum?”","Takeno smirked inwardly.","Mu Yan had used the truth serum on them before they came here, and had only let them set out when they could resist the serum.","Therefore, they weren’t afraid of it.","Of course, they weren’t going to tell Feng Wu and her team that.","They thought they could fool Feng Wu and make her believe she had gotten the truth out of them.","Just then, Feng Wu said, “Take those three to the other side.”","Only Jupiter and Takeno were left behind.","Feng Wu glanced at Takeno, who seemed very pleased with himself.","Shao Xiao then poured the serum into Takeno’s mouth.","The whole bottle.","Takeno drank it all.","At first, he remained arrogant.","But that demeanor didn’t last long.","He then started talking.","He used the language of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Jupiter frowned.","Had Takeno gone crazy? He shouldn’t be saying those things!","Luckily, his enemy didn’t understand the language...","However, what Feng Wu said surprised him. “Someone tried the truth serum on you, right?”","Takeno said, “Yes!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Who was it?”","Takeno said, “Master Mu Yan.”","Feng Wu asked, “Who’s that?”","“Shut up! Shut up!” Jupiter shouted at Takeno.","Takeno was lucid for a split second, and he glared at Feng Wu. However, the serum soon took control of him again."]},{"number":2702,"title":"Chapter 2702 - The Crown Prince’s Girl","paragraphs":["“Master Mu Yan is... Mu Yan... She’s so pretty... I like her so much... But I can’t like her... She’s the crown prince’s girl...”","“Takeno!” Fearing that Takeno would reveal more information, Jupiter jumped at him, trying to choke him to death.","However, he was stopped before he could reach Takeno.","His hands had been tied behind his back with a special rope. The harder he struggled, the tighter the knot became.","The rope dug into his flesh, and blood seeped out.","The commotion woke Takeno up a little.","He looked at Jupiter in bewilderment. “Captain?”","However, Feng Wu’s truth serum was much more potent than a regular one. After a brief moment of clarity, Takeno succumbed to the potion once more.","Feng Wu asked, “Who is Mu Yan to your crown prince?”","Takeno’s eyes were glassy, but he grinned, seemingly pleased with himself.","“Other people may not know it, but I do! I saw it with my own eyes!” Takeno whispered. “I saw the crown prince and Master Mu Yan rolling around in the grass.”","That wasn’t something one should reveal to their enemies. It was too sensitive a piece of information, and Jupiter knew their enemies would make good use of it.","A million ideas raced through Jupiter’s head, and blue veins popped on his forehead.","He wanted to say something but was too weak to speak.","He glared at Feng Wu.","He couldn’t understand what kind of potion it was.","Master Mu Yan had tried all kinds of serums and potions on them until they developed a resistance to them all.","Moreover, the Dongsang Kingdom was much better in terms of medical skills. The people of the Junwu Empire were barbarians in comparison.","However, they had been rendered completely defenseless. Why? Who was this girl?","Jupiter’s face twisted, and he thought he was going to go crazy.","However, no matter how angry he was, he couldn’t do anything about it.","Feng Wu smiled at Takeno. “You saw Master Mu Yan with the crown prince? Is she going to be his wife, then?”","“Of course not!” Takeno shook his head. “The crown prince has a wife already. She’s from a very powerful family!”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “What family is that?”","“I can’t tell you...” Takeno shook his head. “I’d rather die than tell you!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","It seemed that the crown prince and Mu Yan were worth looking into. Feng Wu made a mental note and decided to do some research later.","The Dongsang Kingdom knew so much about the Junwu Empire. It wouldn’t be fair if the Junwu Empire didn’t know as much about them.","She asked, “What level is your Master Mu Yan?”","Takeno said, “She’s a Supreme-level medicine refiner!”","Shao Xiao and the others were astonished.","Supreme level?","Feng Wu was supposed to be a Supreme-level medicine refiner, too, but she could overcome Mu Yan’s methods? Did that mean..."]},{"number":2703,"title":"Chapter 2703 - Lord of Mulberry City","paragraphs":["Did that mean Feng Wu was more advanced than a Supreme-level medicine refiner?","Shao Xiao and the others were once again astonished by the notion.","Feng Wu asked, “Where does that door in the wall lead to? Where did you come from?”","Takeno didn’t answer.","The fog in his mind was lifting, and he no longer had glassy eyes.","Feng Wu sighed inwardly.","It seemed she wasn’t going to get an answer after all.","Takeno woke up from the effect of the serum at that moment. He glared at Feng Wu when he realized what had happened.","“What did I say? Captain, what did I say?”","Jupiter ground his teeth.","Realizing that he might have leaked some confidential information, Takeno wanted to kill himself.","Feng Wu shook her head. The truth serum’s effect wouldn’t last forever.","And people could develop a resistance.","It was most effective when it was used the first time, while the effect was reduced by 50% the second time round.","Takeno was a spy who had undergone special training. Even a truth serum made by Feng Wu herself would only be effective the first time.","Therefore, Feng Wu worked on Jupiter instead.","Jupiter tried to resist it at first. Takeno watched in astonishment as Jupiter started spitting out confidential information.","“How... Aren’t we resistant to truth serum? Why?” Takeno couldn’t believe his eyes.","Shao Xiao smirked. “Your truth serum isn’t as useful as ours.”","“That’s not possible! Our Master M... Our master is better than any medicine refiner in the Junwu Empire! You people are barbarians!”","Shao Xiao asked, “Are you talking about Mu Yan?”","Takeno said, “Who told you that name?!”","Shao Xiao said, “We know more than that. We know Mu Yan and your crown prince were rolling around in the grass!”","OMG!","Takeno wanted to slap himself.","Only he knew about that incident. That was to say, he had revealed it to Feng Wu.","As a spy, Takeno was perfectly aware of the significance of that piece of information. He couldn’t imagine how his enemy would use it.","Feng Wu wasn’t going to give Jupiter a chance to recover.","She cut right to the chase.","It had only taken Takeno 15 minutes to wake up, and Jupiter would be quicker to shake off the effect. He could wake up at any moment, so she had to make every second count.","“Where does that portal lead to?” Feng Wu asked.","Jupiter hesitated and shook his head. He tried to resist.","Feng Wu knew it was harder to use the truth serum on Spiritual Kings because they had tougher minds.","Therefore, she also tried to hypnotize him with her voice.","Slowly, Jupiter let down his guard.","Even so, he wasn’t easy to interrogate. He spoke in the Dongsang language.","“Mulberry City... The City Lord’s residence... We gathered in the garden in his manor, jumped in, and saw the portal. The lord told us the Secret Essence Mine of the Junwu Empire would be on the other end.”","Feng Wu understood what he said."]},{"number":2704,"title":"Chapter 2704 - Xue Zhibei and Feng Xiangnan","paragraphs":["Shao Xiao couldn’t understand a word.","Mulberry City and the City Lord’s residence.","Feng Wu asked, “Mulberry City? Who’s the City Lord? How capable is he?”","Jupiter replied in his native language, “He’s Xue Zhibei. I don’t know how capable he is...”","Feng Wu said, “You don’t? Make a comparison, then. Who’s better, he or Feng Xiangnan, the Northern Feng General?”","Feng Xiangnan was Feng Xun’s father. He had been stationed at Peace Grassland in the north all this time, guarding the empire against Mulberry City of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Captain Jupiter remained befuddled and replied in his native language, “They’re equally capable.”","That was impressive!","Northern Feng General had guarded the grassland for many years without so much as losing a tiny piece of the land.","Because of him, Northern Border City, the place where Feng Wu used to live, had enjoyed peace all these years.","If Peace Grassland was the first line of defense, Northern Border City was second. If Northern Border City fell, the Dongsang Kingdom would sweep through the empire the same way it had 14 years ago. The people of the empire would be slaughtered.","Therefore, the empire couldn’t afford to lose Peace Grassland.","Feng Wu pressed, “What’s Dongsang’s plan for the Junwu Empire?”","Captain Jupiter gave it some thought before he shook his head. “I’m too far down the food chain to know that. I only know that a lot of us have infiltrated the Junwu Empire.”","Feng Wu gritted her teeth. “You’ll need some sort of organization to do that. What’s it called? Who’s the leader?”","Shao Xiao and the others couldn’t understand Feng Wu and Jupiter’s conversation. However, they could tell from Feng Wu’s expression that it was important.","Takeno struggled as he tried to break free and wake up his captain.","Of course, the others wouldn’t give him that chance.","They grabbed Takeno, covered his mouth and restrained his limbs. They even dragged him several hundred meters away, for fear that he would sabotage their efforts.","Feng Wu was indeed onto something big.","Jupiter started waking up.","Sh*t!","Feng Wu’s stomach sank, but she realized what was happening, so she increased the dose.","She hadn’t brought much truth serum with her, and she used all three remaining portions on Jupiter while she kept hypnotizing him with her voice.","Finally, Jupiter sank back into a befuddled state again.","Feng Wu jumped at the opportunity. “What’s your organization called? Who’s the leader?”","That was the million-dollar question!","Although the revival plan had failed, the brains behind that project had never been discovered.","Feng Wu hadn’t forgotten the hidden crisis.","She wouldn’t waste such a great opportunity.","Jupiter murmured, “The organization is called Junwu Annihilation. It’s dedicated to collecting information on the Junwu Empire.","“It has a domestic division and a foreign division.","“The domestic one is called Crackdown, and the foreign one is called Wipeout.","“Crackdown is led by the master teacher, whereas Wipeout is led by the king’s brother.”"]},{"number":2705,"title":"Chapter 2705 - Crackdown and Wipeout","paragraphs":["“The master teacher leads the domestic division, whereas Wipeout is led by the king’s brother.”","“The king’s brother?” Feng Wu asked. “Who’s that?”","“He’s...” Jupiter was about to say a name, when his eyes cleared up and he came back to his senses.","Meanwhile, Takeno, who had been brought back, stared at Jupiter in disbelief.","“Captain, why did you tell them everything?”","Only then did Jupiter realize what he had done. He bellowed and jumped at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu dodged.","Jupiter suddenly smiled.","Feng Wu said, “Everybody, down!”","Shao Xiao and the others reacted quickly. They dashed off and lay flat on the ground.","There was a rumbling sound.","Jupiter and Takeno turned into balls of fire.","The fire then quickly made its way toward the three other people.","Sh*t!","Feng Wu charged at them.","She hadn’t interrogated them yet because she had run out of truth serum. She had been about to torture them until they confessed, but she didn’t expect Jupiter to attack his teammates.","At that critical moment, Takeno jumped at Feng Wu.","He was trying to set Feng Wu on fire.","Takeno was the second most capable person in the team.","All five people were elite members of the Dongsang Kingdom. Otherwise, Mu Yan wouldn’t have invested so much in them.","Feng Wu was Takeno’s target.","Burning like a ball of fire, he tried to grab Feng Wu and take her down with him.","After Feng Wu dodged, he turned to her teammates instead.","He was much more capable than Shao Xiao and the others.","He was at least a Level 8 Spiritual Lord.","Feng Wu shouted, “Don’t let him catch you! He’ll kill you!”","She had planned everything down to the last detail, but she hadn’t expected them to hide explosives inside their bodies.","Jupiter had been taken by surprise and couldn’t activate his spiritual essence. As a result, he couldn’t take his own life and had to give Feng Wu the information after she fed him the truth serum.","He blew himself up after he regained a little spiritual essence.","Takeno’s spiritual essence was activated by the explosion, so he set himself on fire as well.","After Takeno, the other three followed suit.","Feng Wu didn’t expect the people of Dongsang Kingdom to be so undaunted by death.","Everything happened so fast.","Feng Wu ran fast. Seeing that her teammates didn’t have time to get away, she wrapped the Magic Soul Vine around them and pulled.","Jupiter’s eyes lit up when he saw the vine.","Magic Soul Vine!","The legendary Magic Soul Vine!","It had been lost from the Dongsang Kingdom for years.","The fate of the kingdom was related to the Magic Soul Vine.","Jupiter wanted to deliver the shocking news back home, but it was too late.","The next second, he exploded.","Everything was quiet for ten seconds.","When Feng Wu threw her teammates further away, she became the person closest to the explosion."]},{"number":2706,"title":"Chapter 2706 - Explosion","paragraphs":["When Feng Wu threw her teammates out of the way, she became the person closest to the explosion.","She coughed, and smoke came out of her mouth.","A thick layer of ash covered her back.","It was a result of the explosion.","Luckily, she was wearing the soft armor which Jun Linyuan had given her, and the flames couldn’t burn through it. However, her exposed skin was red and swollen, and the pain made her frown.","She ignored her injuries. Instead, she ran to her nearest teammate and helped him to his feet.","“Wang Zhi, how are you?”","Wang Zhi was almost suffocated by the smoke, but Feng Wu’s voice roused him from his stupor. He waved at Feng Wu and said, “I’m fine. Don’t worry about me.”","Feng Wu nodded and went to check on the others.","Luckily, their injuries were all superficial.","Shao Xiao said, “Fortunately, we’re all alive.”","Huo Shan patted his chest, still feeling shaken. “Does life mean nothing to the people of the Dongsang Kingdom? As if one explosion wasn’t enough, all five of them blew themselves up! What was going on in their minds?”","Wang Zhi said, “Their spiritual essence was blocked. How did they do it?”","Everyone looked at Feng Wu in confusion.","Feng Wu smiled wryly. “The people of the Dongsang Kingdom are as dauntless as they’re said to be. They injected themselves with an explosive potion before they set out. The tiniest amount of spiritual essence can set off an explosion.”","“That sounds ruthless.” Shao Xiao rubbed his nose. “They weren’t afraid of death, and they tried to bring us down with them.”","Ling Hao said, “You don’t say. The three people we weren’t able to interrogate took their lives as well.”","Feng Wu said, “I think they pre-set when the explosion would happen.”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","She added, “I thought at first that they set off the explosion because their spiritual essence recovered a little. However, the other three men killed themselves, too. It then occurred to me.”","She took a deep breath. “They knew they couldn’t get away after we stopped them from taking the poison, so they switched to ‘ready-to-explode’ mode.”","Everyone sucked in their breaths.","“They were so decisive,” Ling Hao said, still sounding terrified.","Feng Wu said, “That’s why their spies keep infiltrating the Junwu Empire, but only very few of us can infiltrate the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Everyone nodded, agreeing with her.","“Wait!” Shao Xiao cried out. “If they were impersonating Du Le and his teammates, does it mean the real people are...”","Feng Wu was frustrated. She had been too busy asking about the organization and had forgotten about Du Le.","Luckily, she had found out about Mu Yan and the fact that she was in Mulberry City. It wouldn’t be too difficult to get information about the real Du Le.","Shao Xiao asked, “What should we do now? Should we go back to the academy and notify the teachers?”","Ling Hao shrugged. “Those people blew themselves up. They’re a pile of ash now. What can we say?”","Shao Xiao turned to Feng Wu, feeling that she would have an idea what to do.","Feng Wu nodded. “I’ll talk to Mr. Gongsun about it.”","The others were surprised that Feng Wu knew Mr. Gongsun."]},{"number":2707,"title":"Chapter 2707 - Level 7 Inscription Master","paragraphs":["Shao Xiao had initially thought that Feng Wu just got along well with Mr. Yang. As it turned out, she knew Gongsun Mu, the vice principal of the academy.","Everyone nodded. “Alright!”","Feng Wu shrugged. “We have two options now.”","Everyone looked at her with sparkling eyes.","Feng Wu said, “Option one: we head for the formation core and get out of the Secret Essence Mine. Option two: we go to rescue them.”","Shao Xiao said, “I’m worried about Cheng Fang.”","Wang Zhi nodded. “After all, they’re our classmates.”","Ling Hao said, “I’ll do whatever Feng Wu says.”","Huo Shan said, “Me, too!”","Feng Wu shook her head after some consideration. “It’s too dangerous over there. If we all go together, I don’t think I’ll be able to protect all of you.”","“We’re not afraid of danger!” Shao Xiao said.","Feng Wu said grumpily, “I know you’re not, but our enemies are all as capable as Jupiter Team, whose leader was a Spiritual King. What will you do?”","That sounded ominous. Everyone gave Feng Wu pleading looks. They wanted to join her but didn’t want to become a burden.","Feng Wu said, “You’ll just stay on the side and watch?”","The others nodded.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She thought for a moment before making up her mind. “Let’s get to the core as soon as we can. I can only control the formation from there. That way, no one else will be able to get away.”","After a pause, Feng Wu added, “We can’t know for sure that there’s only one team like Jupiter Team.”","Everyone’s faces darkened, and they all nodded. “Let’s go.”","Feng Wu smiled a little before they set out.","She walked up to the wall which Jupiter Team had come out from.","It looked the same as all the other walls in the tunnels. No one would have thought that a group of people would walk out of it.","Feng Wu took out a strange-looking pen and began to draw peculiar signs on the wall. They looked familiar, but her team members couldn’t understand a word.","Before long, Feng Wu was done. She put away the pen and nodded. “Let’s go.”","Huo Shan asked curiously, “Feng Wu, what did you write? Why can’t I understand a single word?”","Feng Wu said, “They’re inscriptions.”","“Inscriptions?” Huo Shan’s eyes widened. “Feng Wu, you know inscriptions!”","“Know?”","Feng Wu mulled over the word before she nodded. “I suppose you can say that.”","“Are you an inscription master, then? A Level 1 inscription master?” Ling Hao cried out.","Level 1? Feng Wu shook her head. “No, I’m not.”","She was already a Level 7 inscription master, and was moving on to Level 8.","Ling Hao said, “You’re not? That’s alright. I heard it’s very difficult, and only insanely intelligent people can master it. Of course, Feng Wu isn’t insane!”","Feng Wu said, “We should get going.”","The Secret Essence Mine was a labyrinth to others, but it wasn’t too difficult for Feng Wu. She could understand its structure.","It didn’t take them long to reach the core.","It was unimaginable how they could find the right path among 80,000 tunnels. It was impossible.","But Feng Wu had done it.","“Is this the formation core?”"]},{"number":2708,"title":"Chapter 2708 - I Just Know","paragraphs":["“Is this the formation core?” Ling Hao looked around.","It wasn’t as narrow as the tunnels, where they had to walk in single file.","This place was a few hundred square meters wide.","In the center was a round platform. On the platform was a giant screen with a strange-looking handle.","Shao Xiao and the others looked at one another in bewilderment.","They had reached the formation core.","But they couldn’t see a way out of this place.","Feng Wu quickly walked up to the screen.","The others followed her, curious as to what she would do.","Feng Wu took out the inscription pen which she had used to draw on the wall and started writing on the screen.","No one knew what she was writing.","Even if they could see the signs she was drawing, they wouldn’t be able to read them.","Feng Wu wrote several lines, when something happened.","The dark screen lit up.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The screen was divided into nine sections, each showing an image.","They showed everything that was going on in the mine.","They weren’t still images, but were videos. Looking at the screen, it felt as if they were scanning the entire mine.","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","How did she know she could see the entire mine here at the core? Why did she know how to use that control handle?","In fact...","She hadn’t known at first.","She had never been here before.","However, she had Little Phoenix, who seemed to know a lot of things.","What Feng Wu didn’t tell the others was that the bird had been providing her with information along the way.","She didn’t know how the bird knew. According to Little Phoenix, it had visited this place in its previous life. It had even supervised the construction of this mine.","Feng Wu had been skeptical about this piece of information at first, but she began to change her mind as Little Phoenix proved that its information was accurate.","For instance, Little Phoenix told Feng Wu the password to switch on the screen.","“Look!” Ling Hao pointed at the bottom right square on the screen. “Isn’t that Shan Jingfei’s team? They’re in trouble!”","Feng Wu gave it a little tap, and the bottom right section occupied the entire screen.","Everyone stared at her in amazement.","Was that even possible?!","They were amazed by everything that was happening.","The screen was a novel object which they had never seen before.","Shao Xiao asked, “When did we ever have one of these screens? I heard they are made in Dongsang, but not here. How do you know how it works? Where did you learn that?”","Feng Wu said, “I just do.”","Compared with the tablet she used to have in her previous life, this screen was so basic.","To the native people of this world, it must look like a miracle.","“You just do?!” Ling Hao and the others stared at her.","Feng Wu said, “That’s irrelevant. Look!”","Everyone looked at the screen.","They saw that strange-looking magical beasts had surrounded Shan Jingfei and her companions.","There were ten of them in total.","Shan Jingfei’s team and Xuecheng Team had five members each. Both had capable members. However..."]},{"number":2709,"title":"Chapter 2709 - Spirit Stone Worms","paragraphs":["The snowy white magical beasts were squirming on the ground.","“They’re not worms, are they?” Huo Shan noticed the strange appearance of the magical beasts.","Feng Wu didn’t know what they were, but Little Phoenix was already talking in her head.","“Gosh, aren’t these Spirit Stone Worms? They’re longer than the height of humans now. That was fast.” The bird sounded amazed.","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Do you know what they are?”","Little Phoenix said, “Of course I do! I supervised the construction of this Secret Essence Mine! I know better than anyone else!”","Feng Wu suddenly realized something. “Didn’t Lu Mingzong, the founder of Imperial College, build this mine?”","Little Phoenix said, “Yes, he is your senior...”","It stopped abruptly, realizing that it had revealed some confidential information.","Feng Wu was curious.","“What did you say? Who is Lu Mingzong to me? Senior what?”","Little Phoenix wouldn’t say anything.","“Birdie?” Feng Wu asked.","“Don’t call me that! It sounds awful!” Little Phoenix complained.","Feng Wu said, “If you don’t answer me, I’ll call you birdie from now on.”","“You’re so annoying!” Feng Wu was driving the bird crazy. It was supposed to be Boss Phoenix, not some “birdie.” What a horrible nickname!","“Fine! Fine! I’ll tell you!” Little Phoenix snapped. “Lu Mingzong is your senior brother.”","“What?! My senior brother? As in my master’s eldest disciple?!”","“Yes.” Little Phoenix nodded.","Feng Wu said, “Wasn’t Lu Mingzong supposed to be the most powerful cultivator of the Junwu Empire before Master Linghu came along?”","Little Phoenix didn’t answer.","Feng Wu asked, “Where is he now? Rumor is that he’s gone missing, but no one can say for sure that he’s dead. Where is he?”","Little Phoenix still didn’t answer.","Feng Wu asked, “Why won’t you answer me? Am I missing something?”","Little Phoenix said, “You can call me whatever you want. I’m not going to tell you!”","Feng Wu pleaded, “But I want to know...”","Little Phoenix said, “In that case, you better finish the last two missions. That way, your beautiful master will wake up. He’s always doted on you. I’m sure you can trick him into telling you...","“If I say the wrong thing, he’ll probably strangle me!”","The bird wouldn’t admit that it was jealous.","Feng Wu had no idea what the bird was thinking. Seeing that she wasn’t going to get an answer, she said grumpily, “Fine! I’m working on it, but the task is so tricky!”","She had been working hard to convince Zuo Qingluan that Jun Linyuan was in love with her, but Zuo Qingluan just wouldn’t buy it.","Feng Wu decided that she would put more effort into it.","“Feng Wu? Feng Wu?”"]},{"number":2710,"title":"Chapter 2710 - Protective Circle (1)","paragraphs":["Shao Xiao and the others watched Feng Wu dubiously while she spoke to Little Phoenix.","“I see!” Feng Wu finally turned to her teammates and pointed at the worms on the screen. “These are Spirit Stone Worms. They’ve been feeding on spiritual stones for years and are filled with essence. They’re very beneficial for cultivation.”","However, the worms had surrounded Shan Jingfei and her friends.","“We should help them!” Ling Hao had a kind heart, and he turned to Feng Wu. “Shan Jingfei isn’t the most polite person, but she doesn’t deserve to die like this. I don’t think we should look the other way.”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu shook her head. “You’re not capable enough to rescue them. Instead of saving them, you’ll be surrounded by those worms, too. I won’t be able to save you all.","“That’s why you need to wait here while I go save them.” Feng Wu took Little Phoenix out of her sleeve, set it on the screen and said, “Keep me posted.”","Little Phoenix shook its head. “I don’t like the idea of you going alone. You have to take me with you.”","However, someone had to stay with the screen and tell Feng Wu what was happening in the rest of the mine.","“That’s easy.” With a wave of its wing, Little Phoenix switched off the screen and turned it into a mirror, which was small enough to sit on its head.","“You can take it everywhere with you,” Little Phoenix said proudly. “I told you already: I built this mine, and I’m its master.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Search VipNovel/ C0M on google","They were talking in the bird’s language, which the others didn’t understand. They watched in bewilderment, wondering what Feng Wu and the bird were talking about.","Feng Wu asked, “Will the worms attack my team?”","Little Phoenix said matter-of-factly, “Of course they will!”","Feng Wu asked, “How can I protect them?”","Little Phoenix didn’t say anything. It landed in a clear area, drew a circle that was six meters in diameter, and lifted its tail.","It then pooped on the spot.","Was that something “Boss Phoenix” was supposed to do?","Read more on VjpNovel- C0M","Seeing how shocked Feng Wu was, Little Phoenix said, “As long as they don’t leave this circle, I guarantee you they’ll stay alive!”","Feng Wu glanced at her teammates.","Ling Hao said, “Feng Wu, are you going to do something about this unhygienic bird?”","Unhygienic?","Aggrieved, Little Phoenix smacked Ling Hao’s head with its wing.","“Ouch!” It was so painful that Ling Hao almost burst into tears.","That hurt!","Please reading on VjpNovel, C0M","Feng Wu cleared her throat. “Alright. Just wait for me in this circle. It’s safer that way.”","“In this circle? Is that a joke?” Ling Hao almost jumped to his feet.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “Just go inside the circle if the Spirit Stone Worms attack you. The circle will keep you alive. Now, I’ll go rescue the others.”","She had seen Cheng Fang on the screen just then.","She had taken a risk when she let Cheng Fang leave.","If Cheng Fang could find Shan Jingfei and her team, Feng Wu didn’t mind giving them a hand."]},{"number":2711,"title":"Chapter 2711 - Protective Circle (2)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu dashed off immediately after that.","Ling Hao sat on a rock, crestfallen.","Shao Xiao didn’t seem very happy either.","Ling Hao said, “She just left us here! Are we not useful at all? Will we just cause her more trouble? I don’t believe it!”","Shao Xiao said, “Haven’t we been a burden to Feng Wu all along?”","Ling Hao glared at him.","Shao Xiao shrugged. “Can you give me an example when we weren’t a burden?”","Ling Hao was speechless.","Just then —","“Watch out!” Huo Shan jumped to his feet when he saw a big, fat Spirit Stone Worm crawl into sight.","They had seen from the big screen how terrifying they were.","The worms might look soft, chubby and harmless, but their teeth were sharp enough to tear one to pieces.","These worms ate spiritual stones. Could they be harmless?","“Let’s kill it!” Ling Hao lashed out at the worm. “If I’m correct, it’s a Class B magical beast at its peak, right?”","Wang Zhi did some calculations and nodded. “That’s right. By the academy’s standard, its crystal core is at that level.”","Ling Hao was thrilled. “Guys, let’s take its crystal core! Doesn’t Feng Wu want to be first? Let’s give her a hand!”","Wang Zhi found his suggestion idiotic. “How many worms do you think you can kill? Get back here.”","Ling Hao shook his head. “That ugly little bird drew a circle and pooped in it. Do you seriously think it can protect us? If that’s the case, why do we bother to cultivate at all?”","Huo Shan said, “I have faith in Feng Wu. If she says it’ll work, then it’ll work. However, that’s only the last resort. I’m curious to find out how powerful the Spirit Stone Worms are. Ling Hao, shall we do it together?”","Ling Hao said, “Good idea!”","As it turned out, the Spirit Stone Worm was as formidable as it was said to be.","These magical beasts had lived in these underground tunnels for years and fed on spiritual stones.","Thump!","The two of them couldn’t kill that worm. In the end, Shao Xiao and Wang Zhi had to give them a hand.","“Phew...” Ling Hao heaved a sigh. “Gosh, it was so hard to kill, and that was only one worm...”","Huo Shan said, “There can’t be a lot of them. Trust me...”","However, he paled before he could finish the sentence.","He stared at the opening of the tunnel.","What was wrong?","The others were scared out of their wits when they looked in that direction.","Spirit Stone Worms!","There were so many of them!","More than they could count!","Everywhere they looked, there were big, fat Spirit Stone Worms that were each the size of a grown man!","“Holy crap...”","“OMG...”","“No way!”","They were all alarmed.","That was crazy!","How could there be so many of them?","Had they caught the scent of human flesh and followed it here?","“What should we do now?” Ling Hao was as white as a sheet."]},{"number":2712,"title":"Chapter 2712 - Protective Circle (3)","paragraphs":["There had to be thousands of them.","The four of them had to fight together to defeat one Spirit Stone Worm, and two worms could probably finish them all. There were thousands of worms out there...","Without hesitation, Huo Shan ran toward the circle Little Phoenix had drawn.","Shao Xiao and Wang Zhi looked at each other, both wondering if the circle would stop the worms.","However, they didn’t have any other choice.","There was no way they could defeat all the worms.","Those worms didn’t even need to do anything. They could easily crush them with their weight alone.","Everyone jumped into the circle except for Ling Hao.","The worms crawled toward them. The antennas on their heads were shaped like bolts, their bulging eyes glinted coldly, and their tongues flicked the way a snake’s would. It was a bone-chilling sight.","They moved very fast and reached the team in no time.","The look in their eyes reminded one of hungry wolves.","After being stuck here for so many years, they missed the taste of fresh human flesh.","Seeing that Ling Hao had frozen on the spot, Shao Xiao ran out of the circle and dragged him into it before the worms reached him.","Only then did Ling Hao realize what was going to happen.","“Are we going to die? Are they going to eat us? I don’t want to die...” He was so frightened that he was almost in tears.","Shao Xiao was trembling as well, but he forced himself to calm down and fought back his fear. “We have to trust Feng Wu. I’m sure we’ll be fine.”","Only a moment ago, they had been complaining about Feng Wu, but now, they realized that they really would have been a burden to her.","How humiliating...","The worms soon reached them.","The circle wasn’t all that big, and the worms were already two meters long.","They moved closer and closer.","Everyone was frightened out of their wits, when the worms stopped.","The leader of the worms had frightening eyes and was as long as five meters.","It was at least a Spiritual King.","When it stopped, the other worms stopped as well.","It seemed the other worms would follow their leader’s order without question.","The leader stretched out its head and sniffed around as if it was perplexed. It seemed to be searching for an old memory. Suddenly, it screeched in fear.","It was an ear-splitting noise.","The sound almost knocked the team out.","Ling Hao burst into tears, thinking that he was going to die for sure.","Just then, the leader of the worms spun around and ran back into the tunnel as fast as it could manage.","The other worms seemed bewildered, because they weren’t as sensitive as their leader.","However, it didn’t take them long to recover the same memory. The terror of the past haunted them once more."]},{"number":2713,"title":"Chapter 2713 - Protective Circle (4)","paragraphs":["They all started retreating as if someone was hunting them.","They disappeared as fast as they had arrived.","Ling Hao was still screaming.","Shao Xiao grabbed his shoulder and shook him. “Stop! We’re safe! They’re gone!”","It took Ling Hao a while to quiet down because he had covered his ears with his hands. He raised his head and looked at Shao Xiao in bewilderment.","Gradually, his hearing recovered.","He could hear what Shao Xiao was saying.","“The worms are all gone! We’re safe! We’re going to live!” Shao Xiao repeated loudly.","Hearing this, Ling Hao looked around.","He remembered that they had been surrounded by thousands of Spirit Stone Worms.","But they were nowhere to be seen now.","Had it not been for the slime on the ground, he would think he had been dreaming.","Ling Hao asked, “Are they all gone?”","The others nodded. “Yes.”","Ling Hao said, “They stopped trying to eat us because we hid in the circle, is that it?”","The others nodded again. “Yes.”","Ling Hao said, “What kind of bird was that?”","The others were amazed as well.","Where did that bird come from?","The worms only smelled its poop, and they were scared out of their wits...","“Why do I feel like that bird has dealt with these worms before?” Huo Shan said curiously.","“That’s impossible,” said Shao Xiao. “This mine has been buried underground for many years, but that bird is about the same age as Feng Wu. How can it have seen the worms before? I think it has something to do with its bloodline.”","“We owe her one again.” Ling Hao was crestfallen. “Actually, we owe the bird a favor this time...”","Shao Xiao smiled bitterly. “We should be used to it by now. We’ll repay her little by little, I guess.”","They admired Feng Wu even more.","That bird was definitely one of the legendary divine beasts, but Feng Wu was its master. What did that mean?","A divine beast had recognized Feng Wu’s ability!","If that was the case...","No other student in Imperial College was Feng Wu’s match!","Meanwhile...","Led by Little Phoenix, Feng Wu headed for where Shan Jingfei was.","Shan Jingfei and her friends had run into many difficulties along the way.","They entered the Secret Essence Mine before Feng Wu did, but they soon got lost.","There were countless tunnels underground, and they soon got lost. Moreover, they also ran into the Spirit Stone Worms from the very beginning.","At first, the worms appeared one at a time.","Shan Jingfei was glad.","She thought she would obtain enough crystal cores from these magical beasts.","Xuecheng Team was with her, and they killed those beasts easily.","However, things didn’t remain that way.","More and more worms appeared.","At first, they came in threes and fives. Then, there were 10, 20 and even 30 of them.","Xuecheng Team could still handle 30 worms.","However, there were soon hundreds of worms.","Shan Jingfei burst into tears when they were surrounded by countless worms."]},{"number":2714,"title":"Chapter 2714 - Critical Moment (1)","paragraphs":["“What should we do now?!” Ye Han and her teammates were cornered in a narrow cave.","They were surrounded by Spirit Stone Worms in all directions.","Spirit Stone Worms charged at them like endless waves.","They were gigantic creatures with bulging eyes which glinted coldly as they gnashed their teeth.","They were ready to tear the eleven people to pieces.","After Cheng Fang found them, the group now had eleven members.","Xuecheng Team had the more capable members, so three of them stopped the attack from the front.","Two other members stayed in the rear, fighting back the worms that were following them.","The narrow tunnel was blocked by the dead bodies of the worms, which made them think they were safe.","However, they soon realized that they were too naive.","The worms began to devour the bodies of their own kin.","“Oh my god!” Shan Jingfei was nauseated by the sight. “They’re eating their own kind! That’s insane!”","They trembled as they watched the worms tear apart the bodies with their sharp teeth. Their stomachs churned.","“Are we going to die? I don’t want to die!” Ye Han was terrified when she was forced to face the possibility of death.","Xuecheng Team went on killing the worms, guarding the others from the front and the back. They had no problem fighting a couple of worms at a time, but they were only human, and would get tired eventually.","They were already covered with worm bites and were getting weaker.","“They’re not only disgusting, their bites are venomous as well!” Ye Han panicked. “What should we do now? Xuecheng Team can’t hold them back for much longer...”","Shan Jingfei was furious. She glared at Xuecheng Team and complained, “I thought Qiu Zeyu would find me some capable students. They’re not that useful, after all!”","Ye Hongxue hadn’t been all that keen to help Shan Jingfei in the first place.","They had only accepted the request to obtain a certain number of crystal cores, not protect some girl.","They were doing these students a favor. They weren’t obliged to help them out.","Instead of thanking them for their kindness, Shan Jingfei was complaining. Who the hell did she think she was, a princess?","Ye Hongxue smirked. “Fine. If we’re not good enough, do it on your own!”","After that, Ye Hongxue walked back to the team and sat on the ground to recover her strength.","“You!” Shan Jingfei stared at her in disbelief. “How dare you?!”","Ye Hongxue met her eyes. “Watch me! I don’t owe you anything!”","Shan Jingfei considered herself the most popular girl in the school, and all boys were supposed to be in love with her. She gritted her teeth and sneered at Ye Hongxue. “Have you forgotten your mission? You accepted the request!”","She had never seen Ye Hongxue as a senior student.","Ye Hongxue meant nothing to her.","However, Ye Hongxue wasn’t threatened. “Have you forgotten what our mission is?”"]},{"number":2715,"title":"Chapter 2715 - Critical Moment (2)","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei looked at Ye Hongxue in bewilderment.","Ye Hongxue snorted. “Our mission was to help you get 20 Class B crystal cores.”","Shan Jingfei wanted to retort, but Ye Hongxue glanced at her. “We’ve killed way over 20 Spirit Stone Worms for you. Our mission is complete.”","Shan Jingfei was embarrassed.","The praise she had received over the years had made her too arrogant. She couldn’t believe anyone would dare treat her this way.","Shan Jingfei ground her teeth. “Are you saying you’re not going to help us anymore?”","Ye Hongxue smirked. “I don’t know about your relationship with Qiu Zeyu, but he didn’t hire us to protect you since it would be too expensive.”","Shan Jingfei looked like she had been slapped. “He didn’t know I would be in danger. Otherwise...”","Ye Hongxue cut her off. “I don’t care, and I don’t want to know. The bottom line is that Xuecheng Team has completed the mission. Your safety is none of our business!”","Shan Jingfei said, “But you’re a Class A student and our senior...”","“As your senior, I’m going to give you a warning.” Ye Hongxue rolled her eyes at Shan Jingfei. “I’m doing you a big favor here, and I’m not obliged to help you, so keep your mouth shut! I’ll throw you to the worms if you annoy me again!”","“You!”","Shan Jingfei was furious.","Her face had turned scarlet red because she had never been humiliated like this before. However, she didn’t dare say a word.","She realized how displeased Ye Hongxue had become.","“Xue Hao...” She changed her approach and turned to Xue Hao instead.","However, Ye Hongxue glared at Xue Hao before Shan Jingfei could finish. “Xue Hao, I’ll be our team’s acting captain for a while. Agreed?”","In a critical moment like this, no one wanted to deal with Shan Jingfei’s whining, so Xue Hao immediately said, “Great! I like that idea!”","Ye Hongxue glanced at Shan Jingfei, who looked like she was about to explode.","Ye Hongxue went on, “Since I’m the captain now, I order you to come back here and take a break!”","Xue Hao said, “Who will fight off the worms?”","Ye Hongxue said, “Don’t they have the great captain Shan Jingfei? She’s supposed to be the top student in Class B. She shouldn’t hide behind us and make us protect her. She’ll be going to Peace Grassland soon, and she needs the practice. Go on!”","Xue Hao and his teammates cleared their throats. They came back, sat down next to Ye Hongxue, and started to recover their strength.","Shan Jingfei and her team were under a lot of pressure.","Ye Hongxue was right. Because Xuecheng Team had been protecting the others, Shan Jingfei and her team had the energy to stay at the back and complain.","After Xuecheng Team fell back, Shan Jingfei and the others had to face the worms on their own.","Shan Jingfei was in tears when she saw the drooling worms.","Infuriated, she shouted at Cheng Fang.","“It’s all your fault!”","Cheng Fang was dumbfounded. “What?”","He had been worried about them and had come back to help them despite the danger. Was this what he got in return?","Shan Jingfei didn’t dare criticize Ye Hongxue, so she lashed out at Cheng Fang."]},{"number":2716,"title":"Chapter 2716 - Critical Moment (3)","paragraphs":["“If we hadn’t followed you, we would never have walked into this tunnel!","“And if we hadn’t walked into this tunnel, we would never have run into so many worms!","“It’s all your fault! You’re going to get us killed!”","Cheng Fang was dumbfounded. “I...”","Shan Jingfei said, “Your paper crane can’t be trusted! We shouldn’t have followed it!”","Cheng Fang tried to explain. “We can trust it! It knows the way! Feng Wu gave it to me and told me I could lead you out of the cave if I just followed the bird. We can get to the formation core...”","Shan Jingfei smirked and glanced at Ye Han.","Ye Han immediately slapped Cheng Fang.","Cheng Fang was shocked. “Ye Han, you...”","Ye Han was furious. “Cheng Fang, you idiot!”","Cheng Fang didn’t know what he had done wrong.","Ye Han said, “Did you say Feng Wu gave you the paper crane? Have you forgotten the grudge she holds against us? How can you trust her?","“Fine, you can trust her if you want to, but why did you bring us into it?","“That paper crane can lead us out of here and take us to the core? Do you even hear yourself?","“Feng Wu hates Shan Jingfei and me. She would kill us at the first opportunity! She wouldn’t lead us somewhere safe!","“Plus, she’s only human! She can’t predict where we are, nor does she know the core!","“If she finds the formation core, she’ll let that paper bird take us in the opposite direction! She’ll send us to some worm nest!","“She doesn’t know where the core is, she’s simply making things up!","“In a word, she’s evil!","“You didn’t tell us in the beginning that the crane came from Feng Wu!”","Cheng Fang was overwhelmed by everything she said. “I wanted to tell you, but you would shout at me as soon as I mentioned her name...”","Ye Han said, “You knew it, then. Cheng Fang, can’t you tell that Feng Wu wants to kill us? You’re her accomplice!”","Cheng Fang was almost in tears. “No, it’s not like that. Feng Wu really can...”","Ye Han wanted to choke him.","Xin Zhixuan frowned. “Stop it! Help us with the worms! We can’t hold them back much longer!”","Xuecheng Team was resting, and the remaining six people in the group weren’t nearly as capable. They had to work together just to fight off one worm.","Luckily, the tunnel was narrow, and the worms could only come in one at a time. Otherwise, they would have long been dead.","It was easy to fight off the worms at first, but there were so many of them.","Killing one worm didn’t make any difference.","When one fell, another would take its place.","The worms learned from their failure.","The worm at the front would push the dead body back so that the other worms could chew on it. It would then have direct access to human flesh.","Yes, in their eyes, humans were no more than lumps of fresh meat.","15 minutes passed in that way.","Ye Han screamed.","A worm had snatched her sword."]},{"number":2717,"title":"Chapter 2717 - Critical Moment (4)","paragraphs":["The worm’s teeth were so sharp that it chewed on the sword and swallowed it.","It ate the sword.","If it could eat metal without difficulty, what about human flesh?","Everyone paled.","Ye Han was still shocked, when a worm bit down on her neck.","“Ah!”","Ye Han reacted quickly enough. The worm missed her neck and bit her on the shoulder.","It buried its teeth in her flesh, and blood gushed out.","Needless to say, it was excruciating. The worse thing was that the worms also fed on rotten meat they found underground, and their saliva was poisonous!","Ye Han was terrified and screamed at the top of her lungs.","Before long, Shan Jingfei was injured as well.","A worm bit her on the calf.","She screamed and kicked the worm away, but it was too late.","Her calf was swollen, and the affected area was expanding.","Shan Jingfei felt dizzy. Was she going to die?","More people were injured and fell.","The situation was becoming more serious.","Just then, they heard a strange chewing sound.","“What’s that?” Ye Han was resting, and she cried out when she heard it.","She searched for the source of the noise.","What she saw terrified her.","Because!","It was coming from the walls.","The tunnel was only wide enough for one person to pass through, and it had helped to block the worms out. However, they were gnawing on the stone walls now.","They were creating large holes in the walls now.","To be more precise, they had widened the tunnels.","Multiple tunnels led to the place the students were in, and when the openings were widened, the tunnels combined into one.","The space had opened up.","Shan Jingfei and her friends turned ghastly pale. They trembled from head to toe and thought they were going to die here.","Even members of Xuecheng Team seemed frightened.","The worms made gloating sounds as they crawled toward their meal.","“I don’t want to die!” Ye Han screamed.","Shan Jingfei tried to contact Qiu Zeyu, but here in the mine, they were completely cut off from the outside world.","“Can someone help us? I don’t want to die! If someone can save us, I promise I’ll do whatever I can to repay them!”","However, nobody answered their distress call.","50 worms...","100...","200...","It was as if all the worms in the mine were moving toward them.","Shan Jingfei and the others lost all hope.","They had never been so close to death before.","The inevitable was about to happen.","“Hey!”","They suddenly heard a different sound.","They looked up.","They then saw a colorful bird that was only the size of a fist.","It landed on Shan Jingfei’s head."]},{"number":2718,"title":"Chapter 2718 - Thief (1)","paragraphs":["Everyone stared at the bird on Shan Jingfei’s head.","“Isn’t that Feng Wu’s bird?”","“What’s it doing here? Why is it on Shan Jingfei’s head?”","“What does it want?”","Shan Jingfei couldn’t see it, but she knew something was on her head.","Of course, she wouldn’t let a bird stand there. It was so humiliating. She wanted to brush the bird away.","However, she was feverish from the worms’ toxin and was too weak to lift a finger.","What kind of bird was that?","Meanwhile, the bird was looking at the worms.","The Spirit Stone Worms weren’t intimidated at first. They even glared at Little Phoenix.","However, the bird then did something else.","Everyone heard the sound of flowing water.","What was that?","They looked at one another in bewilderment.","Then it occurred to them.","OMG!","It was that bird!","It had peed on Shan Jingfei’s head!","The pee was actually meant for the worms.","But still, it was unbelievable.","Ye Han stared at Shan Jingfei in astonishment.","Shan Jingfei had no idea what had happened, until she picked up the smell.","The stench...","Shan Jingfei was furious, but she felt so weak that she was close to fainting.","“Get it off me! Kill it!” she bellowed.","Cheng Fang said, “No, don’t do that! It’s Feng Wu’s bird!”","Feng Wu! Her again!","That name made Shan Jingfei want to throw up.","What happened next infuriated her further.","Feng Wu showed up.","She effortlessly made her way through the worms, finishing each worm with a single blow.","Little Phoenix flew away from Shan Jingfei and went to help its master.","Soon, Feng Wu killed most of the worms surrounding the team.","They were amazed by her speed and skills.","They were also still amazed by the bird, and by the time they looked around them again, they saw that the ground was covered in dead worms.","Feng Wu turned to Ye Hongxue. “Could you help me pick up the crystal cores, please?”","She had saved Ye Hongxue’s life once, and Ye Hongxue was glad to return the favor.","Plus, Feng Wu had just saved them again.","Ye Hongxue summoned her team. Together, they picked up all the crystal cores for Feng Wu.","Feng Wu didn’t come here just to save Shan Jingfei. She wasn’t that nice.","She realized she hadn’t obtained enough crystal cores to make first place or support her future cultivation. Therefore, she had come all the way here to harvest some more.","She drew out her Fallen Star Sword and activated the three stances and Ground Control.","As if they were put under a spell, the worms remained motionless while Feng Wu cut them down one after another.","Their bodies were scattered all over the ground.","It was efficient.","Feng Wu killed over 100 worms in less than five minutes.","The others were amazed. Why did the worms just remain still and let Feng Wu kill them?"]},{"number":2719,"title":"Chapter 2719 - Thief (2)","paragraphs":["“We can’t just sit here!”","Shan Jingfei had recovered some strength, and an idea suddenly struck her.","If Feng Wu took all the crystal cores here, she would probably become first in this hunt.","However, Shan Jingfei was supposed to have secured that place.","Therefore, she knew she had to intervene.","If they all started killing the worms, Feng Wu wouldn’t be able to claim all the crystal cores, and everyone would take a portion. That was Shan Jingfei’s plan.","Despite still feeling weak, Shan Jingfei charged at the worms.","But —","She couldn’t even get close enough.","Thump!","She ran into an invisible shield and bounced off of it.","Not only that, she landed on a dead worm that had its mouth open.","“Ouch!”","One couldn’t begin to imagine how that would feel.","Ye Han and Xin Zhixuan rushed to her side, and tried to drag her out.","It was probably because they also felt weak, but it took them forever to drag Shan Jingfei from the slimy mouth of that worm.","Xin Zhixuan feigned a cheerful tone. “You were so lucky, Jingfei. The worm was already dead when you fell into its mouth. Otherwise...”","Shan Jingfei shook with rage.","She ignored Xin Zhixuan and just stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was still cutting down Spirit Stone Worms.","The worms didn’t even try to dodge, and they let Feng Wu slice them open.","There were so many crystal cores!","“Why couldn’t I get to her?” Shan Jingfei wondered.","Ye Hongxue walked past her at that moment and gave her an indescribable look.","Seeing Ye Hongxue, Shan Jingfei shouted, “Hongxue, give me a hand!”","Ye Hongxue was baffled.","Shan Jingfei said, “Come here! I’m going to fall!”","She decided that Ye Hongxue should serve her instead of helping Feng Wu.","She thought Ye Hongxue would come to her as soon as she made the request. However, Ye Hongxue only rolled her eyes at her.","She then ignored Shan Jingfei and walked toward Feng Wu.","She didn’t even say a word to Shan Jingfei.","Shan Jingfei had never been so angry in her life.","She stared at Ye Hongxue from behind and said in a threatening tone, “Ye Hongxue, are you going to disobey me?”","Ye Hongxue stopped.","Shan Jingfei laughed inwardly, thinking that Ye Hongxue had to listen to her after all.","She shouted at Ye Hongxue, “Give me all the crystal cores you have!”","Ye Hongxue turned around and looked at her in resignation, wondering when this princess would face reality.","Shan Jingfei took her reaction for fear, so she stared at Ye Hongxue and urged, “Can’t you hear me? Give me all your crystal cores!”","She was going to reap what she hadn’t sown and steal all the crystal cores Feng Wu had worked so hard to obtain.","The idea soothed Shan Jingfei.","To her surprise, Ye Hongxue said, “You idiot.”","What?"]},{"number":2720,"title":"Chapter 2720 - Thief (3)","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei couldn’t believe her ears. “What did you say?”","Xin Zhixuan and Ye Han heard every word.","They were shocked.","Ye Hongxue took a step forward and stared at Shan Jingfei. “I thought that being the top student and class president of Class B, you would be smarter than the others. I see now that calling you a pig is an insult to pigs!”","What? Shan Jingfei pointed at Ye Hongxue, not knowing what to say.","Ye Hongxue could be very mean when she wanted to.","“Pigs at least have eyes. Where are yours? Are you blind?”","Shan Jingfei said, “You...”","Ye Hongxue gave Shan Jingfei one last glance before walking away.","Shan Jingfei screamed.","She was furious.","She decided that things were a wreck now, and these people all wanted to take advantage of the situation. What a snobbish bunch!","“I’ll remember this, Ye Hongxue! You won’t get away with it!”","Shan Jingfei was so angry that she couldn’t think straight.","She jumped to her feet, but no one paid any attention to her.","She forced herself to calm down.","“No, I have to control myself. Screaming like this will only destroy my image. I need to come up with a plan.”","She looked at the other members of Xuecheng Team.","Coercion had failed, so she had to change her approach.","Shan Jingfei told Xin Zhixuan, “I need you to do something for me.”","Ye Han stared at Shan Jingfei in astonishment.","The girl had been screaming a moment ago, but now, she was perfectly composed.","She could control herself so well.","What a scary woman. Ye Han felt a chill go down her spine.","However, Xin Zhixuan knew Shan Jingfei well enough to see this coming. She didn’t seem surprised at all.","“Go ahead.” Xin Zhixuan nodded.","Shan Jingfei whispered something in Xin Zhixuan’s ear.","Xin Zhixuan hesitated, but her stomach lurched when she saw the warning look in Shan Jingfei’s eyes. She immediately nodded. “Yes, of course.”","Xin Zhixuan went to talk to Lin Juncheng, who had always been the more friendly one.","Shan Jingfei smirked.","“Feng Wu, you’re about 100 years too young to work against me!”","Feng Wu had killed all the Spirit Stone Worms frozen to the spot by Ground Control.","The worms further away had all escaped, frightened either by the Fallen Star Sword or by Little Phoenix.","They were nowhere to be seen.","They had abandoned the bodies of their dead companions.","Ye Hongxue counted the crystal cores she had collected. There were 300 in total.","Someone stopped her when she was about to give the crystal cores to Feng Wu.","Ye Hongxue stared at Shan Jingfei in disbelief. Had she lost her mind? She had told Shan Jingfei that the crystal cores belonged to Feng Wu.","“Thank you for gathering the crystal cores for me. I’ll take it from here.”","Shan Jingfei smiled.","The smile creeped Ye Hongxue out.","“Shan Jingfei, are you deaf?”"]},{"number":2721,"title":"Chapter 2721 - Thief (4)","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei shook her head. “No, I’m not.”","Ye Hongxue asked, “So, you don’t understand the language I’m speaking.”","Shan Jingfei chuckled. “I bet I know more languages than you do.”","Ye Hongxue said, “In that case, listen carefully: Feng Wu is the one who earned these crystal cores, and she asked me to help her gather them. I’m giving them to her now. Understand? Do I need to repeat it for you?”","Shan Jingfei was still smiling. “Hongxue, I think you’re the one who doesn’t understand what’s going on.”","Shan Jingfei sounded like she thought everyone else was an idiot.","Where did she get that kind of courage?","What did she know that other people didn’t?","The others eyed her suspiciously and wondered what she was planning.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had finished killing the Spirit Stone Worms. Hearing the argument, she came over to see what was going on.","She wanted to know what ridiculous thing Shan Jingfei was trying now.","Ye Hongxue frowned a little. “What’s that supposed to mean?”","Shan Jingfei looked at Lin Juncheng and smiled. “Do you not know?”","Ye Hongxue asked, “What am I supposed to know?”","Shan Jingfei said, “I told Zeyu earlier that I might run into danger here, so I’m sure when he gave you the mission, that included the request to protect me and make sure I have enough crystal cores to become first.”","Ye Hongxue said, “No, he didn’t.”","Shan Jingfei said, “Yes, he did, but you forgot.”","Ye Hongxue said, “No, I didn’t. He only gave us one mission. We only needed to get 20 peak Class B crystal cores.”","Shan Jingfei said, “Maybe he gave you a second mission.”","Ye Hongxue said, “There was no such mission!”","Shan Jingfei said, “Maybe you weren’t the one who accepted that mission.”","She sounded very pleased when she said that.","Ye Hongxue frowned.","Shan Jingfei said, “Why don’t you ask your teammates? Maybe someone else might know.”","Ye Hongxue rolled her eyes at her.","Shan Jingfei said, “Maybe Zeyu even specified in the request that you should defeat whoever tries to pick on me.”","Ye Hongxue laughed. That was pure delusion!","Shan Jingfei sounded quite confident. “Hongxue, don’t laugh. I’m not making it up. Someone told me in person.”","“Who told you that?” Ye Hongxue was ready to slap someone.","Shan Jingfei glanced at Lin Juncheng.","Ye Hongxue didn’t know what to say. Was this girl dreaming?","Shan Jingfei pointed at Feng Wu and said viciously, “She offended me! I’m ordering you to kill her right now!”","Ye Hongxue was speechless.","She was astonished.","This girl had to be out of her mind!","Everyone gave Shan Jingfei strange looks when she pointed at Feng Wu.","Shan Jingfei frowned and gave Lin Juncheng a warning look.","Say something!","Lin Juncheng smiled bitterly. Why did they have to pick him?","“Didn’t you tell me that Zeyu gave you a second mission?” Shan Jingfei stared at him. “Tell everyone if it’s true!”","Lin Juncheng said hesitantly, “Can’t we just let it be?”","Shan Jingfei smirked.","Let it be? She had been humiliated! Of course she couldn’t let it be!","“Just tell us the truth! Wasn’t the second mission from Zeyu to follow my orders and get back at whoever offends me?”"]},{"number":2722,"title":"Chapter 2722 - You Idiot","paragraphs":["Everyone looked from Shan Jingfei to Lin Juncheng.","Lin Juncheng remained silent.","Ye Hongxue glared at him. “Answer the question!”","Shan Jingfei also stared at him. “Yes, answer the question! Tell them that Zeyu gave you that mission!”","She couldn’t wait to see what would happen next.","She was so confident that Lin Juncheng would say yes.","To her surprise, when Lin Juncheng spoke, he gave her a bitter smile.","“Shan Jingfei, I’m going to turn down your bribe.”","Bribe?","Did Shan Jingfei try to bribe Lin Juncheng?","Ye Hongxue and her teammates were already seeing Lin Juncheng in a different light, and his reply made them even more suspicious. Ye Hongxue asked, “What bribe? Why did she want to bribe you?”","Shan Jingfei was dumbfounded. She couldn’t understand why this was happening.","Lin Juncheng smiled bitterly. Instead of answering Ye Hongxue, he turned to Shan Jingfei and said in resignation, “I didn’t want to say it because it would affect your reputation, but you kept pushing me.”","Shan Jingfei ground her teeth and glowered at him.","He had turned her down.","Ye Hongxue asked, “What did she force you to do?”","Lin Juncheng didn’t answer, but Ye Hongxue was smart enough to deduce the truth from Shan Jingfei’s past behavior.","She asked, “Did she ask you to make up the story about a second mission?”","Lin Juncheng nodded.","Ye Hongxue said, “How dumb is she?”","Lin Juncheng said, “Very, I guess.”","Very? Furious, Shan Jingfei glared at Ye Hongxue.","Ye Hongxue only shook her head at her. “You’re such an idiot.”","Shan Jingfei’s face went scarlet red.","This wasn’t the first time that Ye Hongxue had called her an idiot.","Ye Hongxue didn’t know what to say. “Is that pretty head of yours just for decoration? Do you ever use your eyes?","“My entire team working together couldn’t hold off those Spirit Stone Worms, but Feng Wu killed hundreds of them all by herself!","“If the others hadn’t fled, she would have killed a lot more!","“Has it ever occurred to you that she can probably defeat my whole team with a single strike?”","Shan Jingfei felt as if she had been struck by lightning.","That abominable Ye Hongxue!","Her words were even more annoying than she was herself!","“You know we can’t possibly defeat Feng Wu, but you tried to send us on a suicide mission. Do you seriously think we are as dumb as you are?”","Shan Jingfei was utterly speechless.","Ye Hongxue was saying nothing but the truth, which was something Shan Jingfei hated to admit.","Ye Hongxue ground her teeth. “Was that your plan? To drag more people to their doom? If Lin Juncheng accepted your bribe and said yes, we would have died because of you!","“You think too highly of yourself!”","“You!” Shan Jingfei retorted. “You haven’t fought her! Why do you think you can’t defeat her?!”","Ye Hongxue shouted, “Everybody in my team knows that!”"]},{"number":2723,"title":"Chapter 2723 - You Hypocrite","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei said, “Do you think she’s a capable fighter because she killed all those Spirit Stone Worms? That’s not her real ability!”","She then pointed at the urine on the ground. “The worms ran away because of this! Feng Wu didn’t kill the worms on her own! That ugly bird helped her!”","Ugly bird? Little Phoenix didn’t like that at all.","Ye Hongxue said, “You’re hopeless! Lin Juncheng, tell her.”","Lin Juncheng cleared his throat.","He and Ye Hongxue had feelings for each other, and he could understand Ye Hongxue’s reaction when she heard that Shan Jingfei tried to bribe him.","However, Shan Jingfei was a pretty girl, and Lin Juncheng didn’t want to make things too difficult for her.","He smiled wryly. “Jingfei, Feng Wu is more capable than you think...”","Shan Jingfei shook her head. “No, she had help from...”","Ye Hongxue couldn’t take it anymore. “What help? When my team was attacked by a Flame Snow Lion, Feng Wu saved us all by herself!”","What?!","The news shocked everyone else.","Feng Wu had saved Xuecheng Team!","Xuecheng was a Class A team, and was one of the teams that was above average.","“That’s impossible!” Shan Jingfei turned pale and shook her head repeatedly. “You’re lying! It’s a lie!”","If Feng Wu could save an entire team, then her cultivation level... Shan Jingfei really felt like an idiot now when she recalled how she had ordered Xuecheng Team to give her the crystal cores and punish Feng Wu for her.","Ye Hongxue glanced at her in satisfaction. “Now you see how dumb you are.”","Shan Jingfei murmured, “She saved your lives, you said?”","Ye Hongxue said, “Yup.”","Shan Jingfei asked, “When? When did that happen?”","Ye Hongxue said, “Before we fell into this mine.”","Shan Jingfei shouted, “Then why did you accept the mission?!”","Ye Hongxue rolled her eyes. “If we had known that your rival was our savior, we would never have accepted the mission!”","Shan Jingfei shouted at Feng Wu, “Why did you hide your true ability? Do you enjoy mocking other people? You’re such a hypocrite!”","Feng Wu snapped, “When did I hide my ability?”","Shan Jingfei said, “Yes, you did! If you hadn’t, why would we have misjudged you? You pretended to be so weak in class! You didn’t retort when other people said you’re the weakest student in our class! You’re so fake!”","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. “Yes, some students said things about my grades, but there was another view, and I think we all heard it as well.","“What was it? The others said good looks were useless. A true goddess should be like Shan Jingfei, both pretty and capable. They said you’re so much more capable than me, didn’t they?”","Shan Jingfei’s heart sank.","Feng Wu said, “However, I believe I already defeated you by then, right? We fought in front of all the tutors of the academy.”"]},{"number":2724,"title":"Chapter 2724 - Slap","paragraphs":["Wow!","Everyone stared at Shan Jingfei in astonishment.","If that was the case...","Feng Wu wasn’t a hypocrite. She was only being modest!","Shan Jingfei wasn’t just proud. She was vain!","Xin Zhixuan, Shan Jingfei’s supposedly best friend, asked innocently, “Feifei, is that true?”","The question was like a slap to Shan Jingfei’s face.","She had thought she had everything under control and had earned everyone’s trust. However, she was filled with despair, and the fear of being abandoned almost devoured her.","She glared at Feng Wu and wanted to tear her throat open.","Feng Wu shrugged. “I defeated you in two strikes. You didn’t have enough time to see my true capability.”","Pfft!","Shan Jingfei spat out a mouthful of blood.","She was so angry.","......","She hated Feng Wu to the bone!","Feng Wu glanced at her and shook her head. “If only you’re as good at accepting reality as you are at bullying people.”","Shan Jingfei said, “Feng Wu, I’m going to kill you!”","Feng Wu shook her head in resignation. “You’ll have to get out of this place alive first.”","Shan Jingfei’s face darkened.","That was so true!","Feng Wu had become the center of this group. Everyone respected her and followed her orders. She was more than capable of trapping Shan Jingfei here forever.","Realizing this, Shan Jingfei gritted her teeth.","Revenge was a dish better served cold. She could wait!","Ye Hongxue went to Lin Juncheng and asked, “What did she bribe you with? Look at the state she’s in. What could she possibly offer?”","Lin Juncheng blushed, “I can’t tell you...”","Ye Hongxue pinched his arm and twisted.","“Ouch!” Lin Juncheng cried out in pain. “That hurts... It concerns a girl’s honor. I can’t tell you...”","A girl’s honor? As in, her chastity?","It didn’t take a genius to figure out what that meant.","Shan Jingfei had struck everyone as an innocent girl before, so Ye Hongxue wouldn’t have seen her that way. However, that image had been destroyed, and Ye Hongxue immediately saw what Lin Juncheng meant.","“You b*tch!” She walked up to Shan Jingfei and slapped her.","“You have no shame at all!” Ye Hongxue shouted furiously. She then went to stand behind Feng Wu.","Shan Jingfei was furious.","She looked around with bloodshot eyes.","“You’re all picking on me now! Fine! Once I get out of here, everyone who has offended me and those who stood there and just watched will answer for it! I’m gonna kill you all!”","“Let’s go.” Feng Wu couldn’t care less what Shan Jingfei thought. She frowned and said, “We shouldn’t linger. Let’s get out of here as soon as possible.”","The others all agreed.","Feng Wu led the team, and Cheng Fang was right behind her.","That was so terrifying...","He still remembered the long, dark journey through the tunnels all by himself. He didn’t want to go through that again.","He decided he would stay close to Feng Wu no matter what.","He didn’t even try to see where Ye Han was.","Xuecheng Team followed behind Cheng Fang.","Ye Han looked at Shan Jingfei and Xin Zhixuan before she followed the others."]},{"number":2725,"title":"Chapter 2725 - Sacrifice","paragraphs":["The others also hastily followed Feng Wu.","Only then did they realize who the leader of this group was. Staying close to Feng Wu was the only thing keeping them from getting eaten by the worms.","Xin Zhixuan and Shan Jingfei were the only ones who didn’t follow their teammates.","Seeing the others walk away, Xin Zhixuan said hastily, “Feifei, we should go with them.”","Shan Jingfei smirked. “I’d rather die than go with her!”","Xin Zhixuan wished she could leave Shan Jingfei here. That way, this girl she had always been jealous of would disappear for good.","However...","Despite the jealousy that was eating her up, Xin Zhixuan knew Shan Jingfei had to be alive if she wanted to continue freeloading off of Shan Jingfei’s privileges.","She tugged at Shan Jingfei. “This isn’t the time to get angry. Remember the saying: Where there is life, there is hope.”","After that, she grabbed Shan Jingfei’s hand and dragged her toward the others.","Shan Jingfei might have stubbornly said some things, but when Xin Zhixuan took her arm, she didn’t try to resist.","The tunnels were pitch dark and suffocatingly narrow.","“Are you sure she can get us out of here?” Shan Jingfei smirked. “How do you know she knows the way?”","......","Everyone else had remained silent, and her voice sounded exceptionally loud.","No one answered her question.","Shan Jingfei complained, “She’s all safe walking in the front. What if the worms come from behind? She’s so selfish!”","Ye Hongxue couldn’t stand it anymore. She looked over her shoulder and threw a dirty look at Shan Jingfei, although no one could see it in the darkness.","“Can you shut up for a minute?” Ye Hongxue said grumpily. “If you’re so worried about Xiao Wu getting lost, don’t follow us! Find your own way!”","Shan Jingfei was speechless.","Ye Hongxue went on, “You waited for so long before following the team, so don’t blame us for leaving you in the rear!”","Shan Jingfei didn’t know what to say.","Lin Juncheng tugged at Ye Hongxue. “I think you’ve made your point.”","In Ye Hongxue’s eyes, Shan Jingfei was the woman who had tried to steal her man. That was something she would never forgive.","She shouted at Lin Juncheng, “No, I haven’t! She was using herself as the bribe! Why should I respect her when she doesn’t even respect herself?!”","Lin Juncheng remained silent.","Shan Jingfei didn’t know what to say.","The air suddenly felt very thin.","All words failed Shan Jingfei because she had said exactly those words when she sent Xin Zhixuan to bribe Lin Juncheng.","In her current state, there was nothing she could offer to Lin Juncheng except herself.","Of course, she wasn’t actually going to do anything. However, she couldn’t deny she had said such things.","Ye Hongxue sounded so confident because she had interrogated Xin Zhixuan already.","Everyone wished they were somewhere else.","They wondered if Shan Jingfei would say something in retort to Ye Hongxue.","Had she really...","Feng Wu spoke at that moment. “I think we should change course.”","“What’s going on?” the others asked.","Feng Wu said, “Another team is being attacked by Spirit Stone Worms. We can take a detour and give them a hand.”","“Why should we help them?!”"]},{"number":2726,"title":"Chapter 2726 - The Reward","paragraphs":["“Why should we help them?!”","Someone abruptly asked the question.","Who was it?","The others immediately recognized the voice. It was Shan Jingfei.","They were all speechless.","Ye Hongxue said, “You can shut up now.”","Shan Jingfei regretted it as soon as she blurted out those words.","She was quick-tempered and impulsive. When she lost control, she would say anything. However, she would realize her mistake once she calmed down.","She didn’t like how Ye Hongxue spoke to her, but she stopped herself from saying anything.","Soon, they heard the sounds of fighting.","The team was in an open area connecting two tunnels.","They were surrounded by countless Spirit Stone Worms.","The team had five members.","They all had armor on.","However, the armor was covered in blood.","Dead Spirit Stone Worms were scattered around them.","However...","The more they killed, the more seemed to gather around them.","The place was soon packed.","Feng Wu looked from the worms to the five teenagers before she turned to Ye Hongxue. “The worms will take you all if you get too close.”","The worms indeed gave Ye Hongxue the creeps.","She had yet to recover from her previous experience of facing so many worms.","“We’ll split up here. Go wait for me at the formation core.”","Feng Wu was going to help those five people in passing, but she now realized that it wouldn’t be that easy. She would have to fight alongside them.","Shan Jingfei smirked before Ye Hongxue could say anything. “You’re abandoning us, then. I knew it! I knew you wouldn’t be that kind!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She couldn’t be bothered to talk to Shan Jingfei.","Shan Jingfei had always struck others as a goddess who wouldn’t meddle in worldly affairs. However, she completely gave herself up after her true self was exposed.","Ye Hongxue gave her a stern look before she turned to Feng Wu. “Are you going to save them?”","Feng Wu nodded. “I can’t just walk past them when I have the ability to save them.”","Some of the tunnels had collapsed, and from the higher ground they were standing on, they could see all five team members.","Ye Hongxue asked, “Do you know who they are?”","Feng Wu said, “It doesn’t matter who they are.”","Ye Hongxue smiled bitterly. “No, it does.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Ye Hongxue said, “They’re from the Military Academy.”","Feng Wu asked, “The Military Academy?”","Lin Juncheng nodded. “The Military Academy and Imperial College are the top two schools in the empire. No other school can claim to be their equal.”","Feng Wu understood what he meant. It was like the status which Oxford and Cambridge held.","“The two schools used to be on friendly terms, but the relationship deteriorated because of competition over resources. We’ve had quite a few conflicts with them.","“The Military Academy answers directly to the military, and they’ve made some impressive achievements over the years. Because of that, the empire has been allocating more and more resources to that school, and our school has shown signs of decline.","“That’s just how we describe the situation. The truth is...” Lin Juncheng looked at Feng Wu. “The truth is that we’re no longer as powerful as the Military Academy.”"]},{"number":2727,"title":"Chapter 2727 - Stand on Her Head","paragraphs":["Feng Wu said, “I see...”","Lin Juncheng said, “I believe you may have heard that the allocation of resources for the two schools is determined by the annual martial arts competition.","“It’s open to all schools, but our school and theirs are really the only participants.","“The school that wins will get mining rights, not to this Secret Essence Mine, but to the Cloud Essence Mine in the western district. The winner will also get access to the imperial cultivation room!","“The resources are more significant than you think because of the mining rights. Imperial College has been winning much less frequently over the years. The Military Academy has been on the rise and is catching up to us in all aspects.”","Feng Wu asked, “That was a very long speech. What’s your point?”","Lin Juncheng scratched his head. “What I’m saying is that I know those five people.”","Feng Wu asked, “Are they students from the Military Academy?”","Lin Juncheng smiled bitterly. “I wouldn’t have told you all that if they were just ordinary students from the Military Academy.”","Feng Wu stared at him.","Lin Juncheng suddenly asked, “The winner of Class B will join the seeded team, right?”","Everyone nodded.","Lin Juncheng said, “Those five people are members of the Military Academy’s seeded team.”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu frowned. “So?”","Shan Jingfei lost her temper again.","She sneered at Feng Wu. “Are you going to save them? They’re enemies!","“They’re also from the seeded team. Do you know what that means?","“It means they’re the best students in their Class A!","“You have some ability, I’ll give you that. However, do you seriously think you’re better than Class A students? You should give up on that idea before you make a fool of yourself!”","Feng Wu frowned and glanced at Shan Jingfei. This woman talked too much.","Shan Jingfei went on, “I don’t care whether you live or die. If you insist on saving them, go ahead. I won’t stop you!”","Feng Wu said, “I know why you’re saying that. You’re afraid that if I die, no one will get you out of here. You’re scared of the worms.”","Shan Jingfei was speechless.","Feng Wu asked Little Phoenix, “Why don’t you go with them?”","Little Phoenix didn’t like that idea at all.","It tilted its head and thought for a moment. Then, it flapped its wings.","It landed on Shan Jingfei’s head again.","Everyone had taken out luminescent pearls by then, and they had enough light to see what was going on.","Then, they spotted the bird on Shan Jingfei’s head.","No...","What was it doing?","They heard a trickling sound.","That sound!","Wait...","“What’s happening? Is it raining?” Shan Jingfei felt something warm on her hair before she smelled the stench.","Retch!","She threw up.","She wanted to kill the bird that had peed on her head.","However, Little Phoenix immediately flew away.","Everyone looked from Little Phoenix to Shan Jingfei...","Oh god!","The last time it stood on Shan Jingfei’s head, it had peed at the worms, but now..."]},{"number":2728,"title":"Chapter 2728 - The Second Team","paragraphs":["Everyone wanted to throw up.","They involuntarily stepped away from Shan Jingfei.","Shan Jingfei was so angry that she wanted to kill the bird.","Feng Wu didn’t have time to waste, and she snapped, “The worms won’t attack you anymore. Little Phoenix is doing you a favor!”","A favor? Shan Jingfei glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded. “My bird is those worms’ big boss. They’ll stay away from you when they pick up the bird’s scent. You’ll be safe.”","Shan Jingfei wouldn’t believe it.","She wasn’t alone. Ye Hongxue wasn’t convinced either.","Feng Wu said, “We don’t have much time, and you should get going. When I detonate all the worms, I’m not sure I can save all of you in time.”","The thought of all the worms exploding together was bloodcurdling.","Ye Hongxue hesitated and opened her mouth. In the end, she didn’t say anything. She only nodded at Feng Wu and walked away with Cheng Fang behind her.","Soon, everyone was gone. Feng Wu and Little Phoenix were left on their own.","Little Phoenix complained, “My bladder is empty.”","......","It patted its stomach and sounded quite sorry.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu was wearing the uniform of Imperial College; however, it had become quite dirty after all the fighting.","She took a robe out of her storage space and wrapped it around herself.","She then headed for the five people.","Apart from saving those people, she also needed the practice.","She had only completed 50% of her breakthrough to the Spiritual King stage. She needed to pick up her pace.","She attacked the worms without asking Little Phoenix to pee again.","Fallen Star Sword!","Ground Control!","Thump! Thump! Thump!","The worms were frozen on the spot and killed.","At first, Feng Wu could kill one worm with one strike.","Before long, she could kill two at a time.","The Fallen Star Sword and Ground Control worked better and better together, as if they had combined into one.","Feng Wu was fighting in the outer circle, and the Military Academy students were in the center, so they had no idea that she was out there.","The seeded team they belonged to was also known as the second team.","Their clothes were in tatters, and they were covered with bruises and cuts. However, they remained perfectly calm and were still fighting with all their might.","As time passed, more worms kept coming, and they began to feel desperate.","“Captain, we...”","The speaker’s name was Lian Xiao. His sword had gone blunt from striking the worms. He could hardly cut through their skin.","“Captain, we can’t keep going like this! We’re all injured, and we won’t hold our ground for much longer!”","Lou Mo, his teammate, nodded. “That’s right! We could die here, and the school won’t know what happened!”","The captain was called Lan Xuefeng. He pursed his lips and asked gravely, “What are you suggesting?”","Lian Xiao and his teammates looked at one another before answering the question.","Lian Xiao said, “Captain, you’re the most capable member of our team. If one of us can get out, it has to be you!","“We’ll cover you and make sure you can get out!”","The other three members all nodded."]},{"number":2729,"title":"Chapter 2729 - Contempt","paragraphs":["Lan Xuefeng knew they would say that, and he wouldn’t let that happen. “I’m not leaving you! Dead or alive, we’re a team!”","“Captain!” the other four pleaded.","Lan Xuefeng shook his head. “I won’t do it!”","“If you don’t go, we’ll all die! If you get out alive, at least you can collect our bones later!”","Lan Xuefeng hesitated for a moment, but shook his head in the end. “No! We’ll kill these worms together and get out of here!”","Lian Xiao sighed. He knew his captain would say that, but...","“Who would have thought this would happen after we returned from Peace Grassland. This valley appeared out of nowhere, and we fell into this Secret Essence Mine. Now, we have to face so many worms!”","The others were as full of despair as he was.","Lou Mo screamed at that moment.","Everyone looked in his direction.","A giant worm had jumped into the air when they weren’t looking, and it bit Lou Mo’s left arm.","Lou Mo was taken by surprise.","Crack!","......","He immediately sliced the worm in half and freed his left arm. However, he was already wounded.","The worm’s sharp teeth had dug into his arm, but the blood that oozed out wasn’t red.","“The worms are venomous!” Lou Hao gritted his teeth. “Be careful!”","They were as capable as they were said to be. Not only did they have tough minds, they also had a high tolerance toward poison.","Ye Hongxue and her teammates were from Class A as well, but the venom had still affected their minds.","Feng Wu had to give them a potion to neutralize the toxin.","However, the worm’s bite didn’t affect Lou Mo’s movements.","As the number of wounds increased, however, they started to get exhausted.","Their hands were all swollen.","However, they gritted their teeth and kept on fighting.","They were drained of spiritual essence, and they were stumbling as if they could collapse at any moment.","However, they still decided to fight until they were dead.","Lou Mo seemed to have lost all hope.","“We fought our way out when we were surrounded by Dongsang soldiers. I would never have thought we would be killed by some worms one day!”","Lian Xiao said, “Where did this Secret Essence Mine come from? How did we get here? I survived the Dongsang battlefield, only to die in my homeland! This is ridiculous!”","His teammate chimed in, “If I knew this was going to happen, I would have killed more Dongsang soldiers in Peace Grassland!”","“I killed 13!”","“I killed 15!”","“I think Captain Lan killed 30!”","“Guys, we’ve killed our fair share of enemies. We don’t have any regrets!”","...","Thump!","Lou Mo was the first to fall.","He was finally drained of energy, and his legs gave out.","“Hey, where are the worms going? They’ve turned away!”","Lian Xiao caught Lou Mo and dragged him back. He was about to charge at the worms, when he saw that they had all turned in the opposite direction.","What did that mean?","Was it contempt?"]},{"number":2730,"title":"Chapter 2730 - Fairy","paragraphs":["What did that mean?","Was it contempt?","Lan Xuefeng and the others looked at each other in astonishment.","But it was good news for them.","They were barely holding their ground, and the worms had been about to devour them. However, the worms suddenly spun around and ran in the opposite direction.","“What’s over there? Why are they all so agitated?” Lian Xiao asked curiously.","Just then, Ma Hao, who had climbed onto a rock, shouted, “Look! Someone’s over there!”","There was someone else in this godforsaken place?!","They all climbed onto the rock and looked into the distance.","They were shocked by what they saw.","“It’s true! Someone really is there!”","“Look at that speed and the swordplay! Is that a human being?”","“Is she a teenage girl?”","“Can she be a fellow Military Academy student?”","“Of course not! We would recognize her if she were one of us!”","“We’ve never had such a capable girl, anyway. I think she’s as capable as Captain Lan!”","Lan Xuefeng smiled bitterly. “Don’t make fun of me. I’m nowhere near as capable as she is. Look! She cut off the heads of several worms in one strike! She makes it look as easy as chopping vegetables!”","His teammates had to agree with him because this girl was incredible!","She had killed over 100 worms during the short time that they were watching her.","She was surrounded by dead Spirit Stone Worms.","Her bright red dress was set off against the dead worms. It was almost a disturbing scene.","“Is she killing the worms? Why does it look like she’s dancing?”","“What kind of swordplay is that? Her sword went through three worms in one go!”","“Gosh! Are you seeing this? She’s not killing Spirit Stone Worms! She’s training herself!”","“Yes! She’s been using the same three stances so that she can hone her skill. At first, she could only kill three worms in one strike, but she can kill five now. It’s amazing progress in such a short amount of time! Is she even human? She looks like a fairy!”","“I agree! She’s definitely a fairy! A fairy of the Secret Essence Mine has come to rescue us!”","The five teenagers were so glad that they wept.","“I’m getting a crush on her!”","“Me too!”","They were so excited that they couldn’t form coherent sentences.","Somehow, none of them could believe Feng Wu was real.","At first, the worms were screeching fiercely.","Feng Wu had made an agreement with Little Phoenix that it wouldn’t interfere while she practiced her skills.","However, it never occurred to either of them that Feng Wu would get lost in her training.","She went on fighting.","Dead Spirit Stone Worms piled up around her until she realized that there were no more worms to kill.","She finally put down her sword and gradually returned to reality.","When she looked up, she saw five astonished faces.","They were five teenagers.","Their eyes were wide open as they gaped at Feng Wu. It was as if they were seeing a ghost.","Feng Wu frowned and asked Little Phoenix in her head, “How long has it been?”","“One day and one night,” said Little Phoenix in amazement."]},{"number":2731,"title":"Chapter 2731 - Spiritual King","paragraphs":["Even Feng Wu was astonished.","“One day and one night? It can’t be!” She stared at Little Phoenix in disbelief. “How can it be so long? It only felt like five minutes to me!”","Little Phoenix sighed. “Because you were in the sword spirit state.”","Feng Wu asked, “The sword spirit state?”","Little Phoenix nodded. “It’s extremely difficult to achieve that state, even for my master. Once you’re in that state, the results are very rewarding.”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t feel all that rewarded...”","She examined herself as she spoke.","Then, she abruptly stopped talking.","That was because —","To her astonishment, she was much closer to reaching the Spiritual King stage now. She had only made 50% progress before, but she was at 99.99% now.","She was so close to making the breakthrough!","Just then, something clicked in Feng Wu’s head.","The Spiritual King stage!","She sat down with her legs crossed and started cultivating in front of the five teenagers.","There was a huge gap between the Spiritual Lord stage and Spiritual King stage.","These five teenagers belonged to the second team of Class A at the Military Academy.","That was to say, they were ranked sixth to tenth in the Military Academy. Lan Xuefeng, the captain, was a peak Level 8 Spiritual Lord, whereas his teammates were advanced Level 8 Spiritual Lords.","Feng Wu had just reached the Spiritual King stage.","The five teenagers weren’t Spiritual Kings, but they had met some before and knew what their energy felt like.","They had always been led by Spiritual Kings in Peace Grassland.","But now...","This girl...","She was a pretty girl who was no more than 14 years old, but she was already a Spiritual King!","OMG!","The five people looked at one another and didn’t know what to say.","“She wasn’t a Spiritual King at first, was she?”","“I thought that stage was very hard to reach!”","“I heard you need to be at least 20 years old to comprehend the process and make the breakthrough!”","“Can she really be a fairy from another world?”","...","Two hours later, Feng Wu finally processed all her spiritual essence.","The Spiritual King stage was as impressive as it was said to be.","Although she was only a junior Spiritual King, she felt full of strength, as if she could punch through rock.","Just then, a giant Spirit Stone Worm charged at her.","“Watch out! It’s a Spirit Stone Worm King!”","Lan Xuefeng cried out to warn Feng Wu.","It was the leader of the Spirit Stone Worms. The fleeing worms must have gone back to their leader with the news, which was why the king had appeared.","According to Little Phoenix, Spirit Stone Worms were about the size of fleas when they were born.","After being stuck here in the Secret Essence Mine for so many years, they had grown larger and larger until they were as big as grown men. As for the approaching leader of the worms...","It moved as fast as a cheetah!","Everything happened so fast!"]},{"number":2732,"title":"Chapter 2732 - Are You Talking about Zuo Qingluan?","paragraphs":["It moved as fast as a cheetah!","Everything happened so fast!","Feng Wu raised a hand and smacked the giant worm on the head.","Thump!","The worm smashed into the wall.","The impact shattered the wall completely.","“I... I...”","“OMG!”","“Am I seeing things?”","“Isn’t that worm a Spiritual King?”","...","What happened astonished all five teenagers, and they stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","......","She was also pleasantly surprised by this breakthrough.","She had been here for a whole day, and her friends were still at the formation core. They had to be so worried.","She immediately took off.","Lan Xuefeng and the others called after Feng Wu when they saw that she was leaving.","“Miss! Miss! Please let us thank you!”","They all dropped to their knees and prostrated themselves on the ground.","Feng Wu saw their injuries and tattered clothes, which made her wonder. She asked, “Did you just come back from Peace Grassland?”","The teenagers nodded.","Feng Wu said, “You’re all very brave. Good job.”","She then handed a paper crane to Lan Xuefeng. “Follow the bird. It’ll lead you out of this mine.”","Before they knew it, she was out of sight.","It felt great to walk away from doing a good deed and remain anonymous. Feng Wu chuckled to herself.","According to Lin Juncheng, these five people were ranked sixth to tenth in the Military Academy. Imperial College students with the same ranking would be so arrogant, but those five were very well-behaved. She found them adorable.","Lan Xuefeng and his team only realized what had happened after Feng Wu was gone.","“Our fairy is gone...”","“Just like that...”","The thought of not seeing her again made them sad.","“I wonder if we’ll ever see her again. I have such a big crush on her now.”","“She’s a fairy! Of course we won’t see her again!”","“Didn’t you hear what she said? She asked if we had come back from Peace Grassland. The sporadic battles between the empire and the Dongsang Kingdom in Peace Grassland are recent events, and only a few people in the empire know about them.”","“That’s right. Apart from the military, only students from Class B and above in our school and Imperial College are qualified to fight in these battles. That fairy mentioned Peace Grassland, so she has to be human!”","“Not only that, she’s also from one of the two schools!”","“The two schools? Who are you kidding? There’s no one like her in the Military Academy!”","“In that case, is she a senior student from Imperial College?”","“No way! She’s a Spiritual King! Only the tutors who led us in Peace Grassland were Spiritual Kings. How can she be a student?”","“Since when did Imperial College have such a capable member?”","“We’ll ask around once we get back. She’s too impressive to be kept a secret, even if she’s a teacher.”","“Look! There are inscriptions on the paper crane!”","“What level are the inscriptions? The paper crane isn’t just alive, it can show us the way out of here!”","They went back to the Military Academy.","“The most famous tutor in Imperial College recently... Do you mean Miss Zuo Qingluan, the head of the War Academy?”"]},{"number":2733,"title":"Chapter 2733 - The School’s Reaction","paragraphs":["Things were quite noisy when Feng Wu reached the formation core.","Shao Xiao and the others had waited and waited.","They felt uneasy and looked forward to seeing Feng Wu.","They didn’t have any provisions with them because they had been in Thousand Night Forest. There were magical beasts everywhere in the forest, and they could roast meat over a fire. There was no need to bring their own food.","However...","They had never expected to end up in this Secret Essence Mine.","By then, they hadn’t eaten for days and were starving.","“Do you have any food on you?” Ling Hao asked.","All the other team members shook their heads, smiling bitterly.","They missed the roast chicken which they had carelessly thrown away in the outside world.","They were surrounded by dead Spirit Stone Worms, but no one could bring themselves to eat those things.","They could only stay in the circle, and didn’t dare venture out.","They waited and waited.","They thought Feng Wu would come back when they finally saw Ye Hongxue and the others.","After that came more waiting.","But Feng Wu was still nowhere to be seen.","They were patient at first, but gradually, they became anxious.","“Do you think something happened to Feng Wu?” Huo Shan paled.","He alone knew how well-connected Feng Wu was. The crown prince cared for her!","“We shouldn’t just wait here. Let’s go out and look for her!”","Apart from Shan Jingfei and Ye Han, everyone else went out to look for Feng Wu.","However, as soon as they stepped out of the formation core, they were surrounded by Spirit Stone Worms.","There were so many worms that the tunnels were packed.","They had never seen so many worms before.","“God... Have all the worms in the mine gathered here?”","“They’re moving closer...”","“We’re their targets!”","“Oh, no! We should go back!”","Shao Xiao led the others back to the circle.","It was big enough for four people to stand inside, but there were over ten people now, and the circle was too small.","“Everybody, get in!”","Shao Xiao shouted, “This is a protective circle. The worms won’t attack us when we’re inside. Get in!”","Feng Wu’s team had survived waves of attacks by hiding in the circle, and they jumped back in without hesitation.","Ye Hongxue and her team had spent time in Peace Grassland and were used to following orders, so they jumped into the circle as well.","Shan Jingfei didn’t like the idea at all.","She found the circle too small.","It would never fit all of them.","“You’re counting on this thing to stop the worms. I don’t buy it.” Ye Han shook her head.","Apart from Ye Han, Xin Zhixuan and Shan Jingfei, everyone else went inside the circle.","The circle couldn’t take more people either.","The worms attacked again.","Boom!?","That was going to be their last attack.","The original worm king was dead, and the worms would compete among themselves until they had a new leader.","While the students were trapped in the Secret Essence Mine, the academy was informed of what had happened.","Only a handful of students had fallen into the Secret Essence Mine, while most people were lucky enough to remain on the surface.","The tutors came to their rescue and brought them back to the school.","The school realized something wasn’t right when they counted the number of students."]},{"number":2734,"title":"Chapter 2734 - Chu Tianxiao","paragraphs":["The school realized something wasn’t right when they counted the number of students.","“Mr. Yang, how many of your students are missing?” asked Gongsun Mu.","Mr. Yang was overwhelmed with anxiety.","“Many have come back, but a few students are missing, including Shan Jingfei!”","The other tutors paled when they heard this.","Meanwhile, the school officials held a meeting.","Over ten people attended, including the two deputy chiefs and the tutors of Classes A and B.","“Shan Jingfei is the best student in Class B. That place in the seeded team is meant for her.”","The Class A tutor told the truth.","No one said a word for a while.","“Miss Qingluan, what do you think?” Everybody looked at her.","Zuo Qingluan hadn’t made any achievements ever since she became the deputy chief, nor had she said anything convincing.","Because of her background, people hadn’t said anything at first. However, dissatisfaction would accumulate over time.","......","Zuo Qingluan raised her eyebrows. “Do we know why this has happened? Why did the Secret Essence Mine appear?”","Gongsun Mu nodded. “We’ve sent some elders to check the area and found it to be the consequence of the actions of some very capable cultivators. The entire Thousand Night Forest was split in half by a great valley, which was why the Secret Essence Mine surfaced.”","“How capable?” Zuo Qingluan asked.","Gongsun Mu smiled bitterly, “Well, I can’t say for sure...”","Just then, he suddenly straightened his back.","He rose to his feet and listened carefully.","Everybody was surprised.","What was happening?","Why did he look like his mind was elsewhere?","Zuo Qingluan was alarmed.","Her master had communicated with her several times that way, and she wondered if Gongsun Mu was doing the same thing.","“Yes, Sir!” Gongsun Mu said to someone in a respectful tone, before he turned to the others.","“I know what happened,” he said solemnly. “The valley was indeed the result of a battle between two capable cultivators.”","“Who were they?” Zuo Qingluan asked curiously.","Could it be someone as capable as her master?","Gongsun Mu said one name: “Chu Tianxiao.”","What?!!!","Almost everyone jumped to their feet.","“Chu Tianxiao? How can it be him? I thought he was dead!”","“Chu Tianxiao, as in, the greatest swordsman?”","“Isn’t he the disciple of Mu Jiuzhou, who used to rule this continent?”","“Oh my god!” Mr. Yang almost fainted. “He’s like a god! Why would he come here?”","In their minds, Chu Tianxiao was as good as a figure from the legends.","He was still alive...","How old would he have to be?","Zuo Qingluan paled.","Chu Tianxiao...","He had once accused Zuo Qingluan’s master of being inhuman in front of everyone, and had rendered her master speechless. He had humiliated Firmament Palace! Why was he here?"]},{"number":2735,"title":"Chapter 2735 - Rescue","paragraphs":["Everyone was surprised by that name.","That person was supposed to be a figure from the history books. Why was he here?","“Chief Gongsun, is that true?” Still unconvinced, the others asked Gongsun Mu the question.","Gongsun Mu had never been so serious before. He nodded and said, “The chief told me himself.”","Mr. Yang let out a breath of relief. “The Secret Essence Mine disappeared for many years, and Imperial College was never able to locate it. That legendary man is the only person who could have exposed it with a single strike.”","It was rather terrifying to think about.","It had only taken that man one strike to expose the Secret Essence Mine which Imperial College hadn’t been able to locate for years.","The school knew the area that the Secret Essence Mine was in, but the mine had its own formation, which had been active the whole time. There was nothing the school could do about it.","“What should we do now?” Everyone looked at Gongsun Mu.","Mr. Yang said, “Shan Jingfei and her four teammates are all inside, as well as Shao Xiao’s team.”","Gongsun Mu asked, “Is Feng Wu missing?”","Feng Wu?","Feng Wu had effortlessly defeated Shan Jingfei, and she was the future of Imperial College.","......","Mr. Yang nodded solemnly. “Yes, she’s inside, too.”","He then handed over the list of names.","The five members of Shan Jingfei’s team.","The six members of Shao Xiao’s team.","And Ye Han.","There were 12 of them in total.","Just then, Mr. Duan of Class A received a message.","“What?” He looked at Qiu Zeyu and cried out, “Did you say Ye Hongxue’s Xuecheng Team?”","Qiu Zeyu had been scared to deliver the news, but the mission he had handed out was recorded in the system, and he couldn’t keep it a secret.","“There are 17 people inside!” Mr. Duan’s face darkened. “Are we going to lose 17 elite students this time?”","Gongsun Mu’s face was livid.","Of the 17 elite students, Feng Wu was the most important one.","Gongsun Mu gritted his teeth. “We have to find them!”","“But how?” Mr. Yang frowned. “The Secret Essence Mine is protected by a formation. We can’t get close enough, not to mention the 80,000 tunnels. We would be trapped inside forever.”","Zuo Qingluan was the only person who was happy to hear the news.","It had never occurred to her that her archenemy would die so easily.","She had been ready for a battle, but her enemy died before she could do anything. It gave her no sense of achievement at all.","However, Feng Wu was dead, and that was good news.","Despite her joy, Zuo Qingluan put on a sad face. “The 17 students may still be alive. We have to do something! We’ll spare no effort, regardless of whether or not we can save them!”","Mr. Duan glanced at her, amazed by that little speech. He then turned to Gongsun Mu and asked, “Sir, what do you think?”","Gongsun Mu glanced at his subordinate, who quickly walked away."]},{"number":2736,"title":"Chapter 2736 - Elder Mei","paragraphs":["Needless to say, the subordinate had gone to get some help.","Gongsun Mu rose to his feet and said, “We can’t delay anymore. Let’s go to the Secret Essence Mine!”","All the tutors went with him.","It was like Mr. Yang had said. Because of the formation, people felt dizzy before they got close to the Secret Essence Mine. They couldn’t even stand still.","They had to stop when they were several hundred meters away.","Things had been calm when Feng Wu and the others were still outside the mine. However, the formation had been activated when they went in.","The Secret Essence Mine was surrounded by a powerful wind that could cut one’s skin open.","The area within a hundred meters of the Secret Essence Mine had become a meat grinder.","“Mr. Gongsun, what should we do?” Everyone looked at Gongsun Mu.","Gongsun Mu’s face darkened.","They couldn’t get close to the mine, let alone enter it.","Mr. Yang volunteered. “Sir, shall I give it a go?”","Gongsun Mu didn’t answer.","Mr. Yang said solemnly, “Sir, my students are trapped inside, and they’re my responsibility. They may still be alive! I can’t just stand here and let them die!”","Gongsun Mu nodded. “Give it a go. Come back here immediately if it doesn’t feel right.”","Mr. Yang nodded.","He took a deep breath and commanded the wind, “Stop!”","Then, he charged at the Secret Essence Mine like a shooting arrow.","If the wind hadn’t been blowing, Mr. Yang could have reached the mine in a split second.","But now...","As he approached the windy zone, he covered his entire body with his spiritual essence.","But!","He backed away before he could reach the mine.","When he returned, the others were shocked to see the state he was in.","How did that happen?","His face was covered with cuts.","So were his hands and his entire body. His clothes were in tatters.","He was covered in blood.","“Mr. Yang, are you alright?” the others asked in concern.","Mr. Yang shook his head. “The wind is too strong. I exerted all my strength, but I still couldn’t enter.”","Mr. Yang was a Spiritual King. If even he couldn’t enter...","“The only way is to stop this wind.” Mr. Duan frowned.","“How? This is a Level 8 formation, and we can’t stop it once it has been activated. If we could do that, we wouldn’t have to wait for so many years.” Mr. Yin smiled bitterly.","Gongsun Mu was a capable cultivator, but he knew very little about formations and didn’t know what to do.","“Elder Mei is here!” Gongsun Mu’s servant arrived with Elder Mei.","Elder Mei?","The name was a pleasant surprise.","Imperial College had more than these tutors and chiefs.","The school was full of culture and history, and the tutors alone wouldn’t be able to support such a complicated system.","Imperial College had 36 mysterious elders in total."]},{"number":2737,"title":"Chapter 2737 - Elder Mei’s Arrival","paragraphs":["The elders lived in the deepest corners of the campus and hardly ever came out.","They would only make an appearance when they found a student they were interested in.","Elder Mei was one of the mysterious elders.","The teachers were familiar with him because he was in charge of maintaining Imperial College’s formation.","Of course, ordinary students still didn’t know who he was.","“Master!” A middle-aged man stepped out from behind Mr. Duan.","He was Mr. Xu, who taught formations and inscriptions in Imperial College. Elder Mei used to be his teacher.","Mr. Xu worked in the War Academy, whereas Mr. Wu, whom Feng Wu had met, taught formations in the junior years.","Mr. Xu had tried to solve the formation in the Secret Essence Mine,’Search NewNovel- on google’? but he couldn’t comprehend any of it and had to ask Elder Mei for help.","If Elder Mei didn’t know what to do, no one would.","Although Gongsun Mu was the vice-director of the War Academy, he was only in charge of daily errands.","All of the 36 elders were more senior than him.","Zuo Qingluan had become a vice chief because Zixuan recommended her before her voluntary retirement, and also because people believed her to be Jun Linyuan’s future wife.","......","However, to become an elder, one had to have adequate capability and seniority. One’s connections didn’t matter.","Gongsun Mu’s career path would lead him toward becoming an elder one day.","Elder Mei walked toward them at an unhurried pace.","Despite his old age and white hair, he had a youthful complexion and seemed to be in high spirits.","“Elder Mei.” Everybody greeted the old man.","They hardly had the chance to meet such a prominent figure.","Elder Mei nodded and waved them off, caring little for formality.","Zuo Qingluan was thrilled to see Elder Mei.","She had learned formations and inscriptions in Firmament Palace. Her tutor had instructed her to become acquainted with Elder Mei when she came to the imperial capital and to learn formations and inscriptions from him.","She had come to the War Academy as a vice chief not only to humiliate Feng Wu, but also to try and meet Elder Mei.","Her eyes lit up when she saw the old man.","She quickly stepped forward and greeted him. “It’s an honor to meet you, Elder Mei.”","All Elder Mei cared about now was solving the formation in the Secret Essence Mine. He frowned a little when a pretty teenage girl suddenly blocked his way.","To someone so obsessed with formations, every face was the same as the next, and Zuo Qingluan’s stunning looks didn’t leave an impression on him.","He only nodded before turning his attention to the Secret Essence Mine.","His top priority was to stop the wind.","He could only reach the entrance after the wind stopped. After that, he would have to face the intricate tunnels in the mine.","Meeting Elder Mei was such a rare chance that Zuo Qingluan desperately wanted to impress him.","She was displeased when Elder Mei ignored her.","She had always been the center of attention. All her seniors appreciated her talent, and no one had ignored her like this before."]},{"number":2738,"title":"Chapter 2738 - The Crown Prince’s Fiancee","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan took another step forward and beamed at the old man. “I’m Zuo Qingluan...”","However, Elder Mei cut her off impatiently and scolded her. “What’s your problem, young lady? Can’t you see how busy I am? I don’t have time to exchange pleasantries! Out of my way!”","No one had ever spoken to Zuo Qingluan like that before. The old man made her sound like an unruly child when she was, in fact, the sacred lady of Firmament Palace.","Even my master, the head of Firmament Palace, has never talked to me like that, you old fool!? thought Zuo Qingluan, her face twisted with rage.","Ahem...?","The others looked away in embarrassment.","Mr. Wang of Class D had openly opposed Feng Wu, so Zuo Qingluan had contacted him beforehand and paid him to keep slandering Feng Wu.","Seeing what was going on, Mr. Wang stepped out and smiled obsequiously. “Elder Mei, Miss Qingluan is our new vice chief...”","He tried to remind the old man to show the girl some respect.","However, it only made Elder Mei dislike Zuo Qingluan even more.","He didn’t pay much attention to her at first, but Mr. Wang mentioned “vice chief.”","“What vice chief?” Elder Mei frowned.","Mr. Wang smiled. “Chief Zixuan went to Peace Grassland, so she made Miss Qingluan the acting vice chief. Miss Qingluan is very capable...”","“Nonsense!” Elder Mei cut him off. “If Zixuan is absent, it’s the school who decides who will replace her. She’s just a vice chief! She has no right to hand out job offers!”","Everyone fell silent, and Zuo Qingluan felt mortified.","Elder Mei turned to Gongsun Mu. “Is this how you’ve been running the War Academy? Do you think the elders are dead?!”","Gongsun Mu smiled bitterly.","“Miss Zuo is the sacred lady of Firmament Palace. The master of the palace wrote a letter herself...”","Elder Mei’s face darkened.","“Is this place Imperial College or Firmament Palace? Since when can her letter guarantee a position in our school?! Are they handing out random job offers now? This is preposterous!” Elder Mei bellowed. “You people are making a mess while the elders are focused on Peace Grassland! Are you trying to give us a heart attack?!”","“No, it’s not like that...” Gongsun Mu tried to explain himself...","However, Elder Mei wouldn’t let him.","“The chief is cultivating in seclusion, and the 36 elders are either in seclusion or watching Peace Grassland. I thought you could run the school properly, but you’ve disappointed me!”","Seeing Zuo Qingluan’s pale face, Mr. Wang said awkwardly, “It was His Royal Highness, Elder Mei. His Royal Highness gave the order to make Miss Qingluan vice chief.”","“What?” Elder Mei frowned.","Jun Linyuan?","Elder Mei might not trust Gongsun Mu, but he had faith in the crown prince.","“Did he say so in person?” Elder Mei wasn’t convinced.","The crown prince had some questionable taste in women...","However, Mr. Wang sounded very convinced when he said, “Yes, Miss Qingluan is His Royal Highness’s fiancee, and they’re going to get married soon.”","Zuo Qingluan’s stomach lurched."]},{"number":2739,"title":"Chapter 2739 - Ancient Skills","paragraphs":["“Miss Qingluan, isn’t that right?” Mr. Wang smiled at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","Yes, when she came to the War Academy, she had arranged people to spread rumors about her relationship with the crown prince. However, the rumor was just that they were a couple, and never said anything about them being engaged, let alone getting married.","Mr. Wang’s question put her in a difficult spot.","She could deny the rumors if she was questioned.","She could claim that she was also a victim of the rumors and knew nothing about it.","However, if she said so now, it would be very difficult to deny what she said later.","“Miss Qingluan, isn’t that right?” Mr. Wang repeated his question.","He thought anxiously,? What’s wrong with Zuo Qingluan? She told me she was His Royal Highness’s fiancee when she visited me!","Despite her frustration, Zuo Qingluan said shyly, “It’s my parents’ decision. I don’t know anything about it...”","The others knew what she was implying.","That was as good as tacit acknowledgement.","Elder Mei studied Zuo Qingluan for a long time, but he looked disappointed in the end.","......","“Jun Linyuan is supposed to be a clever man; why did he make such a stupid mistake? He should know better...” Elder Mei mumbled as he went back to studying the formation.","However, what he said was a hard blow to Zuo Qingluan’s ego.","Her face turned livid.","How dare that old fool humiliate me?! When I marry His Royal Highness, I’ll kill him!? Zuo Qingluan thought to herself.","Elder Mei seemed to have sensed her resentment, because he suddenly looked up.","It happened so fast that Zuo Qingluan didn’t have time to hide the hatred in her eyes.","Elder Mei saw the murderous look in her eyes.","Elder Mei’s face darkened.? What’s that boy thinking? Why her? I have to talk to him!","However, his top priority was the formation.","The wind formation was complicated, but Elder Mei was still able to crack it.","A few hours passed.","Suddenly!","The wind abruptly stopped.","“It’s stopped! The wind is gone!”","“Elder Mei is amazing!”","“Elder Mei is the only one who can crack it! He must be a Level 7 formation master!”","Elder Mei rolled his eyes. He had been a Level 8 formation master for a very long time already!","After that little episode, Zuo Qingluan had given up on pleasing Elder Mei. However, when she saw how capable he was, she was intrigued again and wanted to learn formation and inscription skills from him.","She recalled what her master had told her once.","The Junwu Empire was a vast country with so many talented people, but why was it so difficult for it to defeat the tiny Dongsang Kingdom? Why had they been stuck on Peace Grassland for so many years?","Formations and inscriptions. Those were the reasons.","The Dongsang Kingdom was far more advanced than the Junwu Empire in these ancient skills."]},{"number":2740,"title":"Chapter 2740 - I Can’t","paragraphs":["Soldiers of the Dongsang Kingdom all had inscriptions on their weapons and uniforms, which greatly enhanced their capability.","Their power was also enhanced by the formation their troops used.","Because of that, the Junwu Empire couldn’t make any advancement in Peace Grassland. If they hadn’t continually sent talents to Peace Grassland every year, the Junwu Empire would have lost the battle a long time ago.","Zuo Qingluan’s master had asked her once, “Do you know what the Junwu Empire is lacking?”","Zuo Qingluan said affirmatively, “Formation masters and inscription masters.”","The head of Firmament Palace nodded. “Yes, they’re the most scarce talents in the Junwu Empire. You need to have adequate talent if you want to marry Jun Linyuan, so you have to train yourself in these two aspects. It’ll give you much more of an advantage.”","Zuo Qingluan had been searching for people with such talents, but had so far come up empty.","She had been researching these fields as well. However, the True Phoenix Blood didn’t give her much help on that front, and she wasn’t much more efficient than ordinary cultivators.","She stared at Elder Mei and was determined to become his disciple.","Elder Mei didn’t know he was being watched. He was standing at the entrance of the Secret Essence Mine, trying to find his way in.","Feng Wu and the others got in so easily because the mine had just been activated and the wind hadn’t started up yet.","It was much more difficult to open the entrance now.","Time slowly passed by.","......","Meanwhile, in the mine.","The students were under attack.","“Oh my god!”","“What should we do?”","“Have all the Spirit Stone Worms gathered here?”","“Are we going to die?”","They all panicked.","The worms were flooding in, and they were panic-stricken.","Shan Jingfei, Ye Han and Xin Zhixuan wouldn’t get into the circle at first.","When Xin Zhixuan saw the endless stream of worms, she paled and jumped into the circle.","The circle wasn’t too big, and there were so many students inside already. People pushed up against one another.","They swayed, and some almost fell.","Since they were all classmates, no one tried to push Xin Zhixuan away. Those standing in the center even stood on one foot.","Shan Jingfei smirked. “Do you seriously think that circle will work?”","Shao Xiao frowned. “It has protected us so far. You have to trust Feng Wu! Ye Han, come here!”","Ye Han shook her head. “No!”","She would have joined them if Shao Xiao hadn’t mentioned Feng Wu, but he had, and she would never admit defeat.","She refused to step into the circle.","The worms were approaching them at high speed.","They looked like a tidal wave.","Ah!","The first few worms charged at Shan Jingfei and Ye Han.","They finally burst into tears.","“Help us! Help!”","The others would have helped them, but that was before they realized how impossible Shan Jingfei and Ye Han were.","They couldn’t save the two girls even if they wanted to.","Cheng Fang asked, “What should we do now? They’re surrounded! Should we help them?”","The others all stared at him. “Do you want to go?”","Cheng Fang paled and shook his head. “I can’t... I really can’t!”","He had learned from his lonely journey with the crane. He knew better now.","Lin Juncheng asked, “Why aren’t the worms attacking us? Why them?”"]},{"number":2741,"title":"Chapter 2741 - Evil Deed","paragraphs":["Shao Xiao said, “That’s because we’re in this circle.”","Lin Juncheng wasn’t convinced. “Does this circle really work?”","Shao Xiao glanced at him. “Why do you even ask? Why do you think we’re all squeezed into this circle?”","That made sense.","Lin Juncheng asked, “How does this circle work?”","Lin Juncheng patted him on the shoulder. “You weren’t here. The circle contains Boss Phoenix’s... thing...”","Lin Juncheng said, “Do you mean pee?”","Ling Hao said, “Yes. Don’t give us that look! It’s the most precious thing! The worms will do anything to avoid it!”","Lin Juncheng said excitedly, “Then Shan Jingfei is fine! Didn’t that bird pee on her head? The worms won’t attack her!”","Ye Hongxue snapped, “No, they will! Didn’t you see what Shan Jingfei did with our precious water? She washed her hair! She washed off the smell!”","What? Everyone was shocked.","They all looked at Shan Jingfei.","Ye Hongxue was right.","......","Shan Jingfei’s hair was damp and had obviously been washed.","“How can she be so stupid? That pee could have saved her!”","The worms were already on the two girls.","Ye Han screamed.","“Help me!”","Cheng Fang couldn’t bring himself to ignore her. He untied his belt, threw it at Ye Han to wrap it around her waist, and pulled her toward the circle.","Shao Xiao and the others helped him.","The circle was small, but it might be able to fit all of them if they stood very close.","“Shan Jingfei, catch!”","Someone else copied what Cheng Fang did and threw a belt at Shan Jingfei.","It was none other than Ye Hongxue.","She was angry at Shan Jingfei for her despicable behavior, but in a life and death moment, she chose to save the girl.","Although the circle would barely fit another person, Ye Hongxue thought they might be able to make a little room for Shan Jingfei.","However, something happened the next moment.","Shan Jingfei grabbed the belt and yanked.","Ye Hongxue was dragged out of the circle, while Shan Jingfei used the momentum to land in it.","Everything happened so fast that no one had time to react.","Ye Hongxue only realized it when she was outside the circle.","Her eyes widened while she was in mid-air.","She had tried to save Shan Jingfei.","How could Shan Jingfei do this?","“Ye Hongxue!” The others couldn’t believe their eyes.","Lin Juncheng was so furious that he wanted to push Shan Jingfei out of the circle.","Shan Jingfei said matter-of-factly, “She volunteered to help me. I didn’t ask for it? What now? Are you going to murder me?”","Ye Hongxue landed with a thump amidst the dense pack of worms.","Lin Juncheng went frantic.","He wouldn’t let anyone stop him, and charged out of the circle.","“Lin Juncheng, calm down!”","The others tried to stop him, but it was too late.","The last thing they saw was Lin Juncheng rushing toward the worms.","Everyone glared at Shan Jingfei."]},{"number":2742,"title":"Chapter 2742 - Feng Wu’s Back","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei said innocently, “I didn’t tell Lin Juncheng to leave. He did it voluntarily. You can’t blame me for that!”","The others were furious.","How could this woman be so evil?","They used to see her as a kind, lovely, and innocent girl. Her true self was revolting!","The other wanted to help Lin Juncheng and Ye Hongxue, but the worms blocked their view.","“I’m going to kill you!” Xue Hao and his teammates pushed Shan Jingfei toward the edge of the circle.","At that critical moment!","All of a sudden!","The worms seemed to sense danger and began to flee.","They were soon nowhere to be seen.","Everyone was speechless.","What was going on?","Why did the worms...","......","“Is Boss Phoenix here?!” Ling Hao was thrilled.","He was right.","The next second, they saw Feng Wu with the bird on her shoulder.","Feng Wu?!","Little Phoenix?!","Xue Hao, the former captain of Xuecheng Team, burst into tears when he saw Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s wrong?”","“Boss Feng Wu! Is it really you?”","Ling Hao and Huo Shan ran toward her.","Feng Wu was perplexed. “Yes, it’s me.”","Ling Hao said, “Please help Ye Hongxue! Now!”","Ye Hongxue?","Feng Wu turned around and saw Ye Hongxue and Lin Juncheng lying on the ground. She frowned and said, “Didn’t I tell you to get into the circle? Why weren’t they inside?”","Xue Hao pointed at Shan Jingfei and sobbed, “It was her!”","Feng Wu paid little attention to Shan Jingfei because she was examining Ye Hongxue.","“Is she still alive? Can you save her?” Xue Hao ran to her side.","Feng Wu frowned when she saw Ye Hongxue.","The worms had sharp teeth, and Ye Hongxue had been surrounded by them.","Ye Hongxue had chunks of flesh missing from all over her body, and she was covered in blood.","The worms’ saliva was toxic, which was why she was a purplish color. All life seemed to have left her.","Feng Wu checked her breathing.","“How is she?”","Once the worms were gone, all attention was on Ye Hongxue.","Feng Wu shook her head. “She’s not breathing.","That was to say...","“Is she dead?!” Xue Hao realized what that meant. “I’m going to kill Shan Jingfei! Let me kill her.","“We told her to get in the circle, but Shan Jingfei wouldn’t listen!","“The worms then arrived, and Ye Hongxue felt sorry for Shan Jingfei, so she threw out one end of her belt.","“No one knew Shan Jingfei could be so evil! She dragged Ye Hongxue toward the worms while she used the momentum to get into the circle.","“Shan Jingfei, I’m going to kill you!”","Shan Jingfei knew no one would be on her side, so she stopped pretending."]},{"number":2743,"title":"Chapter 2743 - Alive","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei gritted her teeth and smirked. “There was no space in the circle. If she didn’t come out, how would I get in? If you must blame someone, blame the person who drew it for making it too small!”","Everyone was speechless.","Little Phoenix couldn’t believe its ears. “Is she blaming me now?”","Xue Hao was furious.","He looked at Ye Hongxue and Lin Juncheng. Not only had they been killed, chunks of flesh were also missing from their bodies. He felt indignant on their behalf.","“You killed them! Shan Jingfei, I’m going to kill you!”","Xue Hao charged Shan Jingfei.","Shan Jingfei shouted, “Are you going to beat up a woman now?”","Xue Hao paused a little.","Everyone looked at him. She had a point. It felt wrong to watch a man beat up a woman.“Please reading on ’”","However, Xue Hao was too angry to care about that. His fist landed on Shan Jingfei’s nose with a loud thump.","What...","The pain made Shan Jingfei’s eyes tear up.","......","She looked at Xue Hao in disbelief.","“How dare you hit me?!”","She was the favorite daughter of her family, and all boys doted on her. However, this brute had just hit her!","“Xue Hao, are you out of your mind?!” Shan Jingfei screamed.","“No, I’m not! I’m going to kill you!” Xue Hao raised his fists again.","The once goddess of the class was turned into a punching bag.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Soon, blood covered her face.","She was completely baffled.","She was being beaten up!","A boy was hitting her!","She felt the world had gone insane.","If Ye Hongxue hadn’t been killed, someone would have tried to stop Xue Hao because they all had kind hearts. However, they saw what had happened to the last person who had shown some kindness.","Shan Jingfei was a vicious person who wouldn’t hesitate to push other people off the cliff. No one would be dumb enough to help the ungrateful girl again.","All Feng Wu cared about were Ye Hongxue and Lin Juncheng.","Ling Hao said, “Are Hongxue and Juncheng dead?”","Ye Hongxue and Lin Juncheng had lost chunks of flesh and a lot of blood. Together with the toxin from the worms, they couldn’t possibly still be alive.","Everyone wanted to kill Shan Jingfei.","Feng Wu took action.","She was as amazing as any Supreme Level medicine refiner.","Pale green dots of light floated out of her fingertips.","That light!","Several people here had seen her use it before and knew her to be a Supreme Level medicine refiner. They weren’t astonished this time.","However, not all of them knew that.","Xin Zhixuan and Ye Han were seeing it for the first time.","They almost jumped to their feet when they saw Feng Wu’s medical skills.","Gosh!","A Supreme Level medicine refiner!","Even Shan Jingfei, who was taking a beating, saw what Feng Wu was doing.","Supreme Level!","It was a shocking fact.","The blood on Ye Hongxue turned from purple to red when the green light touched her.","And the missing chunks of flesh grew back as they watched.","Had Feng Wu just brought someone back from the dead?","How terrifying!","Soon, Ye Hongxue and Lin Juncheng’s injuries were scabbed over, but they were still unconscious.","Feng Wu told Ling Hao, “Make two stretchers.”"]},{"number":2744,"title":"Chapter 2744 - The Price of Kindness and Foolishness","paragraphs":["Ling Hao nodded and went with Huo Shan to make the stretchers.","“Boss Feng Wu, are they...”","The others looked at Feng Wu.","They had thought that Ye Hongxue and Lin Juncheng were dead, but they looked like living people again.","“Are they alive?”","Someone asked the question.","Feng Wu nodded. “They’ll live, but it’ll take them a few hours to wake up.”‘Search NewNovel* on google’","Yes, they were alive...","They each barely had half a body left, yet Feng Wu was able to save them!","Was she even human?","Feng Wu walked up to Shan Jingfei.","Shan Jingfei cringed, involuntarily feeling intimidated.","She paled when Feng Wu looked at her.","......","Is she going to kill me?","Does she want to take revenge for Ye Hongxue?","She...","The others also thought Feng Wu wanted to kill Shan Jingfei.","Before, many of them would have begged Feng Wu to forgive Shan Jingfei, but no one said a word now.","Not even Xin Zhixuan, her BFF, said anything.","Shan Jingfei’s face went ghastly pale.","However...","To everyone’s surprise, Feng Wu only patted her on the cheek. “I do want to kill you, but it’s not my call.","“Ye Hongxue tried to save you, but you almost killed her. That was the price of her kindness and foolishness.","“Therefore, she’ll be the one to give the verdict in the end.”","Shan Jingfei was still pale after Feng Wu said that, but she secretly rejoiced.","She would get back at Feng Wu as soon as they left the Secret Essence Mine.","“Tie her up,” Feng Wu said casually.","She was the leader of the team now, and even the Class A students wouldn’t question her command.","Xue Hao and his teammates hated Shan Jingfei to the bone. As soon as they heard Feng Wu’s order, they rushed toward Shan Jingfei and tied her up.","“Let’s go.”","Feng Wu led the way.","The others followed her.","They felt uneasy when she wasn’t around because they felt like they had lost their way.","Now that she was back, they knew that Feng Wu would show them the way.","Even Feng Wu herself probably hadn’t noticed that she was a natural leader.","The Secret Essence Mine was a tough problem even for Feng Wu.","To get out, she needed to do some careful research.","Luckily, she had the bird.","It had supervised the workers when the mine was built and still remembered the mine’s layout.","With Little Phoenix’s help, Feng Wu could lead them to the exit while studying the layout of the mine.","The bird was talking to her in her mind, so in other people’s eyes, Feng Wu was leading them out without any effort.","Feng Wu said, “Look. That’s the exit.”","Meanwhile, outside the mine.","Elder Mei was frowning.","The Level 8 formation was indeed hard to crack.","“Elder Mei, do you have any clues?” Gongsun Mu asked gingerly, worried about the students inside.","Elder Mei shook his head and went on thinking.","Zuo Qingluan had been trying to please Elder Mei so that he would teach her. She stepped out at that moment."]},{"number":2745,"title":"Chapter 2745 - No Hope","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan shook her head at Gongsun Mu. “Mr. Gongsun, please don’t rush the elder. I know you think you know a lot about formations, but solving them requires a lot of time!","“Moreover, this is a Level 8 formation and is especially difficult. It’s about as complicated as the one in the War Academy.","“If this one can be solved so easily, so can ours. Of course that can’t be the case.”","Zuo Qingluan kept emphasizing how complicated this formation was.","Gongsun Mu shook his head and sighed. “I’m just worried about the students inside, especially Feng Wu. Our school will be in a lot of trouble if anything happens to her.”","Mr. Wang of Class D snapped, “Mr. Gongsun, you shouldn’t make that claim. Feng Wu is just an ordinary student. Losing her won’t make a difference.”","Gongsun Mu glared at him. “You know nothing!”","Mr. Wang asked, “Does she have connections that I don’t know of?”","Gongsun Mu nodded. Imperial College couldn’t afford to offend that person.","“Who is it?” Mr. Wang was intrigued.","Zuo Qingluan had a bad feeling, and she stared at Gongsun Mu.","Gongsun Mu shook his head, not intending to reveal the secret.","Mr. Wang tried to goad him. “You don’t know, do you?”","......","Gongsun Mu frowned. “It’s His...”","Zuo Qingluan’s stomach lurched.","Fearing that Gongsun Mu would tell the truth, Zuo Qingluan cut him off. “Our top priority is to save them, and the rest can wait! Connections don’t matter! Everyone in Imperial College is treated equally!”","Both Zuo Qingluan and Gongsun Mu were vice chiefs. Although Zuo Qingluan was far less capable, she was from an influential family, which put them on the same level in status.","When Zuo Qingluan used a harsh tone, Mr. Wang didn’t dare speak.","Everyone turned to Elder Mei again.","“Is it still sealed?”","“It’s been a whole day...”","Mr. Duan, who had gone back to do some research, came back at that moment, looking rather pale.","The others asked what was going on.","Mr. Duan frowned. “I looked through some records of the Secret Essence Mine and noticed a serious problem.”","“What is it?” the others asked.","Mr. Duan showed them an ancient book. “Look. It says that in order to clean up the filth in the mine, small Spirit Stone Worms were put inside.","“Here’s something on the worms. They don’t need any light; they feed on spiritual stones and can live for hundreds of years.","“They can reproduce at a terrifying rate.","“If I’ve guessed correctly, the Secret Essence Mine is full of Spirit Stone Worms.”","Mr. Yang asked nervously, “What about the students inside...”","Mr. Duan turned pale as well. “I think they’re...”","It had been a whole day; there was no way they could survive in the mine.","Everyone turned slightly pale.","“There are 80,000 tunnels inside.” Mr. Duan sounded desperate. “We don’t have any hope of seeing those students again.”"]},{"number":2746,"title":"Chapter 2746 - Not Fair","paragraphs":["Everyone looked at Elder Mei.","Elder Mei was frowning.","Mr. Duan asked, “How long will it take to open this door?”","Elder Mei shook his head. “The formation is very complicated; it’ll take me at least seven days!”","Seven days?","Before he could say another word, he sensed a force inside the mine.","Crack!","The heavy bronze door rumbled.","Everyone jumped.","What the hell?","They looked at one another, and all of them moved away from the door.","“Elder Mei, what’s going on?” Mr. Yang asked.","Elder Mei was as confused as everyone else.","......","Seeing the look on Elder Mei’s face, Zuo Qingluan tried to save him from the awkward situation. “The Secret Essence Mine has been buried underground for so long; anything could have happened. I’m sure Elder Mei will figure it out soon.”","Hearing the crack, Mr. Yang was struck by an idea. “Can it be opened from inside?”","Elder Mei rolled his eyes.","Zuo Qingluan answered for him. “The door is locked from outside by the formation! How can it be opened from inside?!”","Elder Mei nodded. She was right. It couldn’t be opened from the inside.","Seeing this, Zuo Qingluan knew Elder Mei agreed with her, so she scolded Mr. Yang again. “Mr. Yang, please don’t speculate when you don’t know what’s going on. You’ll make the others panic.”","Mr. Yang was speechless.","But right at that moment!","Crack!","The sealed heavy door...","The door that Zuo Qingluan was so sure couldn’t be opened from the inside...","It slowly opened as everyone watched.","Everybody was astonished.","They all looked at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan was utterly embarrassed.","The sound of the door opening felt like a slap to her face.","It seemed to take forever for the door to open.","Zuo Qingluan had to live with the humiliation the entire time.","“Why is it open?” She was ready for battle. “Are the Spirit Stone Worms coming out?”","The tutors were all alarmed.","“Everybody, get ready for battle!” Zuo Qingluan shouted.","They all copied Zuo Qingluan and got into position to defend against the incoming enemy.","However, they only saw teenage students file out the door.","Feng Wu led the way, followed by Shao Xiao, Huo Shan and the others.","The last person’s head was covered with black cloth, and the person was tied up with layers of rope.","Everybody outside was shocked.","“Feng Wu?!” Mr. Yang was the first to recognize her.","He ran to her side and grabbed her hand. “You’re alive! I can’t believe it!”","When he looked past her, he was so excited that he almost couldn’t form a coherent sentence. “You’re all still alive...”","He was almost in tears.","Zuo Qingluan’s pupils contracted when she saw Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was still alive!","How could that be?","Why didn’t she die inside? Why was she still alive?!","This wasn’t fair!"]},{"number":2747,"title":"Chapter 2747 - Who Did This to You?","paragraphs":["Elder Mei was amazed when he saw the students.","He had believed the door was sealed and could only be opened from outside. How had these people opened it?","Could he have been wrong? Was the door not sealed?","While he was considering the possibilities, the others were thrilled.","“I’m so glad you’re all alright!” Gongsun Mu was relieved when he saw Feng Wu.","“Mr. Yang, do a headcount,” he told Mr. Yang.","Mr. Yang nodded and checked the name list.","He sounded worried when he said, “We’re short one person.”","“Who?” the others asked.","Just then, someone ran toward them, shouting, “Where’s Shan Jingfei? Has anyone seen her?”","It was none other than Qiu Zeyu, Shan Jingfei’s boyfriend.","He had come here in a hurry when he received the news, but he couldn’t find Shan Jingfei anywhere.","He rushed to Xue Hao’s side and asked, “Xue Hao, where’s Shan Jingfei? I told Xuecheng Team to look after her! Where is she now?!”","Xue Hao was reminded of what Shan Jingfei had done in the mine. His eyes went red, and he was so furious that he couldn’t say a word.","“Look at the stretchers!” He glared at Qiu Zeyu.","The stretchers?","He was referring to Ye Hongxue and Lin Juncheng.","Qiu Zeyu glanced at them without paying much attention. He went on asking, “Where’s Shan Jingfei? DId you lose her?”","Then he heard a whimper.","Everyone looked in the direction of the noise.","They saw Cui Ping and Wu Qing, two members of Xuecheng Team.","They were escorting a person.","The person was gagged and wearing a black cloth over the head. Because of that, the person could only whimper.","Qiu Zeyu found the person’s figure familiar, so he pulled off the black cloth.","Everybody saw who it was.","“Feifei!” Qiu Zeyu’s eyes widened when he saw Shan Jingfei. He looked from Xuecheng Team to their prisoner and was infuriated.","He pulled Shan Jingfei away from the two team members and shouted, “What do you think you’re doing?!”","Qiu Zeyu was a member of the second-seeded team and a top 10 student in Class A. Xuecheng Team wasn’t his match.","They couldn’t do anything when Qiu Zeyu dragged Shan Jingfei away.","Qiu Zeyu removed the rope around Shan Jingfei’s wrists and took out the cloth that was in her mouth. “Feifei, are you alright?”","Shan Jingfei was filled with resentment and frustration, and she finally found an outlet.","She burst into tears and wrapped her arms around Qiu Zeyu. “Zeyu, help me... They want to kill me! Please help me!”","Feng Wu wanted to sigh.","She considered herself to be a good actress, but Shan Jingfei’s acting was on a completely different level.","Shan Jingfei was Qiu Zeyu’s goddess, and it pained him to see her like this.","He wrapped his arms around Shan Jingfei and bellowed, “Who did this to you? Tell me!”"]},{"number":2748,"title":"Chapter 2748 - How Dare They?","paragraphs":["Qiu Zeyu wrapped his arms around Shan Jingfei and said sympathetically, “You’re such a kind girl! After what they did to you, you’re still trying to cover for them. They don’t deserve you!","“How evil are they? How could they do this to you?!”","Qiu Zeyu genuinely felt sorry for her.","What he didn’t know was how much his words disgusted Feng Wu and the others.","Shan Jingfei cried even louder.","Qiu Zeyu felt even more sympathetic. Seeing that Shan Jingfei wouldn’t name anyone, he turned to Cui Ping and Wu Qing.","“Speak!” Qiu Zeyu glared at them. “I’m going to make you pay for what you did to my baby!”","Wu Qing snorted. “Qiu Zeyu, just because you’re a member of the second-seeded team doesn’t mean you can deal out justice. We have rules!”","Cui Ping chimed in, “There’s justice in this world, and evil people will get what they deserve! If I were you, I would take a closer look at the woman in your arms!”","Qiu Zeyu had expected them to drop to their knees and beg for his forgiveness, but he couldn’t be any more wrong.","Feeling the girl tremble in his arms, Qiu Zeyu patted her on the back and said softly, “Don’t be afraid. I’ll right the wrong for you. I won’t let anyone harm you.”","After that, he looked at Cui Ping and Wu Qing again.","The next second, he took action.","He reached for Cui Ping’s throat.","Cui Ping was terrified.","He was much weaker than Qiu Zeyu and didn’t have the skill to dodge the attack.","It happened quicker than words could describe!","Mr. Duan stepped in. “We don’t have time for this! Stop it, all of you!”","Qiu Zeyu didn’t want to stop. “Mr. Yang, if I don’t punish them now, I can’t promise what I’ll do to them later.”","Mr. Duan frowned. Was Qiu Zeyu threatening him?","Cui Ping smirked. “Shan Jingfei almost got Ye Hongxue and Lin Juncheng killed. There! I said it!”","“No, I didn’t!”","Of course, Shan Jingfei wasn’t going to admit it in front of so many people. She denied it right away.","But everyone heard what Cui Ping said.","Mr. Duan frowned. “We’ll talk about it later. Don’t block that door. It’s the entrance to the Secret Essence Mine. Who knows when the wind will come back?”","Gongsun Mu nodded as well. “Go back to the school! We’ll deal with it later!”","While everyone was heading back, Feng Wu noticed an old man heading into the mine.","“Hey!”","Feng Wu stopped him. “Are you out of your mind? Don’t you know how dangerous it is inside? You can’t go in on your own! There are 80,000 tunnels and countless Spirit Stone Worms inside!”","Elder Mei gave her a strange look.","So did the others.","He was Elder Mei!","He was a prominent figure of the empire and a Level 8 formation master! How could a student talk to him that way?","Zuo Qingluan was secretly pleased to see Feng Wu make a fool of herself. She thought that Feng Wu was about to die."]},{"number":2749,"title":"Chapter 2749 - Gift","paragraphs":["Everyone gave Feng Wu strange looks.","Feng Wu ran to Elder Mei’s side. “Stay away from that mine if you don’t want to die.”","Elder Mei smirked.","He then glanced at Gongsun Mu.","Gongsun Mu intervened. “Feng Wu, this is Elder Mei!”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t care if he’s Elder May or Elder April. This mine has more than a few formations. If you go in alone, you’ll never come out.”","Elder Mei said, “That is a bold claim, young lady.”","Seeing that Elder Mei was angry, Gongsun Mu gave Feng Wu a warning look. “Elder Mei knows formations. He’s the...””Read more on newn0vel`org”","However, Feng Wu cut him off. “I think his knowledge is quite limited.”","Pffft!","Zuo Qingluan finally laughed.","Feng Wu was more arrogant than she had expected.","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t wait to become Elder Mei’s disciple, but Feng Wu had criticized the old man!","......","Elder Mei shook his head and walked toward the mine.","Feng Wu had no choice but to give him a paper crane. “Since you’re so stubborn, I don’t have anything else to say. Take this crane with you. If you can’t find the way, it’ll lead you out of the mine.”","Elder Mei wanted to laugh.","So did everyone else.","That was hilarious.","Had Feng Wu lost her mind?","He was Elder Mei!","He was the best formation master in Imperial College. What had she just said to him?","“Is your formation tutor Mr. Wu?” Mr. Xu asked Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded.","She nodded because she remembered Mr. Wu was the formation tutor in Imperial College, not that she had learned anything from him.","Mr. Xu gave her a strange look. “I’m Mr. Wu’s teacher.”","Feng Wu nodded. So what?","Mr. Xu said proudly, “And Elder Mei here is my tutor.”","Mr. Xu expected to see a stumped look on Feng Wu’s face, and he was ready to hear her apology.","But none of that happened.","Feng Wu only frowned at him.","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t stand it anymore. “Feng Wu, you’re so arrogant! I won’t let you offend Elder Mei!”","Elder Mei didn’t like Feng Wu at all.","Feng Wu was about to say something, when Elder Mei entered the mine.","Seeing this, Zuo Qingluan snuck in behind him.","She decided to use this chance to slander Feng Wu with all her might and become Elder Mei’s disciple.","Even if it was just wishful thinking.","Shan Jingfei wasn’t feeling as great as Zuo Qingluan.","After they went back to Imperial College, they were all taken to the chief’s office.","Gongsun Mu said, “You can tell me what happened now.”","“I didn’t do anything!” Shan Jingfei cried. “Why would I harm Ye Hongxue? That’s not like me! You’re making it up!”","Cui Ping smirked. “Stop pretending and admit what you did! Ye Hongxue wanted to save you, but you returned her kindness with ingratitude!”"]},{"number":2750,"title":"Chapter 2750 - Who’s the Bad Person?","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei said, “I didn’t...”","The quarreling gave Gongsun Mu a headache.","He said to Mr. Duan, “Let each of them write down what happened! I want all the details!”","How clever! ?Feng Wu thought to herself. Gongsun Mu was wiser than she had expected.","She glanced at Shan Jingfei and saw how pale she had become.","Qiu Zeyu smirked. “Let’s do it! The devil is in the details!”","Feng Wu smiled at him. “I’m glad you think that way.”","Qiu Zeyu glanced at her.","Although Feng Wu was much prettier than Shan Jingfei, he told himself that he wouldn’t be tempted.","The students sat down around the round table in the conference room.","They all started writing.","The only exceptions were Ye Hongxue and Lin Juncheng, who were still unconscious.","Feng Wu was the first to finish.","Shan Jingfei’s face darkened, and she glanced at her teammates.","Seeing that they were still writing, she calmed down a little.","She believed Xin Zhixuan would take her side because they were best friends.","Ye Han was her newest fan, so she shouldn’t say bad things about her either.","Gu Xingyuan seemed to like her, so he should be on her side, too.","And there were some others... In other words, Shan Jingfei wasn’t worried.","She finished hers and handed it in.","Gongsun Mu read through all the statements before giving them to the other tutors.","He gave Shan Jingfei a strange look.","After the other tutors read the statements, they stared at Shan Jingfei in the same way.","Mr. Yang glared at her.","“How dare you?!”","He was furious and disappointed.","Shan Jingfei’s stomach lurched.","What was going on?","Mr. Yang started at Shan Jingfei. “Tell me the truth!”","Shan Jingfei said, “I... I...”","She turned to Qiu Zeyu for help.","Qiu Zeyu said, “Feifei, don’t worry! I won’t let them wrong you!”","Shan Jingfei gritted her teeth. “We set out together. Then Feng Wu found us. She didn’t want to help us, but she still did, probably because she didn’t want to get blamed later.","“She then separated from us when she went to save someone else. The paper crane took us to the formation core. The worms wanted to eat us. Ye Hongxue helped me when I ran into the circle. She was so kind, and she was injured when she tried to save me. I accidentally pushed her out of the circle...”","She kept glancing at Qiu Zeyu as she spoke.","Qiu Zeyu thought, “She’s the kindest girl in the world.”","He said, “Feifei, don’t cry.”","“I’m so worried about Hongxue...”","“Feifei, don’t worry. You’re such a kind girl. I’m sure Ye Hongxue knows she did the right thing.”","“Right my ass!” Xue Hao couldn’t stand it anymore and threw a punch at Qiu Zeyu’s face.","Qiu Zeyu was much more capable, but he was taken by surprise.","The fist landed on his nose."]},{"number":2751,"title":"Chapter 2751 - Love the Wrong Person","paragraphs":["Qiu Zeyu raised his hand, ready to retaliate.","However, Mr. Duan frowned and shouted, “Qiu Zeyu, stop!”","Qiu Zeyu was dumbfounded.","Because of his talent, his tutors had always favored him and had never scolded him like this.","“Get your ass down here!” Mr. Duan was genuinely angry.","Qiu Zeyu rubbed his nose and glared at Xue Hao. He was determined to get back at the boy later.","When he walked up to Mr. Duan, the latter stuffed a stack of papers in his hand. “Read them!”","Qiu Zeyu was bored.","Why would he believe in those people’s stories?","However...","When he read through the statements, he saw that apart from Shan Jingfei, everyone had told the same story.","It seemed they agreed on the same thing!","Qiu Zeyu wanted to see who wrote what, but Mr. Duan gave him a stern look. “They’re all about the same events. It doesn’t matter who wrote what!”","Although Qiu Zeyu didn’t say anything, he agreed with his teacher.","However, it meant Shan Jingfei wasn’t as nice as he had thought.","That was an understatement. By the look of it, she was an ungrateful evil woman!","The contrast was so great that Qiu Zeyu didn’t know how to react.","Shan Jingfei grew uneasy when she saw everyone’s reactions.","However, she remained confident.","She believed she had some loyal fans here. Ye Han and Xin Zhixuan at least would support her.","However, Qiu Zeyu stared at her and asked, “Did you really drag Ye Hongxue out of the circle?”","Shan Jingfei looked at him in disbelief.","Qiu Zeyu took a step forward. “Ye Hongxue saved you. Did you really try to kill her?”","Shan Jingfei didn’t know what to say.","Qiu Zeyu took another step forward and glowered at her. “You’re so evil!”","Shan Jingfei backed away as Qiu Zeyu moved closer.","“It wasn’t me! I didn’t do that!” Shan Jingfei shook her head. “I would never do such a thing! I’d rather die than have someone die for me! Zeyu, you know what kind of person I am!”","Qiu Zeyu frowned and hesitated.","“But everyone wrote in their statements about how you betrayed Ye Hongxue, your savior!” Qiu Zeyu bellowed.","WHAT?!","Shan Jingfei was shocked.","Everyone?!","“Did you say everyone?” Shan Jingfei gritted her teeth. “All of them?”","Qiu Zeyu said, “Yes, everyone but you!”","Shan Jingfei looked like she had been struck by lightning.","That was to say, all her so-called loyal fans had betrayed her.","“Xin Zhixuan!” Shan Jingfei gritted her teeth and glared at the girl.","Xin Zhixuan had made up her mind when she wrote her statement.","She knew Shan Jingfei wasn’t a worthy friend after she saw what Shan Jingfei did to Ye Hongxue.","“Feifei, I’m sorry.” Xin Zhixuan smiled bitterly. “Hongxue saved you, but you betrayed her and almost got her killed. I can’t lie about that. Otherwise, it’ll haunt me for the rest of my life.”","She bowed, indicating that their friendship was over.","Shan Jingfei ground her teeth.","“Ye Han, what about you?”","Shan Jingfei stared at her. “Do you remember what you said when you came to me? You said you would do whatever I told you to do. You would even sell your soul to me! You’ve betrayed me!”","Ye Han shook her head. “Jingfei, Hongyue helped you, but you almost got her killed. I can’t imagine what you’ll do to me one day...”"]},{"number":2752,"title":"Chapter 2752 - Inform Her Parents","paragraphs":["Ye Han said, “If I get in your way one day, you won’t hesitate to kill me. I’m not brave enough to follow someone like you. I’m sorry.”","She gave Shan Jingfei a bow as well before standing on the side.","Shan Jingfei stared at her in astonishment.","Even Ye Han had betrayed her.","“Gu Xingyuan, what about you? Are you going to betray me, too? Didn’t you say you and Feng Wu were at odds? Didn’t you say you would never forgive Feng Wu for ruining your family?!” Shan Jingfei glared at Gu Xingyuan.","Gu Xingyuan felt conflicted.","He had wanted to help Shan Jingfei. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have joined her team.","However, he was bewildered by everything that had happened so far.","Feng Wu was his archenemy, but she was beyond his reach.","He had thought she was a Level 6 Spiritual Lord, but after seeing her fight, he realized she was at least a Level 9 Spiritual Lord. He wasn’t her match at all!","She also knew formations and inscriptions.","Gu Xingyuan had lost all hope.","Shan Jingfei was still staring at him.","Gu Xingyuan shook his head. “At odds? That suggests that both sides are matched in strength. Do you think I have that kind of capability?”","Shan Jingfei became desperate.","The more people she asked, the more hopeless she felt.","Qiu Zeyu asked, “Did you really do that to Ye Hongxue, your savior? Is this who you really are?”","Shan Jingfei closed her eyes. When she opened them again, she glared at Qiu Zeyu and said, “Yes, I dragged Ye Hongxue out!”","Rumble —","Those words shattered all Qiu Zeyu’s hopes.","He pointed at Shan Jingfei and couldn’t say a word.","In a way, Shan Jingfei was an incredible person.","She could pretend to be fragile or kind when she needed to. However, when she was exposed, she became utterly distant.","“You admitted it quickly enough.” Ye Hongxue stared at Shan Jingfei.","Shan Jingfei ground her teeth. “You’re still alive! I don’t owe you anything!”","Ye Hongxue’s voice was filled with hatred. “Do you know what you’ve done to me?”","Shan Jingfei didn’t speak.","Ye Hongxue said, “You’ve made me lose hope in people!”","“From now on, I’ll hesitate before I save someone. I’ll wonder if they’ll turn out to be as ungrateful as you! I don’t have that unconditional kindness anymore!”","She took a deep breath. “But I want to thank you, Shan Jingfei. You made me see the world from a different angle. I was so foolish before!”","Feng Wu felt sorry for Ye Hongxue, but she was pleased to see her change.","The incident had been a hard blow to Ye Hongxue, but it had also helped her grow.","Feng Wu patted Ye Hongxue on the shoulder. “You’re still alive.”","Ye Hongxue smiled and nodded. “Yes. Luckily, I’m still alive.”","She then turned to Mr. Yang. “Shan Jingfei must be punished for what she did!”","Shan Jingfei glared at her.","Ye Hongxue glared back. “That look you’re giving me means you haven’t repented. I won’t let you off the hook so easily.”","Shan Jingfei clenched her fists but didn’t dare say anything.","“Inform her parents.” Mr. Yang turned to Gongsun Mu. “It’s not something the academy can handle on its own. We must send for her parents.”"]},{"number":2753,"title":"Chapter 2753 - Shan Jingfei Won","paragraphs":["Shan Jingfei ground her teeth. She had always been a good daughter in her parents’ eyes. Telling them what happened here would be a humiliation!","She looked up and glared at Feng Wu.","Had it not been for Feng Wu, things would never have turned out like this.","The Shan family wasn’t one of the nine major clans, but it was still an influential one.","The parent who arrived at the War Academy was Shan Zhixiong, Shan Jingfei’s father.","It had never occurred to him that his perfect daughter would do something like this, and there was proof and witnesses.","Shan Zhixiong was petrified. He threw a dirty look at his daughter and was going to deal with her when they returned home.","However, Shan Jingfei stepped forward and looked at Gongsun Mu. “I want to make a request.","“I volunteer to go to Peace Grassland.”","Everyone looked at her in surprise.","Class B students didn’t know much about Peace Grassland.","All the students of Class A had been there before and knew how dangerous the place was.","Shan Jingfei said calmly, “I want to go to the battlefield and fight our enemies.","“I know I did the wrong thing, and I want to repent by giving my life to Hongxue. However, if I die like that, I would be wasting all the resources the school has invested in me.","“I want to fight the Dongsang soldiers on Peace Grassland. It’ll be a good way to spend the rest of my life!","“I want to stay there for at least three years. I’ll consider myself a fortunate person if I return alive. If I don’t, I won’t blame anyone either.”","Shan Zhixiong was astonished.","“No, you can’t!”","Shan Zhixiong was furious about what his daughter had done, but when he heard her request, he wouldn’t let her do that. “Peace Grassland is too dangerous! No one can stay there for that long! This is suicide!”","Shan Jingfei had tears in her eyes as she smiled sadly.","“Father, I did the wrong thing, and my crime is punishable by death. If I die in the war, I’ll get what I deserve. I’m sorry to have disappointed you.”","She then dropped to her knees and banged her forehead on the floor three times.","It pained Qiu Zeyu to see Shan Jingfei like this.","He gritted his teeth. “You don’t have to...”","“No, I have to. I did the wrong thing, and I have to take responsibility,” Shan Jingfei said firmly. She then turned to Feng Wu.","The smile on her face was almost genuine. “Feng Wu, I want to thank you. If you hadn’t pointed out my mistake, I wouldn’t have realized what I’d done. You woke me up.","“If you hadn’t taught me a lesson, I would still be the stubborn girl who wouldn’t admit her mistakes. Thank you.”","Feng Wu studied her and shook her head inwardly.","It wasn’t easy to beat Shan Jingfei.","Even in this situation, she could still escape punishment by going to Peace Grassland.","Once she was there, she would have plenty of chances to stay alive.","Moreover, if Shan Jingfei’s gratitude were genuine, she wouldn’t have made that little speech. She was trying to make people hate Feng Wu. She had done it on purpose.","It was incredible!","Shan Zhixiong and Qiu Zeyu glared at Feng Wu like she had killed all their family members.","Shan Jingfei bowed to Gongsun Mu and Mr. Yang. “Sir, would you please let me go to Peace Grassland?”"]},{"number":2754,"title":"Chapter 2754 - A Twist","paragraphs":["At this point, even Mr. Yang was moved.","He used to dote on Shan Jingfei, and was utterly disappointed by her true nature.","However, seeing that Shan Jingfei was going to take full responsibility, he was proud of her again.","“That’s great!”","Pleased, he patted her shoulder. “I’m so glad that you’re brave enough to accept the consequences. It’s never too late to correct your mistakes. Shan Jingfei, you’re going to be great!”","Feng Wu shook her head inwardly when she saw other people’s reactions.","These people were so gullible. How could they be fooled so easily?","However, she knew they wouldn’t listen to her now.","When the others saw Shan Jingfei off, the girl looked back at Feng Wu.","She smiled in a provoking manner before she walked away.","Ye Hongxue frowned. “Is it me, or was that an evil smile?”","Qiu Zeyu threw her a dirty look. “What more do you want? Ye Hongxue, you’re still alive!”","He walked off after that.","The last look he gave Feng Wu was rather terrifying.","Ye Hongxue was dumbfounded. “What did I do? I only asked a question...”","Shan Zhixiong stared at Feng Wu. “Miss Feng, I’ll remember what you did for my daughter!”","He left as well.","Another threat.","Mr. Yang said, “Feng Wu, we’re all done here. You can leave now.”","He had conflicted feelings about Feng Wu.","Naturally, he was biased toward Shan Jingfei, but he couldn’t deny that Feng Wu had done the right thing. Because of that, he couldn’t accuse Feng Wu of anything.","He didn’t like her, and everybody could tell.","Feng Wu couldn’t care less if Mr. Yang liked her or not. She reminded him, “Mr. Yang, it’s time to announce the final rankings.”","Hearing that, Mr. Yang liked her even less.","He decided that Feng Wu wasn’t as considerate as Shan Jingfei.","He thought, “She’s short-sighted and only cares about her own gains!”","He glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was perplexed. What did she do? She only wanted to know the final rankings.","Gongsun Mu had always taken Feng Wu’s side, so he intervened when he saw that Mr. Yang was angry.","“Although you ran into some difficulties, I’m so glad all of you came out alive. We need to thank Feng Wu for that.”","In their statements, everybody wrote about what Feng Wu had done for them.","Some went into detail, and others only mentioned it in passing, but nothing could change what Feng Wu had done.","What Gongsun Mu said was a reminder to Mr. Yang, who then realized that Feng Wu wasn’t an ordinary student.","Mr. Yang then went back to the statements and was surprised by what he read.","He had only focused on what Shan Jingfei had done when he read them the first time round. This time, he noticed more details.","“You led everyone out of the Secret Essence Mine?","“You knew the way out of the tunnels?","“You understand formations?","“You know inscriptions, too?”","Mr. Yang showered Feng Wu with questions.","However, Feng Wu was a proud girl.","It was obvious that Mr. Yang didn’t like her, so she had no reason to answer his questions.","She only frowned and asked, “Can we announce the rankings now?”","Mr. Yang was furious that he was being ignored."]},{"number":2755,"title":"Chapter 2755 - The Master Swordsman","paragraphs":["Mr. Yang looked at Feng Wu and said, “We should all learn to be more forgiving.”","He was hinting to Feng Wu about Shan Jingfei.","Feng Wu shook her head. “A leopard cannot change its spots.”","Mr. Yang shook his head. She was too difficult to teach; he missed Shan Jingfei, the obedient girl.","“Gather everyone on the sports ground. We’ll make the announcement.”","Mr. Yang sounded somewhat disappointed.","Hearing that, all the Class B students rushed to the sports ground, and Xuecheng Team was left behind.","Mr. Duan asked curiously, “What am I reading here? Did Feng Wu really lead you out of that mine?”","Ye Hongxue nodded. “Sir, Feng Wu is much more capable than you think.”","Mr. Duan was curious. “In that case, are you saying that she’s good enough to go to Class A?”","Ye Hongxue and her friends gave him strange looks.","Xue Hao smiled bitterly. “Mr. Duan, you’re making fun of us.”","Mr. Duan was relieved, until Xue Hao added, “She’s beyond that. I’m sure she’ll be among the top 5 students in our class.”","Xue Hao hesitated a little and turned to his teammates for their opinion.","Ye Hongxue shook her head. “Top 5? No, she’ll definitely be the best student in Class A!”","What?","Mr. Duan had been amazed by Feng Wu, but when he heard this, he thought the students were exaggerating.","He didn’t believe them.","“Fine.” He stopped them with a wave of his hand. “Go back to your class.”","“Sir...” Ye Hongxue asked before they left, “may we ask why the ground caved in?”","The information was being kept confidential, but because Ye Hongxue and her team had almost been killed, perhaps they could get an explanation. Mr. Duan looked at Gongsun Mu.","Gongsun Mu shook his head. “Chu Tianxiao slashed the ground open with a single strike.”","“Chu Tianxiao?” Ye Hongxue and the others were surprised. “As in Master Chu Tianxiao from our textbooks?”","Gongsun Mu nodded.","The students were astonished.","They had assumed that the man had already been dead for many years. However, he was still alive.","“How old would that make him now? He must be immortal! What kind of power can open up the ground like that? That’s so scary.”","“So, that swordsman in white was Master Chu Tianxiao. Gosh! We would have gone out and met him if we knew who he was!”","Mr. Gongsun and Mr. Duan looked at them in surprise. “Did you see the old master?”","“Sir, he wasn’t old at all.” Ye Hongxue shook her head.","Mr. Duan said, “So he has been active since the establishment of Imperial College! What does he look like now?”","“I didn’t see.” Ye Hongxue shook her head. “We were too far away and didn’t dare move closer. Feng Wu ran to his side, though!”","“What? Feng Wu saw him? Did she walk up to him?” Mr. Duan was shocked. “Why wasn’t she killed?”","Ye Hongxue said, “I don’t know. I think she even talked to him.”","Both Mr. Duan and Gongsun Mu were astonished.","“She talked to him?! Doesn’t she know how formidable that master is? His master was Mu Jiuzhou, who once ruled the continent!”"]},{"number":2756,"title":"Chapter 2756 - Greatest Man On the Continent","paragraphs":["That was crazy!","Chu Tianxiao had such a terrifying background.","With Mu Jiuzhou as his master, he could get away with anything!","“Feng Wu is so bold!” Gongsun Mu was still in a state of shock. “That old master isn’t the most easygoing person. She was very lucky!”","Mr. Duan smiled bitterly. He decided that Feng Wu was too much trouble and that he should keep his distance.","By then, Feng Wu had arrived at the sports ground.","Despite his reluctance, Mr. Yang announced the final rankings.","Because of the countless Spirit Stone Worms Feng Wu had hunted, she was first.","Her team was the best as well.","Shan Jingfei’s team was nowhere close.","The school had blocked the news that it was Feng Wu who had saved all the students.","Because a master like Chu Tianxiao was involved, the school had everybody sign a confidentiality agreement.","It successfully kept the news from spreading.","......","Feng Wu had only joined Class B, so the students didn’t know her well.","“Feng Wu is first. Seriously?”","“Why? What did she do to get there?”","“What about Shan Jingfei? Where’s our class president? I haven’t seen her. Is she alright?”","“I saw her father just then, and he was storming off. He said Jingfei has gone to Peace Grassland.”","“Peace Grassland? Isn’t there a war over there? Why did she suddenly go there?”","“Feng Wu only became first after Shan Jingfei left, didn’t she?”","“What’s Feng Wu’s background? How could she make Jingfei leave?”","“Who knows? She sure has a pretty face.”","“It has to be her doing!”","When a person or a force was on the rise, they would always be criticized at first.","The students didn’t know what really happened, so they could only follow their instincts.","They instinctively questioned why Feng Wu received so much attention.","Public opinion wasn’t on Feng Wu’s side.","Shao Xiao and his friends were frustrated.","Shan Jingfei had gotten what she deserved, but everyone was blaming Feng Wu now. Feng Wu was their savior!","She had even saved Class A’s Xuecheng Team!","She knew formations and inscriptions, and she was even a Supreme Level medicine refiner!","When they told the others about Feng Wu’s abilities, the others just looked at them as if they had lost their minds.","Shao Xiao shouted in frustration, “It’s true! We’re telling the truth!”","And the crowd was speechless.","They shook their heads and walked away.","They believed that Shao Xiao and his friends had gone mad.","Feng Wu had to have a very powerful patron. That was the only reason Shao Xiao and the others could say such shameless things.","Shao Xiao was furious.","Ling Hao said, “We’re telling the truth! Why won’t they believe us? They’re even covering their ears!”","Huo Shan said, “That’s better than how they reacted when I spoke. They spat at me and called me a sycophant!”","He then changed his tone. “So what if I am one? Not every person gets to be Feng Wu’s sycophant! Ye Han would like to be one now, but do you think Feng Wu will take her?”","Ye Han was furious.","Since when did she say that?","However, she was filled with despair when she recalled how capable Feng Wu was."]},{"number":2757,"title":"Chapter 2757 - How Can She Be So Capable?","paragraphs":["Ye Han felt that it was hopeless.","How could Feng Wu be so capable?","She wanted to be Feng Wu’s enemy, but that would be like an ant threatening to kill an eagle.","She felt ridiculous.","She walked away, full of despair.","She needed to work very hard before she could consider herself Feng Wu’s enemy.","Meanwhile, it was already announced that Feng Wu was first.","That meant she could be promoted to Class A.","But she didn’t go there. Instead, she went to Dynasty Team.","Most of the Class A students had gone to Peace Grassland, and only a handful remained in the academy.","Chen Ziyun was the leader of Dynasty Team, which was known as the seeded team.","There were ten of them in total. The varsity and junior varsity teams each contained five members.","Qiu Zeyu, the boy in love with Shan Jingfei, was the captain of the junior varsity team.","Dynasty Team had their own training venue.","It was in the center of the academy and close to the core of the formation.","It was where the spiritual essence was the densest, which showed how important the team was.","Qiu Zeyu was with three other boys.","One of them smiled brightly and teased him.","“Zeyu, your girl is coming, right? We finally get to meet her.”","“Yes, finally! After Mingyu left, Zeyu saved that spot for Feifei. No one else will take it!”","Qiu Zeyu’s face darkened when he heard that.","Yes, he had saved that spot for Shan Jingfei, but she had been defeated and had left for Peace Grassland. She wasn’t coming here.","Before he could say anything, they heard footsteps outside.","“She’s here! Zeyu’s girl is here!”","Qiu Zeyu’s face was livid. He was about to say something, when his friends pushed him toward the door.","There was a knock.","The door wasn’t locked, and a beautiful face appeared.","“Is this the junior varsity team?”","The boys were astonished when they saw Feng Wu’s face.","Since when did they have such a beautiful girl here in the academy?","They had seen Shan Jingfei before, and she was as pretty as a campus belle should be.","However, compared with this girl, Shan Jingfei couldn’t be any more ordinary.","“You... You’re...” Chu Qu was the most active member of the team, but he was stammering, and even his ears had turned pink.","It was love at first sight!”","Chu Qu wasn’t alone.","The other two boys were dumbfounded as well. They couldn’t look away.","She was everything they dreamed of!","Seeing the strange looks on their faces, Feng Wu backed out to check the plate on the wall.","She was in the right room.","She recognized Qiu Zeyu.","She frowned at Qiu Zeyu and asked, “This is the junior varsity team, right?”","The sight of Feng Wu reminded Qiu Zeyu of Shan Jingfei, and he wondered how his Feifei would do in the grassland.","Hatred filled his eyes.","He glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “Where’s your captain?”","Qiu Zeyu was the captain of this team.","“Shan Jingfei?” Chu Qu asked enviously.","The other two boys also gave Qiu Zeyu jealous looks."]},{"number":2758,"title":"Chapter 2758 - Qiu Zeyu’s Girl?","paragraphs":["“Are you really Shan Jingfei?” the other two teenagers asked.","Qiu Zeyu smirked. “No, she’s not! This is Feng Wu! She’s just joined us!”","Although the boys hadn’t heard the name before, they were relieved to hear that she wasn’t Qiu Zeyu’s girl.","So, she was a new student. They thought they had a chance.","However, before they could start celebrating, they heard Feng Wu ask, “Who’s the captain?”","They pushed Qiu Zeyu toward her. “Here he is.”","They all looked at Qiu Zeyu, hoping that he could say some nice things about them.","These idiots! Qiu Zeyu gritted his teeth.","He had wanted to warn them so that they could turn against Feng Wu together. By the look of things, that was never going to happen.","Feng Wu smiled at them. “I’m here to register. Can you show me what I should do?”","Chu Qu asked eagerly, “What do you need? I’ll give you a hand! I get along with everyone in Class A.”","The other two teenagers also hovered around Feng Wu.","“We’ll come with you!”","......","Feng Wu turned to Qiu Zeyu. “Are you coming?”","Qiu Zeyu snorted and looked away.","Feng Wu wasn’t affected and smiled at the other three boys, “I won first place in Class B, and I’m a member of the junior varsity team now.”","“What?”","“You?”","“No way!”","“What about Shan Jingfei? I thought this spot was reserved for her...”","Everyone turned to Qiu Zeyu.","Qiu Zeyu’s face went livid. He smirked and said, “Feng Wu, you actually came. That’s very bold of you.”","Feng Wu was perplexed. “Why shouldn’t I come?”","Qiu Zeyu was about to answer, when Feng Wu cut him off. “I didn’t lead my team into a death trap.","“I didn’t try to get people killed.","“I didn’t return kindness with ingratitude and tried to kill the person who saved my life.","“I didn’t...”","“That’s enough!” Qiu Zeyu bellowed.","Every word felt like a slap to his face, and his cheeks twitched.","He turned to the other three boys. “It’s either her or me! Make your choice!”","He then stormed off and slammed the door.","Chu Qu was speechless.","So were the other two.","They asked Feng Wu, “What’s the matter with our captain?”","Feng Wu said calmly, “He’s angry because he’s ashamed.”","Chu Qu was speechless.","He had never met a new member who was so calm.","Did she know she was the newbie here?","Shouldn’t the new member be timid and careful?","Feng Wu looked at them. “Can we start now?”","Chu Qu had a feeling that one wouldn’t want to mess with this girl.","He decided to take her to the captain of the varsity team since Qiu Zeyu obviously couldn’t handle her.","Chu Qu said, “Sure. Let’s get going. I’ll take you to the captain of the varsity team. If he agrees, you’ll be the new member of our team.”","Feng Wu asked, “Who’s that?”","Chu Qu said, “He’s Chen Ziyun, and he’s amazing...”","While Chu Qu was singing Chen Ziyun’s praises, Feng Wu frowned.","Why did that name sound familiar?"]},{"number":2759,"title":"Chapter 2759 - Team Members","paragraphs":["Qiu Zeyu went to the stadium next door.","There were two stadiums, one which belonged to the varsity team and the other to the junior varsity team.","Feng Wu had won a place in the junior varsity team, but she needed recognition from the varsity team.","“What if Chen Ziyun won’t take me?” Feng Wu asked Chu Qu.","Chu Qu looked around to make sure that Qiu Zeyu wasn’t nearby. He then leaned in closer and whispered, “If neither Captain Chen nor Captain Qiu will take you, you’ll be sent back.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Chu Qu reminded Feng Wu, “Captain Chen is all about formalities. When you meet him, you can’t address him by his name. You need to call him ‘Captain Chen,’ alright?”","Chu Qu was a kind person, and he found Feng Wu adorable. Although Qiu Zeyu had made it clear that he didn’t like Feng Wu, Chu Qu was still friendly toward her.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Are you sure Qiu Zeyu won’t blame you for telling me that?”","Chu Qu looked at her. “Do you want to hear the truth?”","Feng Wu said, “Do tell.”","Chu Qu said, “We didn’t agree when Qiu Zeyu wanted to reserve that place for Shan Jingfei. He was abusing his power. However, Shan Jingfei is almost capable enough to win that place, so we didn’t object.","“As for you... I don’t know how you got here, but Qiu Zeyu doesn’t like you, and Captain Chen will only play by the book. I don’t think you’ll be with us for much longer.","......","“In that case, it won’t hurt anybody if I just show you around.”","Feng Wu looked at him.","What they said was true. The War Academy only had elite students. Chu Qu wasn’t as naive as he appeared to be.","The friendly boy next door was only a disguise he was wearing.","Feng Wu smiled. “I didn’t think much of the seeded team. I think I may change my opinion now.”","Chu Qu and his teammates looked at one another in amazement.","What an arrogant girl!","They thought she might not be good enough for this team. As it turned out, she didn’t think they were good enough for her either.","Had they missed something?","Chu Qu had looked through Feng Wu’s file to ensure that she really was a new student.","She didn’t sound like someone who had only joined the school less than six months ago.","Chu Qu was speechless.","So were his teammates.","Pretty girls nowadays could be so proud.","They had liked Feng Wu at first, but her “arrogance” made them change their opinion, and they were hoping to see what Captain Chen would do to her.","Unfortunately, they didn’t know that Feng Wu was capable enough to make such a claim.","Qiu Zeyu arrived at the varsity team before Feng Wu did.","“Zeyu, what’s wrong? You look so angry.”","The varsity team had five members, and the speaker was Wang Xiao, who was the closest to Qiu Zeyu out of the five.","Qiu Zeyu sat down angrily and smacked the table. “This is ridiculous!”","“So, someone has offended you. Was it your lovely fiancee?” Wang Xiao teased him.","The mention of Shan Jingfei made Qiu Zeyu even more furious."]},{"number":2760,"title":"Chapter 2760 - Complaint","paragraphs":["Qiu Zeyu looked furious when Shan Jingfei’s name was mentioned.","He also looked pained.","He buried his face in his hands, and when he looked up again, his eyes were red.","Wang Xiao was astonished.","They had been friends for years, but he had never seen Qiu Zeyu so angry.","“What happened?” Wang Xiao poured Qiu Zeyu a cup of water and sat down opposite him.","“We’re friends, so tell me what I can do.” Wang Xiao patted his shoulder.","“If I can’t help you, there’s always Brother Chen. Have you forgotten how close we are?” Wang Xiao sounded smug.","Wang Xiao and Chen Ziyun were very good friends. One could almost call them best buddies.","Qiu Zeyu rubbed his eyes and almost burst into tears.","Qiu Zeyu wiped his eyes when Wang Xiao wasn’t looking.","No one saw his tears.","A long while passed before he fought back his tears. “Feifei is dead...”","“What?!” Wang Xiao almost jumped to his feet.","“What happened? She was perfectly fine two days ago, wasn’t she? You saved that spot for her! I reported it to Ziyun, and he immediately said yes! Even I was surprised. This proves that Ziyun has recognized her capability. How did she die? Did someone kill her?”","Qiu Zeyu was pleasantly surprised when he heard what Wang Xiao said. He asked excitedly, “Did Captain Chen agree to give that place to Feifei when you told him it was my request?”","If that was the case, did that mean that Chen Ziyun would take care of Feng Wu?","Wang Xiao tilted his head. “I told him that we could pick a student from Class B and train them. You Ming is in poor health, and a new member can replace him.","“Ziyun immediately said yes. He said to choose the best student in Class B.”","Wang Xiao turned to Qiu Zeyu. “Everybody knows that Shan Jingfei is the best student in Class B. Of course that place is hers.”","Qiu Zeyu knew that Feng Wu was probably as good as Shan Jingfei, but he hadn’t seen her fight, so he was suspicious of her real capability.","As for Chen Ziyun...","Being the head of the Martial Arts Society and the captain of the varsity team, he would be too busy to notice a new student like Feng Wu.","He had no doubt that Chen Ziyun was referring to Shan Jingfei.","The thought excited him because he believed he wasn’t alone in this. Chen Ziyun was on his side!","Feng Wu, you’re dead!","“What happened to Shan Jingfei? How did she die so suddenly? Why didn’t I hear anything?” Wang Xiao frowned at Qiu Zeyu.","Qiu Zeyu had come here ahead of Feng Wu because he wanted to convince the others that Feng Wu was the villain.","When Wang Xiao asked, he told a dramatized version of what really happened.","Knowing that the others had signed a non-disclosure agreement, he lied about what happened and made Shan Jingfei the innocent girl whom Feng Wu had set up.","He did everything he could to slander Feng Wu.","“Feifei is alive now, but she’s as good as dead!” Qiu Zeyu gritted his teeth. “She was forced to go to Peace Grassland and was made a member of the suicide squad!”"]},{"number":2761,"title":"Chapter 2761 - Feng Wu Is Outrageous","paragraphs":["“That Feng Wu is outrageous!” Hearing Qiu Zeyu’s description, Wang Xiao didn’t like Feng Wu at all.","“I can’t believe someone can be so vile.”","Sun Yu, another member of the varsity team, interjected, “Wait. Something doesn’t add up.”","Wang Xiao looked at him.","Sun Yu said, “You care about Qiu Zeyu so much that you may have missed a few details. I think there are some loopholes in that story.”","He then turned to Qiu Zeyu. “You said Shan Jingfei offended Feng Wu, so Feng Wu set her up and forced her to go to Peace Grassland.”","Qiu Zeyu nodded. “That’s right.”","Sun Yu asked, “Were you there when that happened?”","Qiu Zeyu said, “Of course!”","Sun Yu said, “Is Feng Wu well-connected?”","Qiu Zeyu hesitated.","Sun Yu said, “The answer is no, then.”","Qiu Zeyu said, “Maybe she is.”","......","Sun Yu asked, “Who’s her patron?”","Qiu Zeyu didn’t know what to say.","Sun Yu stared at him and frowned. “I know you. You never let things drop, even if your actions aren’t justified. Why would you let her do such a thing when you think you can justify yourself?”","Qiu Zeyu was speechless. After the initial surprise, he glared at Sun Yu.","He was supposed to be a friend. Why would he say that?","Frustrated, he wanted to punch Sun Yu. However, they heard footsteps outside.","Chu Qu had brought Feng Wu here.","Chu Qu stuck his head into the room to find Qiu Zeyu there. He smiled awkwardly, “Feng Wu, this is as far as...”","He was cut off by an angry voice.","“Chu Qu, get your ass down here!”","It was Qiu Zeyu.","Chu Qu rubbed his nose and realized Qiu Zeyu was angrier than he had expected.","Feng Wu led the others into the room.","“What a pretty girl!” Wang Xiao, who had been feeling indignant about what happened to Qiu Zeyu a moment ago, was elated to see such a beautiful girl. His eyes lit up, and he was the first to greet Feng Wu.","“May I ask your name? Who are you looking for? I’m Wang Xiao, and I can find anybody for you!” Wang Xiao patted his chest.","She was so beautiful. Not only that, there was also something about her which made it impossible for one to look away.","“I’m Feng Wu.” Feng Wu nodded at Wang Xiao.","Feng Wu? Why did that name sound so familiar?","Wang Xiao scratched his head. He suddenly felt Qiu Zeyu glaring at him and was reminded of something.","Feng Wu?!","“You’re Feng Wu!” Wang Xiao stared at the girl in disbelief. She seemed so innocent and harmless!","Feng Wu nodded, unaffected by his attitude.","Wang Xiao didn’t know how to react.","He was going to shake her hand, but now, he had to awkwardly put it down.","Sun Yu, who had questioned Qiu Zeyu before, stepped out and asked Feng Wu, “Are you the new member of our team?”","Feng Wu found him to be a reasonable person, so she nodded. “Yes. I’m here to register.”","Sun Yu frowned a little. “Before that, I think you need to explain what happened to Shan Jingfei.”","Shan Jingfei?” Feng Wu glanced at Qiu Zeyu.","Qiu Zeyu was still angry, but he avoided Feng Wu’s gaze.","He slowly moved toward the door."]},{"number":2762,"title":"Chapter 2762 - Confrontation","paragraphs":["Feng Wu immediately saw what Qiu Zeyu’s plan was.","He was trying to make her the villain! Feng Wu glanced at Qiu Zeyu before turning to Sun Yu.","“First of all, I’d like to know what Qiu Zeyu told you.”","Qiu Zeyu grew uneasy.","Sun Yu said, “He said you set up Shan Jingfei, and Mr. Gongsun Mu sent her to a suicide squad in Peace Grassland. Is that true?”","Feng Wu was shocked. “Did he really say that?”","Sun Yu nodded. “Is it true?”","Feng Wu didn’t answer him. Instead, she walked up to Qiu Zeyu and smirked. “Do you have the guts to tell that story again in front of everyone?”","Qiu Zeyu was frustrated.","“Of course! I’m not scared of you!” He glared at Feng Wu. “I’m telling the truth!”","“Fine.” Feng Wu nodded. “I’ve had enough of your bullsh*t.","“I’m taking you to see Mr. Gongsun Mu and Mr. Duan. I’d like to see you tell that story to them!”","She then grabbed Qiu Zeyu by the neck and dragged him toward the door.","......","Qiu Zeyu felt as helpless as a chicken!","Everybody was astonished, including Qiu Zeyu himself.","He wanted to break free.","However, Feng Wu was so powerful that her grip felt like an iron clamp. He couldn’t get away from her.","There was nothing he could do.","Qiu Zeyu, the captain of the junior varsity team, was being dragged away like a chicken.","Was Feng Wu even human?","Qiu Zeyu failed the first time when he tried to get away.","He then used all his power.","To his frustration, he still couldn’t get away.","He felt so humiliated that he tried even harder.","The sad truth was that nothing he did could loosen Feng Wu’s grip.","D*mn it!","Qiu Zeyu had never felt so defeated before.","He had always been proud of his power, and what was happening was a hard blow to him.","He thought he was so much better than Feng Wu and had planned to teach her a lesson someday.","But now... He knew that wasn’t going to happen.","Wang Xiao saw Feng Wu drag Qiu Zeyu away and noticed that Qiu Zeyu was too scared to struggle, so he blocked Feng Wu’s way. “Stop! Put him down!”","Feng Wu stared at him. “Out of my way.”","Wang Xiao wouldn’t move.","Feng Wu frowned. “Don’t make me say it again.”","If he wouldn’t move, she would make him move.","They heard footsteps at that moment.","“What’s going on?” It was a stern and authoritative voice.","Everybody looked up.","“Captain Chen!”","“Ziyun!”","“Boss!”","It was none other than Chen Ziyun himself.","He had two team members with him.","Together with Sun Yu and Wang Xiao, the entire team was here.","“Ziyun!”","Qiu Zeyu shouted when he saw Chen Ziyun. “Help me!”","Chen Ziyun frowned when he saw the sorry state he was in.","He was shocked by Feng Wu’s beauty when he saw her face.","It made him wonder.","Since when was there such a pretty girl in the academy? He only knew one pretty girl, and her name was Feng Wu. Feng Xun had asked him to watch over her."]},{"number":2763,"title":"Chapter 2763 - You’re Feng Wu","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun looked at Feng Wu. “Who are you?”","Wang Xiao answered the question for her. “She’s Feng Wu! I don’t know where she came from, but she can’t run wild here in our territory! Who does she think she is?”","He was so angry.","Qiu Zeyu was his buddy, and he felt so humiliated to see him being dragged around like that.","However...","Chen Ziyun didn’t hear anything after hearing Feng Wu’s name.","Feng Wu... Feng Wu...","She was the girl that Feng Xun had asked him to look after.","Chen Ziyun had gone away for a while, so he had asked Huo Shan to keep an eye on her. Wait, hadn’t Feng Wu only joined them a short while ago? She was supposed to be a new student in Class B.","“You’re... Feng Wu.” Chen Ziyun looked at her in astonishment.","Feng Wu nodded.","Chen Ziyun slowly looked from her face to her hand.","She had Qiu Zeyu by the collar.","......","Qiu Zeyu was a member of his team.","He was a top 10 student in Class A.","Chen Ziyun’s face twitched.","Why would such a capable girl need his protection? He wasn’t sure if he was her match!","Seeing that Chen Ziyun wasn’t speaking, Wang Xiao told him the story that Qiu Zeyu had made up.","In the end, he said, “Ziyun, she’s too arrogant. We can’t have her on our team!”","Chen Ziyun had the right to turn down any candidate.","Wang Xiao looked at Chen Ziyun expectantly before glancing at Feng Wu.","He thought, “Yes, you’re pretty, but with that lousy personality, no team will have you!”","Everybody else in the room gave Feng Wu sympathetic looks.","They didn’t know how she had pushed Shan Jingfei away and stolen her place, but with Chen Ziyun here, she would never be accepted.","Wang Xiao was Chen Ziyun’s best friend!","However...","What Chen Ziyun said next almost made Wang Xiao jump.","Chen Ziyun walked up to Feng Wu, lowered his head and looked into her eyes with a smile.","“So, you’re Feng Wu. I’ve heard so many good things about you! Who would have thought you can be so outstanding at such a young age?”","He was going to pat her on the shoulder, but when he recalled that the girl was protected by Young Lord Feng, he didn’t dare touch her.","He awkwardly drew back his hand and cleared his throat, reminding himself that she was his equal, not his junior.","His teammates were astonished.","Chu Qu stared at Chen Ziyun.","What was going on? That wasn’t supposed to happen!","Wang Xiao and Sun Yu looked at each other in disbelief.","“Is the captain alright?”","“Ziyun!” Wang Xiao stepped forward and frowned. “According to Qiu Zeyu, Feng Wu isn’t a nice person!”","Chen Ziyun threw a dirty look at him. “According to Qiu Zeyu, is it? Do you believe everything he says? Are you an idiot?!”","Qiu Zeyu was speechless.","So was Wang Xiao.","The crowd was speechless.","Their captain had never scolded them like that before. What happened? Why did he seem so nervous?"]},{"number":2764,"title":"Chapter 2764 - Chastised","paragraphs":["Of course Chen Ziyun was nervous.","Young Lord Feng cared about this girl so much that he treated her like a princess.","Wang Xiao had no idea why Chen Ziyun shouted at him. He kicked the ground with the tip of his foot and felt wronged.","Chen Ziyun gave him a stern look, but his face lit up when he turned to Feng Wu.","“M... I mean, come in, Miss Feng Wu.” Chen Ziyun had almost addressed her as “my lady.”","Feng Wu frowned. “Why do you believe me?”","Chen Ziyun was surprised. “Why wouldn’t I?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Do you believe Shan Jingfei had it coming?”","Chen Ziyun nodded, “Of course she did!” He wouldn’t expect any less of someone who had offended the girl Young Lord Feng doted on.","Feng Wu said, “Does that mean you believe me when I say that Qiu Zeyu is lying?”","All eyes were on Chen Ziyun.","Chen Ziyun said, “Naturally! I can’t believe a single word out of his mouth!”","Qiu Zeyu was almost in tears.","Since when was he so untrustworthy? Why shouldn’t Chen Ziyun believe him?","Seeing that Chen Ziyun was more clever than she thought, Feng Wu ignored Qiu Zeyu and told Chen Ziyun, “I’m here to register.”","“It’s our pleasure. Please come in,” Chen Ziyun said respectfully.","Wang Xiao and the others were astonished.","Chen Ziyun had always been a proud and unapproachable man.","His boss was Young Lord Feng.","And Young Lord Feng’s boss was the crown prince. Talk about connections.","Why did it feel like Chen Ziyuan was fawning on Feng Wu?","“Am I seeing things?” Wang Xiao rubbed his eyes and tried to convince himself otherwise.","“Wang Xiao!” Chen Ziyun called his name in a stern tone.","“Yes! Coming!”","Wang Xiao was woken up from his reverie, and he rushed into the room.","He thought Chen Ziyun was going to ask him to help Feng Wu with her registration, and he was ready to object.","However...","Wang Xiao soon realized he couldn’t be any more wrong.","Chen Ziyun glanced at him and said impatiently, “What did you say about Miss Feng Wu just then?”","Wang Xiao stammered, “Well, I...”","Chen Ziyun smirked. “I’m taking Miss Feng Wu to the registration office. You stay here and reflect on what you did wrong! You’re not going anywhere until you give me a satisfactory answer!”","What? Chen Ziyun was taking Feng Wu to the registration office?","Personally?","Everyone looked at one another in bewilderment.","Wang Xiao couldn’t control his temper anymore. “D*mn it! Who the hell is that girl?”","Everybody shook their heads.","“I have no idea. It feels like she came out of nowhere.”","Chu Qu raised his hand. “I asked around in Class B and found out something about her.”","“Speak!”","The others were so curious.","“She’s supposed to be an outstanding student. She only joined the War Academy a few months ago. She started in Class E and moved up to Class B. Wait. If she’s here, that means she’s at least among the top 10 students in Class A!”","His words were met with silence.","Feng Wu’s resume was too unbelievable.","They didn’t know what to say.","Chu Qu said, “She’s so pretty and so talented. No wonder Captain Chen is so obsequious...”","“Ahem!” Sun Yu rolled his eyes at him. “Watch your language.”","Chu Qu grinned. “I’m only trying to say that Captain Chen seems to have a thing for Feng Wu.”"]},{"number":2765,"title":"Chapter 2765 - Teasing","paragraphs":["The others chuckled along when they heard Chu Qu’s teasing.","“So that’s what this is about.” They looked at one another and reached a tacit understanding.","“Captain Chen is so lucky,” someone mumbled enviously.","The others nodded. If they had a beautiful girlfriend like Feng Wu, they would behave the same way.","Qiu Zeyu wanted to slap himself.","He felt like an idiot.","He had tried to slander Captain Chen’s girl. “Ziyun is going to hate me for this! My life will be so miserable!”","The thought made him shudder.","“Will I be kicked out?” Qiu Zeyu asked timidly.","The others looked at him in resignation.","Wang Xiao didn’t give up.","“Qiu Zeyu, don’t be scared! So what if she’s Ziyun’s girlfriend? He has to be just and play by the book! Don’t worry! He won’t publicly punish you for that!”","“What about privately?”","Qiu Zeyu still wanted to cry.","Everybody felt sorry for him. It was such an unlucky day for him.","“It’s all my fault! Shan Jingfei was sent to Peace Grassland because she did something wrong. She deserved the punishment. I was only trying to blame it on Feng Wu because I thought she didn’t have any connections! I should have known better!” Qiu Zeyu wanted to pull out his hair.","Wang Xiao was utterly disappointed.","“Have you given up already?”","Qiu Zeyu asked, “Will I be kicked out?”","Wang Xiao was frustrated that Qiu Zeyu was already feeling defeated.","A member of Dynasty Team should show more confidence!","He should stand his ground!","Wang Xiao no longer cared about which girl was right. He only knew he couldn’t lose this fight.","Chen Ziyun took Feng Wu to Gongsun Mu.","To complete the registration, Feng Wu needed the signatures of the two vice chiefs of the academy.","One was Gongsun Mu and the other one was Zuo Qingluan.","Chen Ziyun was usually in Peace Grassland and didn’t know this requirement.","“Zuo Qingluan?” Chen Ziyun frowned. “Why haven’t I heard of her before? Where’s Chief Zixuan?”","Gongsun Mu then told him that Chief Zixuan had gone to Peace Grassland, leaving Zuo Qingluan as her temporary replacement.","Chen Ziyun still couldn’t accept it. “Is she the girl with the legendary True Phoenix Blood? Then she should be my age.”","Gongsun Mu nodded.","Chen Ziyun asked, “What’s her level?”","Gongsun Mu said, “She’s a Spiritual King.”","Chen Ziyun said, “At her age? That’s impressive. What level is she?”","Gongsun Mu raised a finger.","“Level 1?” Chen Ziyun was shocked. “What makes her think she’s good enough to be our vice chief? We’re not some makeshift school!”","Gongsun Mu gave him a warning look. “Be careful with your choice of words.”","Chen Ziyun said, “A Level 1 Spiritual King just isn’t good enough! She’s so much weaker than you!”","Gongsun Mu said, “It’s only temporary.”","Chief Zixuan said, “That’s still against the rules. Chief Zixuan doesn’t have the right to appoint her replacement.”","Then, he heard a voice."]},{"number":2766,"title":"Chapter 2766 - She Doesn’t Deserve It","paragraphs":["Just then, someone spoke from outside.","“Chief Qingluan is His Royal Highness’s fiancee!”","It was Mr. Wang, the tutor from Class D who had a grudge against Feng Wu.","Chen Ziyun frowned at him. “What? When did that happen? No one told me that.”","Mr. Wang sounded smug. “You’ve been in Peace Grassland the whole time, and you wouldn’t have come back if it hadn’t been for the upcoming competition. Of course you wouldn’t know about it.”","Feng Wu looked at them in resignation. Fiancee? It had to be one of the rumors Zuo Qingluan was spreading.","Chen Ziyun shook his head. “I don’t buy it.”","Mr. Wang laughed. “Your opinion doesn’t matter. Miss Qingluan is the crown prince’s future wife, and you can’t change that!”","Chen Ziyun glanced at Feng Wu.","If Zuo Qingluan really was going to marry the crown prince, and Feng Wu was Feng Xun’s girl, then Feng Wu would be inferior to her in status.","He already believed that Feng Wu was close to Feng Xun.","“Feng Wu, do you know if Zuo Qingluan is His Royal Highness’s fiancee?”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","......","Mr. Wang shook his head. “What can she possibly know? You shouldn’t ask her.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Didn’t Feng Wu join us only a month ago? She should know what’s going on outside better than we do. Moreover...”","He looked at Feng Wu. “Moreover, you’re close to Feng Xun. You should have some inside information.”","“You’re close to Feng Xun?” Mr. Wang gave Feng Wu a strange look.","He remembered Feng Xun as a rebellious heir of an influential family. That boy was supposed to be very proud and hard to get along with.","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Mr. Wang said, “That’s impossible! Feng Xun is the young lord of Northern Feng Mansion. Why would he befriend an ordinary girl like you?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Because I’m pretty. Is that enough?”","That rendered Mr. Wang speechless.","What a unique argument.","Seeing Feng Wu’s stunning beauty, there was nothing Mr. Wang could say.","However, he still smirked. “So what if you’ve won Young Lord Feng’s heart? Zuo Qingluan is the crown prince’s future wife! You still have to obey her!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes again.","She couldn’t be bothered by Zuo Qingluan’s petty tricks, but she wasn’t going to put up with Mr. Wang’s mocking.","She said, “Zuo Qingluan? His Royal Highness does have a fiancee, but it’s not her.”","What?","Everybody in the room stared at her.","Chen Ziyun was intrigued. “Really? His Royal Highness is engaged! To whom?”","Mr. Wang smirked. “Do you think we should trust you instead of Chief Qingluan?”","Feng Wu frowned. “Is it so important to find out who the crown prince’s fiancee is? I thought we were here to complete my registration.”","Gongsun Mu came back to his senses.","Even he had almost forgotten about their real business here.","After he signed Feng Wu’s form, he told her, “After Chief Qingluan signs it, you’ll be a Class A student and a member of the seeded team.”","Feng Wu frowned. “Do I have to ask for her signature?”","Gongsun Mu said, “Yes. That’s the required procedure.”"]},{"number":2767,"title":"Chapter 2767 - A Possible Level 8 Spiritual Lord","paragraphs":["Feng Wu frowned. “What if she won’t sign?”","Gongsun Mu smiled. “Why would she do that?”","Mr. Wang smirked. “She thinks she can get whatever she wants just because she’s pretty. She’s disrespectful toward Miss Qingluan and slanders Miss Qingluan behind her back. It’s only natural that Miss Qingluan won’t sign her form.”","Feng Wu looked at him in resignation. Would it kill this man to stop criticizing her?","Chen Ziyun said, “I need to go out for a second.”","He was bewildered. He didn’t know what was going on with Zuo Qingluan, whom he hadn’t met so far, and he had to ask Feng Xun what that was about.","He immediately left the academy.","Being the head of the Martial Arts Society not only gave him the right to treat the vice chiefs like his equal, but also gave him the privilege to use the portal at any time.","Northern Feng Mansion.","“Boss Feng! You’re here!”","Chen Ziyun was perplexed when he saw Feng Xun training at home.","Since when did Feng Xun start working so hard?","Feng Xun had no choice. Feng Wu was making such fast progress that if he didn’t hurry up, he would fall behind.","“Boss, you have amazing taste,” Chen Ziyun teased him.","Feng Xun glanced at him in confusion.","“I’m talking about Feng Wu,” Chen Ziyun explained.","He had pulled Feng Wu’s file before he came here, and he almost couldn’t believe his eyes.","What an amazing student!","Given the speed of her progress, she was good enough to be a student of Mu Jiuzhou!","Feng Xun didn’t pay much attention to Chen Ziyun at first, but his eyes lit up when Chen Ziyun mentioned Feng Wu.","It had been over a month since he last saw her, and he missed the girl.","Boss Jun had made him stay at home to cultivate. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be stuck here.","“Of course Feng Wu is amazing.” Feng Xun’s face lit up. “My girl has to be.”","Chen Ziyun was misled.","He was convinced that Feng Wu and Feng Xun really were a couple.","“I’d like to hear it, though. How’s Xiao Wu doing? What class is she in?”","Feng Xun thought that given Feng Wu’s capability, she should be in Class D already.","However, what Chen Ziyun said next almost made him jump.","Chen Ziyun said excitedly, “She’s about to join Class A and our seeded team!”","“Pffft!”","Feng Xun spat out the water in his mouth.","Class A?","He had gone to the War Academy as well and knew the rules there.","“Bullsh*t!” Feng Xun rolled his eyes at Chen Ziyun. “Even if you want to flatter Xiao Wu, you need to make it believable! I’m not an idiot!”","Chen Ziyun wiped the water on his face and said in resignation, “Boss Feng, why would I make up something like that?”","He then took out a sheet of paper and handed it to Feng Xun. “Here’s Feng Wu’s file. Have a look.”","Feng Xun’s eyes widened when he read it.","Chen Ziyun didn’t feel so defeated when he saw how shocked Feng Xun was.","It felt good that he wasn’t the only one to feel shocked.","The paper shook in Feng Xun’s hand, and he stared at Chen Ziyun. “Is everything on it true?”","The paper recorded what Feng Wu had achieved so far.","She had been in Class E at the beginning of the first month.","She was in Classes D, C, and B after that.","She got into Class A this month and was halfway through the registration.","She was also making her way into the seeded team.","Overall evaluation: She could be a Level 8 Spiritual Lord.","“A Level 8 Spiritual Lord?” Feng Xun’s eyes widened.","He had been training hard all this time."]},{"number":2768,"title":"Chapter 2768 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Boss Jun had stopped forcing him to solidify his foundation and had allowed him to make breakthroughs again.","Even so, he couldn’t make progress as fast as Feng Wu.","“It’s only been months, and she’s risen from Class E to Class A! She’s also become a member of the seeded team! I’m amazed!” Feng Xun said in admiration.","Chen Ziyun winked at him. “Boss Feng, you have impeccable taste!”","Feng Xun said with satisfaction, “Of course I do! All my family members are amazing!”","It once more confirmed Chen Ziyun’s conclusion that Feng Wu was Feng Xun’s girlfriend.","They were talking about the same person, but completely different relationships.","“I have a question, Boss Feng.” Chen Ziyun wasn’t here just to sing Feng Wu’s praises.","“Is His Royal Highness engaged?” Chen Ziyun probed.","“Where did you hear that?” Feng Xun glanced at him. “I thought you were in Peace Grassland the whole time.”","Chen Ziyun said, “I heard about it as soon as I got back. She’s a student in the academy, isn’t she?”","Feng Xun said matter-of-factly, “That’s right.” He thought Chen Ziyun was referring to Feng Wu.","Chen Ziyun looked stunned and then sighed. “So, it really is her.”","......","Feng Xun said, “Who else can it be?”","Chen Ziyun seemed disappointed.","Feng Xun was alarmed. “You’re not in love with her, are you?”","Chen Ziyun shook his head. “Of course not! I haven’t even met her! Why would I be in love with her? I just think no girl is good enough for His Royal Highness.”","Feng Xun was perplexed.","Why was Chen Ziyun saying he had yet to meet her? He had been talking about her just a minute ago!","She was halfway through registration. He had definitely met her already!","Something didn’t feel right.","“Which girl are you referring to?” Feng Xun asked.","Chen Ziyun was confused by the question. “Isn’t it Miss Zuo Qingluan?”","Feng Xun snapped, “Bullsh*t! That’s the scariest thing I’ve ever heard!”","What?","What? Why was it scary?","Chen Ziyun scratched his head. “Isn’t Miss Zuo Qingluan the crown prince’s future wife? Mr. Wang was so certain.”","“Of course not! She’s never going to marry Boss Jun! That’s total bullsh*t!” The thought of Zuo Qingluan upset Feng Xun. “She’s making a big deal out of their childhood friendship. Marry the crown prince? She must be dreaming!”","Feng Xun then thought of Feng Wu’s current level and panicked slightly.","If he didn’t hurry, she would be more capable than him in no time!","He had to start cultivating now!","“You should get going. That’s enough gossip for one day. I’m going into seclusion now; make sure you protect my girl. Don’t bother me unless it’s really important.” Feng Xun then pushed Chen Ziyun out of his room.","Chen Ziyun was still in shock when he walked into the portal.","It wasn’t Zuo Qingluan!","Feng Xun had confirmed it!","Gosh! How dare Zuo Qingluan spread that rumor? Wasn’t she afraid that His Royal Highness would expose her lie?","Ding!","The sound signaling that he had returned to the academy woke him up from his stupor.","“Oh, gosh!”","Chen Ziyun smacked his forehead when he realized something. “His Royal Highness’s fiancee is in the academy, but who is she?”","Why hadn’t he asked Feng Xun? Chen Ziyun felt so foolish.","He wanted to ask Feng Xun now, but he recalled what Feng Xun had just said.","He said he was going into seclusion and didn’t want to be disturbed.","But Chen Ziyun was so curious!"]},{"number":2769,"title":"Chapter 2769 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun tried to figure it out on his own.","If Feng Wu wasn’t Young Lord Feng’s girl, then...","An idea suddenly struck him.","OMG!","Could it really be her?","He had heard that rumor before but hadn’t thought much of it.","He had asked Huo Shan to protect Feng Wu only as a precaution.","If Feng Wu really was the fiancee... Chen Ziyun was thrilled.","That was very possible!","After all, Feng Wu was so beautiful and talented. The idea made Chen Ziyun’s face light up.","He quickly went back to the academy and was on his way to find Feng Wu.","Beep!","He was being paged through his badge.","......","“Yes, Mr. Gongsun,” Chen Ziyun replied.","“Come to my office now.” Gongsun Mu’s tone sounded urgent.","Chen Ziyun was immediately on his way. He ran into Feng Wu before he got there and asked curiously, “Why are you here?”","Feng Wu gestured at her badge.","Every student had a badge, but students in Classes C, D, and E couldn’t communicate with theirs, and could only use it to send out distress signals.","Only students in Classes A and B could communicate via their badges.","However, the range only covered the campus and some parts of Thousand Night Forest.","According to the official explanation, that was the furthest the signal could extend.","Chen Ziyun’s face lit up when he saw Feng Wu, and he almost blurted out, “Feng Wu, are you her?!”","However...","He forced himself to calm down. “You’re a captain, so act like one!” Chen Ziyun reminded himself.","Chen Ziyun’s gaze made Feng Wu uneasy.","“Is there a problem?”","Chen Ziyun said, “No! It’s nothing! Don’t worry about Zuo Qingluan’s signature. No one will make trouble for you.”","Feng Wu said, “I’m not worried.”","Chen Ziyun patted his chest. “Leave it to me! You’ll be fine!”","Feng Wu nodded.","Chen Ziyun glanced at her and asked tentatively, “We haven’t heard from His Royal Highness in a while, have we?”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “How’s that any of my business?”","Chen Ziyun thought,? That’s so cold!","According to Feng Xun, you’re the crown prince’s future wife!","He began to wonder if she really was the fiancee.","He was still wondering, when they arrived at Gongsun Mu’s office.","Gongsun Mu wasn’t alone. There was another person in the room.","Gongsun Mu treated him the same way he treated Elder Mei.","“Elder Wu, Chen Ziyun is here,” Gongsun Mu said respectfully.","Elder Wu was very old. His hair was all white, and his skin was spotty with age.","He nodded and looked at Chen Ziyun. “Follow me, then.”","Chen Ziyun seemed to know the old man and showed him much more respect than he did toward Gongsun Mu.","“Elder Wu, why are you here?” Chen Ziyun was confused.","Gongsun Mu explained, “We’re facing two issues.","“First of all, the members of the Military Academy’s team have made great progress. If everything goes as planned, we’re bound to lose the competition.”","Chen Ziyun was surprised. “Really?!”","Gongsun Mu nodded. “Yes. Something incredible happened to them, and they all rose by one or two cultivation levels.”"]},{"number":2770,"title":"Chapter 2770 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“They’re all one to two levels higher than before. You’re bound to lose the competition next week.","“Therefore, we must give you special training.","“We’re also lucky in a sense that the Secret Essence Mine suddenly showed up.","“You’ve all trained in the gravity training room before, so that place is no longer as effective for you.","“The Secret Essence Mine has ample spiritual essence and is supported by a formation. It’s great for training. You’ll be able to make significant progress in a short time.","“Therefore, you’ll be training in the Secret Essence Mine this week.”","Gongsun Mu then turned to Chen Ziyun. “Elder Wu will tell you how the training session will be carried out.”","Elder Wu would be their training officer this time. He would be in charge of training and protecting them.","Chen Ziyun was thrilled to hear that Elder Wu was going to train them. “Great! I’ll inform my team members now. We’ll leave in five minutes!”","Elder Wu was pleased with his efficiency.","While they were waiting, Chen Ziyun asked Gongsun Mu, “What about Zuo Qingluan? Is she coming?”","Gongsun Mu said, “She’s already inside the Secret Essence Mine with Elder Mei.”","Gongsun Mu had to admire Zuo Qingluan.","......","When she set her mind on something, she would always do it.","When she realized that Elder Mei was an expert in formations, she started following him around and behaved like a hardworking student.","Gongsun Mu was sure that once she couldn’t learn anything new from Elder Mei, she would abandon the old man like a used shoe.","She was so pragmatic that Gongsun Mu didn’t want to get close to her.","Chen Ziyun frowned. “In that case, how about Feng Wu stays behind?”","The Secret Essence Mine was too dangerous, and Feng Wu’s team was only a backup. She probably wouldn’t need to have anything to do with it in the competition.","Gongsun Mu was about to agree, when Elder Wu shook his head. “She’s coming with us.”","Feng Wu was confused. She didn’t really want to go. Why did the old man insist?","Elder Wu didn’t explain. He put his hands behind his back with an enigmatic look on his face.","Chen Ziyun, Feng Wu and Gongsun Mu didn’t know what to say.","The team members soon arrived.","These included Chen Ziyun, Sun Yu, and Wang Xiao from the varsity team, the latter released from his confinement.","All the members of the junior varsity team were there as well.","“Elder Wu, all ten people are here. Are we leaving now?”","“Let’s go!”","In the Secret Essence Mine.","Elder Mei had stopped the wind outside earlier, and the two elders had a special way to communicate.","Before long, the two groups of people got together.","Elder Wu went to talk with Elder Mei.","As for the rest...","Zuo Qingluan and Mr. Xu were with Elder Mei.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t want to see Feng Wu here.","However, she wasn’t going to lose her temper in front of so many people.","Instead of being hostile, she smiled at Feng Wu. “You’re here.”","Feng Wu was alarmed. Zuo Qingluan had never smiled at her before.","Chen Ziyun was reminded of what he had heard, and felt a chill run down his spine.","“Hello, Chen Ziyun.” Zuo Qingluan greeted him with a stern, authoritative tone."]},{"number":2771,"title":"Chapter 2771 - This Is the Real You (1)","paragraphs":["“Chen Ziyun?” Zuo Qingluan stared at him. “You’re the captain of the seeded team, aren’t you?”","Chen Ziyun was thinking about what Feng Xun had said about Zuo Qingluan.","Feng Xun had said, “That woman loves to connect herself to Boss Jun. Don’t believe a word she says!”","“Hello?” Zuo Qingluan was displeased when Chen Ziyun didn’t answer her.","Some people had a sense of superiority and were exceedingly arrogant.","If other people didn’t show them enough enthusiasm, this type of person would think they were being ignored and become hostile.","Zuo Qingluan was exactly that kind of person.","Chen Ziyun had no idea that he had offended Zuo Qingluan because he didn’t greet her with screams or tears.","“And you are?” Chen Ziyun pretended not to know her.","Zuo Qingluan frowned.","Chen Ziyun was the captain of the seeded team, which Feng Wu was about to join. Zuo Qingluan was only speaking to him because she thought he could be useful.","She didn’t expect such an indifferent reaction.","Seeing that the mood was becoming tense, Mr. Xu intervened with a smile.","......","“This is Miss Zuo Qingluan, our new vice chief. Ziyun, you’ve been in Peace Grassland the whole time. No wonder you don’t recognize her.”","Zuo Qingluan’s mood improved a little.","Since she didn’t scold Chen Ziyun, Chen Ziyun didn’t want to offend her either. There was no need to cause unnecessary trouble.","He nodded at her and smiled politely. “I see. I’ve heard so much about you.”","Zuo Qingluan found his attitude perfunctory.","She frowned and looked away.","Chen Ziyun was glad that she was no longer staring at him.","He suddenly remembered something and said to Zuo Qingluan, “Miss Zuo, I’ll need a little favor.”","Zuo Qingluan gave him an arrogant glance.","Chen Ziyun handed her a form. “I’ll need your signature here.”","Zuo Qingluan took the piece of paper and smirked inwardly.","It was Feng Wu’s registration form. Everybody else had signed it, and her signature was the last thing Feng Wu would need to complete her registration.","Zuo Qingluan pretended not to recognize the form. She frowned and said, “Do you not know where we are? We don’t have time for such trivial things now.”","She then put the form into her sleeve.","Chen Ziyun was astonished.","Why did she do that?","She only needed to sign the form. It couldn’t be any easier! Why did she scold him?","Since this was the first time he had seen her, he didn’t think he had offended her. In that case...","He looked back at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu gave him an indifferent nod.","Chen Ziyun took the hint.","Zuo Qingluan claimed herself to be the crown prince’s fiancee, while Feng Wu was the real fiancee. Of course the girls held a grudge against each other.","What a troublesome day. Chen Ziyun rubbed his head and smiled bitterly.","Just then, they heard Elder Wu’s voice.","“The Secret Essence Mine is a dangerous place, and none of you can walk off on your own. Violate the rules, and you’ll be kicked out of the team.”","That was some serious punishment. The team members looked at one another in bewilderment.","Zuo Qingluan chuckled. “I heard a student mention earlier that her paper crane could lead us out of the Secret Essence Mine.”","“Nonsense!” Elder Wu’s face darkened."]},{"number":2772,"title":"Chapter 2772 - This Is the Real You (2)","paragraphs":["“No paper crane can do that!” Elder Wu said sternly. “You must be dreaming!”","Elder Mei said, “It’s not impossible. I heard that inscription masters at Level 8 or above have that sort of ability. Unfortunately, only the Dongsang Kingdom has such capable masters. We don’t have any.”","Zuo Qingluan was surprised. “There are no such masters in the empire? Are you sure?”","Elder Mei said, “Of course!”","“But...” Zuo Qingluan pretended to search her memory. “I thought a student gave you a paper crane earlier and told you it could lead you out of here.”","“Bullsh*t!” Elder Mei’s face darkened. “What does a student know about formations? How many inscriptions can they possibly know?”","Inscriptions were made from complicated combinations of words, which could form patterns.","As the level went up, the difficulty increased exponentially. Inscriptions were incredibly difficult to learn.","Elder Mei was an extremely talented inscription master, but he was stuck at Level 7 and couldn’t move on to the next level.","If he couldn’t do it, what could a student possibly do?","“I remember now! There was a paper crane!” Mr. Xu took the crane out of his chest pocket. “I still have it.","“The inscriptions were written so carelessly that it made me wonder. If we really get lost...”","His eyes lit up when he saw Feng Wu. “Isn’t she that student? Yes, it’s her!”","......","Elder Mei looked at Feng Wu and was disappointed by what he thought was a lie.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Elder Mei waved his hand. “Tear it up.”","Feng Wu said, “It really can...”","Zuo Qingluan made a move before Feng Wu could do anything.","She grabbed the paper crane from Mr. Xu and tore it to pieces.","Feng Wu frowned. She looked around at the tunnels before turning to Zuo Qingluan and Elder Mei. “I hope you won’t regret that.”","Zuo Qingluan smirked. “Regret? Who the hell do you think you are?”","Feng Wu wasn’t angry, but Chen Ziyun couldn’t stand it anymore.","Feng Wu was the crown prince’s future wife, so she could say whatever she wanted. Zuo Qingluan was only a fake. She couldn’t talk to Feng Wu like that!","Chen Ziyun stared at Zuo Qingluan. “Watch your attitude!”","What?","Everyone stared at Chen Ziyun.","His teammates couldn’t believe it. It was so unlike their captain! He always played it safe!","Did he know who he was talking to?","Zuo Qingluan didn’t expect it either.","She had even considered winning Chen Ziyun over to her side.","Unfortunately, she still hadn’t found her own team and had to fight her own battles.","She let out a streak of energy, which rushed toward Chen Ziyun.","Feng Wu was going to help him, but she saw Chen Ziyun was doing alright on his own.","Zuo Qingluan was a Level 1 Spiritual King, whereas Chen Ziyun was a Level 9 Spiritual Lord.","The difference was quite small.","No wonder Chen Ziyun wasn’t intimidated by Zuo Qingluan."]},{"number":2773,"title":"Chapter 2773 - Quarrel (1)","paragraphs":["Although they were only one level apart, they belonged to two different stages.","The difference was quite apparent.","However, Chen Ziyun had accumulated a lot of experience in Peace Grassland, so he was able to exchange quite a few blows with Zuo Qingluan.","Feng Wu was trying to figure out Zuo Qingluan’s moves, when Elder Mei bellowed, “Stop it!”","Zuo Qingluan was fawning on Elder Mei, so she immediately followed his order.","Chen Ziyun smirked. “A vice chief is only slightly better than a Class A student. Are you sure you’re adequate for the position?”","What a humiliation!","Zuo Qingluan was furious and wanted to strike Chen Ziyun.","Feng Wu stepped out and smiled at Zuo Qingluan. “You get angry so easily. That’s not something a vice chief should do.”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know how to react to that.","She turned around and glared at Feng Wu.","Elder Wu didn’t expect the new vice chief to lose her temper with a student.","By his standards, Zuo Qingluan indeed wasn’t qualified for the job.","......","“The crown prince gave me the job! You can always complain to His Royal Highness.” Zuo Qingluan smirked at Feng Wu.","The crown prince? Jun Linyuan?","Zuo Qingluan had just made a bold statement.","Jun Linyuan’s name represented the ultimate authority.","No one would challenge his recommendation.","If he sent Zuo Qingluan here to be the vice chief, she was good enough for the job, no matter how little talent she had.","Therefore, even Elder Wu didn’t have anything to complain about.","Even Elder Mei, who had ignored Zuo Qingluan until then, glanced at her.","Feng Wu snapped, “How can you be so shameless? Jun Linyuan is mine!”","Everybody fell silent when they heard what she said.","They all looked at Feng Wu as if she were an idiot.","Chen Ziyun was the only one who had let out a breath of relief.","He was right! Feng Wu really was the crown prince’s future wife!","Zuo Qingluan glared at Feng Wu with eyes that could spit fire.","She wanted to skin Feng Wu alive.","Feng Wu couldn’t believe she had said those words and wanted to slap herself.","“Oh my god... Why did I say that?” She was mortified.","Seeing that Zuo Qingluan was going to lose her temper again, Elder Wu said, “Silence! Stop this nonsense! It’s so inappropriate!”","Chen Ziyun didn’t mind being scolded since he was only a student.","However, Zuo Qingluan was a vice chief, and she considered herself to be in a prestigious position. She couldn’t stand it when someone reprimanded her like that.","She had never felt so embarrassed before.","Her face went scarlet red.","Before she could react, Elder Mei took out a map he had drawn and handed it to Elder Wu. “I’ve explored this area already. Follow the map, but don’t leave this area.”","He drew a circle on the map.","The area was at least 10km in radius."]},{"number":2774,"title":"Chapter 2774 - Quarrel (2)","paragraphs":["Elder Wu’s eyes lit up. “You’ve explored such a large area in such a short time. How impressive!”","Elder Mei shrugged and sighed. “I’m getting old. I’m already a little tired... Well, off you go.”","He didn’t like having too many people around since it would affect his thinking process.","After all, studying formations was a complicated process. If he was disturbed, he would need to start from the beginning again.","Elder Wu nodded and was going to lead the team away.","Elder Mei glanced at Feng Wu. “Young lady, do some solid work.”","Apparently, he thought Feng Wu had been bragging before.","What was he referring to? The paper crane, the crown prince, or both?","Feng Wu smiled at him. “I think one should be humble and accept their old age.”","Elder Mei’s eyes widened.","He was a formation master.","Imperial College only had a handful of formation masters of his level, and people revered him. However, a student had just disrespected him.","Elder Mei’s face was livid.","......","Zuo Qingluan smirked at Feng Wu and mouthed, “You arrogant idiot.”","Meanwhile, Chen Ziyun and his team stared at Feng Wu as if she were God.","Where did this girl come from? She had just said those things to Elder Mei! Elder Mei!","Qiu Zeyu didn’t know what to say.","At first, he thought he could pick on her because she was merely a new student.","However, this new student had offended Zuo Qingluan and Elder Mei one after another. Qiu Zeyu didn’t know if he should laugh or cry.","What kind of trouble had he gotten himself into? He wondered if he was even qualified to be her enemy.","“No, she’s not my enemy...” Qiu Zeyu decided to give up.","Elder Wu only scolded Feng Wu after they were a few kilometers away. “Don’t you know you should respect your teachers? Yes, you’re talented, but that doesn’t give you the right to talk to a senior like that!”","Feng Wu stuck out her tone. “That was because he said those things to me.”","Elder Wu said, “Have you forgotten who he is? He’s a Level 7 formation master! We only have a handful of people like him in the empire! Who do you think you are? It was very generous of him to let you go!”","Feng Wu nodded.","Wang Xiao frowned.","He thought Feng Wu was just a pretty face. Why did Elder Wu say she was talented? She was probably the least talented student on the team.","Elder Wu seemed to think very highly of her. Why?","But no one could answer Wang Xiao’s questions.","Elder Wu announced the mission.","“You’ll be training within this 10km-area.","“You’ll be divided into pairs. The first will be paired with the tenth, the second with the ninth, and so on!”","Chen Ziyun raised his hand. “Elder Wu, can I team up with Feng Wu? She’s new and doesn’t know the rules. I think I should keep her safe.”","Elder Wu gave him a strange look. Keep Feng Wu safe?","He was going to make Feng Wu the team leader, but after hearing what Chen Ziyun said, he had a new plan.","“You’ll be divided into two groups, then. Chen Ziyun and Feng Wu will be in one group, and the other eight in another group."]},{"number":2775,"title":"Chapter 2775 - Competition","paragraphs":["Everybody stared at Elder Wu.","Did he have the wrong idea about their levels?","Except for Feng Wu, all the other members were Level 9 Spiritual Lords.","Chen Ziyun was the captain, so he was better than the other eight and was a peak Level 9 Spiritual Lord. The other eight members were senior Spiritual Lords.","There wasn’t much difference between their cultivation levels.","However...","Elder Wu had just paired Chen Ziyun with Feng Wu, who was practically a burden, while the other eight members were in the same group.","“Elder Wu, that’s not fair at all!” Wang Xiao protested.","Elder Wu rubbed his chin. Yes, Wang Xiao was right that it wasn’t fair. However, the special training was, in fact, for Feng Wu only, so fairness didn’t matter.","Elder Wu frowned and said sternly, “Why is it unfair? Just do as you’re told!”","Wang Xiao didn’t dare speak up anymore, but he murmured, “Feng Wu is so weak. It’s so unfair to Ziyun.”","Both Elder Wu and Qiu Zeyu stared at him.","Feng Wu was so weak?","......","Qiu Zeyu didn’t know what to say. She was anything but weak!","When she had grabbed him, he couldn’t fight back at all.","He was ranked sixth on the team, but Feng Wu had picked him up as if he were a chicken. That was some terrifying strength.","However, he wasn’t going to tell Wang Xiao that.","It was too humiliating.","Elder Wu looked at the others. “Do you also think Chen Ziyun is at a disadvantage?”","Everybody nodded.","Elder Wu turned to Feng Wu. “Your task is going to be five times theirs. Problem?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “Nope.”","Chen Ziyun couldn’t believe his ears. “Young lady, you can’t be so conceited! It’ll get you killed!”","Feng Wu said impatiently, “I can do it on my own.”","Chen Ziyun almost laughed. He couldn’t understand why she was so arrogant.","Elder Wu didn’t even ask Chen Ziyun’s opinion before he announced, “There are a lot of Spirit Stone Worms in this 10km-area.”","He pointed at the map. “They’re in these two spots.","“I’ve chased away the weaker ones with my energy. The weakest of the remaining ones are Level 8 Spiritual Lords, and the strongest ones are Spiritual Kings.”","He then turned to the other group. “Who’s the group leader?”","They all looked at Sun Yu.","Sun Yu was the second strongest member of the team.","Naturally, he became the group leader.","Elder Wu said, “Your group will kill 1,000 worms.”","He then told Feng Wu, “Your group will kill 5,000.”","Gosh...","Everybody sucked in their breaths.","5,000? That was impossible!","“At least 10% of them have to be Spiritual Kings,” said Elder Wu. “You have seven days.”","Spiritual Kings?","Although they could defeat Spiritual Kings when they fought as a team, it was still very difficult.","Elder Wu gestured. “Sun Yu, your team will go first.”","The eight people left, and Elder Wu turned to Feng Wu.","He said, “You alone must kill 4,000 worms.”","He walked away after that.","Feng Wu remained unaffected, and Chen Ziyun was dumbfounded.","He was too scared to speak.","He then asked Feng Wu, “Does Elder Wu hold a grudge against you?”","After some thought, he said, “He must be getting back at you for offending Elder Mei earlier.”"]},{"number":2776,"title":"Chapter 2776 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“Don’t worry!” Chen Ziyun patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “Call me Brother Chen, and I’ll help you. Deal?”","Feng Wu had to kill 4,000 Spirit Stone Worms, and the weaker ones had been chased away by Elder Wu, leaving only the strong ones.","400 of the worms had to be Spiritual Kings.","How was Feng Wu ever going to complete that task? Chen Ziyun was worried for her.","However, Feng Wu only glanced at him. “Are you sure you want me to call you that?”","“Well...” Chen Ziyun suddenly realized whom he was talking to.","“No! That won’t be necessary!” Chen Ziyun shook his head.","What a stupid request! He had almost flirted with the crown prince’s future wife!","Feng Wu and Chen Ziyun moved quickly.","They soon ran into the first wave of Spirit Stone Worms.","All three of them were Level 8 Spiritual Lords.","Chen Ziyun wanted to give the opportunity to Feng Wu. “Quickly, kill them.”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “Don’t you need them?”","......","Chen Ziyun said, “You need to kill 4,000 worms. I think you need these three more than I do.”","Feng Wu shook her head. “No, I don’t.”","Chen Ziyun glanced at her. He had never met such an arrogant girl before.","He killed the three Spirit Stone Worms without hesitation and handed the crystal cores to Feng Wu. “Take them.”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t really need them...”","Chen Ziyun said, “I’m offering them to you.”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.” She didn’t want to owe him any favors, but he just didn’t get it.","Chen Ziyun said in resignation, “Why did you give everybody a paper crane?”","Feng Wu had given each team member a paper crane before they parted ways.","The others had been embarrassed to receive them.","Elder Mei had just said that the paper crane was useless, but Feng Wu gave them out again. The others felt it would be unfriendly of them to turn down the paper cranes, but they felt foolish accepting them.","Chen Ziyun asked, “Did you give one to Elder Wu?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, I did.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Elder Mei said the paper crane wouldn’t work. Why do you...”","Feng Wu looked into his eyes. “It’ll work.”","Chen Ziyun said in resignation, “What should I say to make you understand?”","Feng Wu said, “You’ll see when something happens.”","Chen Ziyun didn’t want to talk to the stubborn girl anymore.","Just then, a voice came out of Chen Ziyun’s armband. “Captain Chen Ziyun, Captain Chen Ziyun, do you copy? Do you copy?”","Elder Mei had cleared out this area and set up some spiritual stones, enabling the students on the team to communicate via their armbands.","Chen Ziyun said, “Copy. Wang Xiao, how are you doing?”","Wang Xiao sounded cheerful. “Ziyun, we just ran into some Spirit Stone Worms and killed 50 of them. I think our group may win this time!”","Elder Wu told them that the captain of the team for the competition would be chosen from the winning group.","If Wang Xiao’s group won...","Wang Xiao asked, “Ziyun, what about you? How many have you killed?”"]},{"number":2777,"title":"Chapter 2777 - Wonderful","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun said, “Well, three.”","Wang Xiao was surprised. “It’s been half a day, and you’ve only killed three! How?”","Chen Ziyun said, “We haven’t run into many Spirit Stone Worms. It hasn’t been our luckiest day.”","He glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was the one who had chosen this route. She wouldn’t follow the map and had insisted that she knew a place where they could find a lot of Spirit Stone Worms. They had been traveling along bumpy paths since then. What could he do, except follow her?","Wang Xiao said, “Ziyun, I don’t feel right winning like this. Why don’t you come to us? We’ve run into quite a few worms on our way.”","The eight of them only needed to kill 1,000 worms, but Chen Ziyun and Feng Wu had to kill five times that.","Chen Ziyun glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu shook her head. “No!”","Chen Ziyun could only tell Wang Xiao, “Just carry on with your task. I’m sure Elder Wu has his reasons.”","Although he still couldn’t see what they were.","Chen Ziyun ended the call after that.","He looked at Feng Wu in resignation. “Do you really know where to find so many Level 8 Spirit Stone Worms?”","......","Chen Ziyun was a peak Level 9 Spiritual Lord and could fight several Level 8 worms all at once.","Feng Wu said, “Yes.”","Feng Wu nodded without hesitation, but Chen Ziyun didn’t believe her.","However, she was so well-connected that he had no choice but to protect her.","He found Feng Wu too arrogant and conceited, which wasn’t to his liking. Thus, he stopped chatting with her on the way.","He wasn’t alone. Other members of the team were also displeased with Feng Wu’s behavior.","Their journey became very quiet, but Feng Wu didn’t feel embarrassed.","She was focused on Little Phoenix.","Right now, the bird was showing off its knowledge. “I just remembered a place. I buried some spirit liquid there to ferment.”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s that? Why does it sound like you were brewing wine?”","“Yes! That’s exactly what I was doing! I was brewing spirit wine! Do you know how nourishing that is?”","Feng Wu said, “Do I need more nourishment?”","Little Phoenix said, “You’re a Spiritual King already, so of course, you don’t. It won’t work for you either. However, it’ll be quite useful for cultivators who haven’t reached the Spiritual King stage yet.”","Feng Wu asked, “Really?”","“Obviously, wine can enhance one’s body, but it can treat chronic diseases as well. Doesn’t your mother always get headaches? The liquid can treat them!","“Your friends have been making slow progress, and the liquid can help them, too.","“I’ll also need it. It’ll help me reach the Spiritual King stage! You’ve been making so many breakthroughs recently, but I haven’t! I need to pick up my pace!”","Little Phoenix saved that bit for last.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up as she listened. When she heard the last bit, she asked, “This is all for your cultivation, isn’t it?”","“No, it’s not just for me! There’s the cub, too! It’s been working hard, but it still can’t catch up with you! With the liquid, it’ll rise to the Spiritual King stage, too!","“Wouldn’t it be great to have two Spiritual Kings as your bodyguards?”"]},{"number":2778,"title":"Chapter 2778 - How Do You Know?","paragraphs":["Little Phoenix kept trying to persuade Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “If it’s so precious, why don’t you fetch it yourself? Since you’ve been hounding me, does that mean you can’t do it on your own?”","Little Phoenix didn’t mind its little plan being exposed. It only said, “You couldn’t wait to go to Peace Grassland when you heard you could find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit there.","“You’ll have nowhere to take shelter in the vast grassland. The enemy can easily catch you if you aren’t capable enough.","“Not only won’t you find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, you’ll also be forced to marry some enemy soldier and bear his children. What a miserable life.”","Feng Wu began to frown.","Little Phoenix went on. “However, things would be different if you had two Spiritual Kings as your bodyguards. We’ll protect you! Moreover, Zuo Qingluan is on her own, whereas we’ll have three Spiritual Kings. She’ll be the one at a disadvantage.”","The bird nagged on, and Feng Wu heard enough. She said, “Fine, fine. The spirit wine, is it? Where can I find it?”","Little Phoenix immediately stopped nagging and said excitedly, “I’ll tell you once you’re there. The slightest mistake will render it useless!”","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead. “Didn’t you say you buried the spirit liquid? Are you sure it has turned into spirit wine?”","Little Phoenix said, “Yes, it’s very likely.”","Feng Wu said, “Talk to me once we’re there. I don’t think anyone would have touched it.”","Little Phoenix said, “Yes! It’ll definitely be intact!”","......","It had been a precocious thing it did many years ago.","The bird hadn’t known it would reincarnate. It had only planned to hide here when it was severely injured and sip the spirit wine while it waited to recover.","It had never occurred to the bird that it would be so weak one day that it couldn’t open the seal.","“Feng Wu? Hello?”","Chen Ziyun tried to talk to Feng Wu while she was communicating with the bird.","“We’ve almost reached the boundary of the 10km-area, but we still haven’t found any Spirit Stone Worms.”","Feng Wu said, “Hm, let’s keep moving.”","Chen Ziyun paled. “What? Keep moving? No, we can’t! The map doesn’t cover that far, and we won’t know the way!”","Feng Wu thought for a moment and said, “How about this? You stay here, and I’ll finish the journey on my own. Didn’t Elder Wu give us separate missions? You’ll kill 1,000, and I’ll kill 4,000. It’ll work better that way.”","She was about to step out of the boundary.","Chen Ziyun frowned and said sternly, “Feng Wu, I have no problem protecting you, but you’ve crossed the line!”","Feng Wu looked at him, perplexed by his sudden outburst and reprimand.","She narrowed her eyes.","Chen Ziyun said, “I’m helping you because you’re His Royal Highness’s fiancee!”","Feng Wu said, “How did you know that? Who told you?”"]},{"number":2779,"title":"Chapter 2779 - Nervous","paragraphs":["Since Feng Wu didn’t deny it, Chen Ziyun knew he was right. Feng Wu really was the fiancee.","It only made Chen Ziyun feel more conflicted. He didn’t know how he should react.","Feng Wu asked, “Was it Feng Xun?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Not directly. I guessed it myself.”","Feng Wu said, “In that case, pretend you don’t know anything. I want to keep it to myself.”","She suddenly frowned and looked to the right.","Countless black dots were moving toward them.","Chen Ziyun was perplexed. “What’s going on? Why do you look so serious?”","She didn’t just look serious; she had already drawn out her sword.","“Get ready for battle.”","She turned to her right after that.","Behind them was a spacious clearing that was perfect for a battle.","“Ready for battle? With Spirit Stone Worms? Where are they?” Chen Ziyun didn’t sense anything.","......","He had a very acute sixth sense, and he had always depended on it on the battlefield.","As soon as he asked those questions, his stomach lurched.","He was getting the creepy feeling that only appeared in life-or-death situations.","He involuntarily followed Feng Wu’s gaze.","When he saw what was coming, his heart raced and his pupils contracted.","Spirit Stone Worms!","They were coming!","There were so many of them!","How many were there?","At first, he thought there were hundreds of them.","But soon, he realized there had to be thousands of worms.","“What are you waiting for? Run!”","He grabbed Feng Wu’s hand and wanted to drag her away.","He thought, “Did she freeze at the sight of the Spirit Stone Worms? Why is she just standing there?”","He soon lost hope.","Because!","They could only move forward or backward.","The road ahead was packed with Spirit Stone Worms, and he could sense worms behind them as well.","It was incredible!","He soon saw another group of Spirit Stone Worms rushing toward them from another direction.","There were at least thousands of them.","The worms in the front were Level 8 Spiritual Lords, and the Spiritual Kings were probably in the rear.","Chen Ziyun’s heart sank when he saw both exits blocked by Spirit Stone Worms.","This is the end...?","I’m going to die here!","He tried to shield Feng Wu behind him. However, he soon realized it was impossible because there were Spirit Stone Worms everywhere.","Chen Ziyun shouted into his armband, “Elder Wu! Elder Wu! Help!”","Elder Wu frowned. “What?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Spirit Stone Worms! So many of them!”","Elder Wu said, “I’ll be right there.”","The seeded team had its privileges.","They were the only people who were granted privileges, and the school allocated them more resources.","“Captain Chen, what’s going on?”","“How many Spirit Stone Worms are there? Why are you panicking?”","“Where are you now? I’ll come to you!”","Chen Ziyun gritted his teeth as he saw the worms rushing toward them from both sides. “Don’t come here! You’ll get killed! Sun Yu, if we die, you’re the next captain. Lead Dynasty Team and defeat our opponent! Understood?”","Was he leaving his last words?","The other teammates became nervous."]},{"number":2780,"title":"Chapter 2780 - Glory (1)","paragraphs":["“Captain Chen!”","“Ziyun!”","“Brother Chen!”","...","All his teammates freaked out because they didn’t know what was going on.","From what they knew about Chen Ziyun, he wouldn’t have asked for help unless he was in serious danger.","Qiu Zeyu was the only one who was excited to hear the news.","Chen Ziyun was with Feng Wu, which meant Feng Wu should be in danger as well. Qiu Zeyu felt today was his lucky day. His enemy was going to die before he needed to do anything.","Of course, he didn’t show that emotion on his face and still appeared worried like everybody else.","Chen Ziyun regretted bringing Feng Wu here.","“If I had known how dangerous it would be, I would never have brought you into the Secret Essence Mine.” Chen Ziyun gritted his teeth. “Don’t worry. I promise I’ll save you, and I won’t disappoint you!","“I’ll stall the Spirit Stone Worms and kill a way out of here. You just run as fast as you can. Once Elder Wu gets here, you’ll be safe.”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “What about you?”","......","Chen Ziyun smiled bitterly. “Me? I’ve worked so hard, but I’m going to die here. It’s not the end I was waiting for. I disappointed His Royal Highness last year. I don’t want to disappoint him again this year.”","Feng Wu asked, “Disappointed him?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Yes. We lost the competition against the Martial Arts Team last year. We thought we could turn things around this year, but now...”","He was the strongest member on his team. When he died, his team would lose all hope.","“My only regret is I haven’t led Dynasty Team to victory and regained our dignity!” Chen Ziyun said gravely.","The Spirit Stone Worms were almost on them.","“Remember what I said. I’ll open a way for you, then...”","However, Feng Wu charged out before Chen Ziyun could finish.","Little Phoenix looked at the worms as if they were pets. It asked, “Shall I pee on you, too?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes and charged at the worms.","“Fallen Star Sword!","“Ground Control!","“Die!”","With each word, her power grew a little.","After the last word, her energy covered an area within a 100m-range.","Thump!","Blood filled the air like a mist.","It obscured Chen Ziyun’s vision.","The air smelt like blood as well.","He was dumbfounded.","He had been shocked when Feng Wu charged out. She had activated her skills before he could do anything.","Blood was everywhere before Chen Ziyun could reach Feng Wu.","The worms’ heads rolled on the ground, the confused expressions on their faces the same as Chen Ziyun’s own expression.","The ground looked like it had been paved with minced meat.","Crystal cores piled up like a small hill.","The Spirit Stone Worms in the distance froze. They couldn’t decide whether to flee or to attack.","Chen Ziyun finally realized what had happened.","He stared at Feng Wu in amazement.","In her red dress, she stood in the middle of the dead worms. There was something untouchable about her beauty.","Chen Ziyun felt she was as glorious as the goddess of the sun!"]},{"number":2781,"title":"Chapter 2781 - Glory (2)","paragraphs":["“You...” Chen Ziyun ran to Feng Wu’s side, walked around her and stared at her in disbelief. “You... You...”","Feng Wu’s tone was unperturbed. “Pick them up.”","What? Chen Ziyun looked at her in confusion.","Feng Wu glanced at the crystal cores. “I don’t want to step on them.”","Chen Ziyun finally realized what she was talking about.","Feng Wu was telling him to pick up all the crystal cores.","Before Chen Ziyun could react, Feng Wu charged at the worms again.","She exerted more power this time and killed even more Spirit Stone Worms.","Chen Ziyun didn’t know what to say.","After the initial astonishment, he didn’t know if he should laugh or cry.","He realized he was the freeloader now.","The captain of the seeded team was depending on a girl who had been considered a good-for-nothing.","Chen Ziyun looked up and saw Elder Wu a few steps away.","......","Apparently, Elder Wu had been standing there watching Feng Wu for a while.","Just then, Chen Ziyun’s armband beeped.","“Captain, where are you?”","“Are you still alive?”","Chen Ziyun snapped, “Yes, I’m still breathing!”","“What about Feng Wu? Is she alive? Did you keep her safe?”","Keep her safe?","Chen Ziyun looked into the distance. The girl seemed so fragile that she might be made of glass, but she was killing Spirit Stone Worms one row at a time.","Spirit Stone Worms might be the team’s opponent, but to Feng Wu, they were only for training.","Training?","Chen Ziyun looked more closely and saw that Feng Wu had been using the same stance over and over again.","She was using the Spirit Stone Worms to train her stance.","“Boss, is Feng Wu still alive?”","Chen Ziyun snapped, “Of course she is! She can’t be any more alive!”","He ended the conversation after that.","When he looked up again, Elder Wu was nowhere to be found.","He only saw Feng Wu.","“Why did you stop?” Chen Ziyun felt conflicted because he still hadn’t gotten over the fact that Feng Wu was an extremely capable cultivator.","Feng Wu shrugged. “They’ve all run off. Where are we with the crystal cores?”","Spirit Stone Worms fed on spiritual stones, and the crystal cores they produced had even higher concentrations of spiritual essence.","Chen Ziyun looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Chen Ziyun asked, “Are you even human?”","Feng Wu frowned. “Why wouldn’t I be?”","Chen Ziyun said, “No ordinary human being could have done that! How did you manage to complete your mission so fast?!”","Feng Wu asked, “Have I killed 4,0000 already?”","Chen Ziyun stared at her. “You killed 4,000 worms in such a short time! That’s so scary!”","Feng Wu cleared her throat. “I lost count.”","Chen Ziyun closed his eyes. When he opened them again, he exhaled.","Some people were born to induce envy. Jun Linyuan was one of those people, and so was Feng Wu.","Chen Ziyun finally accepted the cruel reality.","After that, he began to see Feng Wu in a different light. He worshiped her now.","“Feng Wu, you’re incredible! No wonder you agreed to Elder Wu’s request. You’re already a Spiritual King!”"]},{"number":2782,"title":"Chapter 2782 - Glory (3)","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun grew more excited as he spoke. “I thought we were going to lose miserably, but we have you now!","“We may actually win!”","Feng Wu was perplexed. “Is the other team that capable?”","Chen Ziyun snorted. “They won the competition last year. This year, they went to Peace Grassland with better resources and the right to choose their location first. They chose the third zone. It was announced later that they had found a spiritual stone mine there!","“You may not know this, but at the center of every spiritual stone mine is a place that can shorten the time needed to cultivate by half!”","Feng Wu nodded. She knew this.","There was a spiritual stone mine beneath Grand Secretary Fang’s house. Her family members had been making fast progress for that reason.","Because she knew formations, she was able to direct the chaotic energy of the mine into the formation, where it could be slowly consumed.","Ordinary people could use that energy directly.","It could still improve their capability, but the spiritual essence would become unsustainable.","Chen Ziyun smiled bitterly. “They absorbed a lot of spiritual essence in the mine and all of them have made a lot of progress. Sheng Changtian is their captain.","“He was more capable than me when I met him in Peace Grassland. I don’t know what level he is at now.","“His teammates have improved significantly as well. They’ve never been as arrogant as they are now.”","He patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “Feng Wu, we’re counting on you!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “If all five of them are as powerful as you say, I may not be able to defeat them all.”","Chen Ziyun was frustrated. “I wish we had found a spiritual stone mine as well. That way, we would have also made great progress. This one was drained ages ago. There’s no energy left.”","An idea struck Feng Wu.","The energy might not exist anymore, but something else could improve the team’s capability in a short period of time.","“How many Spiritual Kings do we have?” Feng Wu asked.","Chen Ziyun shook his head. “You don’t want to know.”","Feng Wu said, “Now isn’t the time to keep secrets. Answer me.”","Chen Ziyun asked, “Are you a Spiritual King?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Chen Ziyun seemed crestfallen. “I’m not.”","Feng Wu said, “I know that.”","Chen Ziyun said, “I’ve been stuck at Level 9 for two years. No matter how hard I train, I still can’t make a breakthrough.”","Little Phoenix snorted in Feng Wu’s head. “Of course he can’t.”","Feng Wu asked, “Do you know why?”","Little Phoenix chuckled.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s wrong with him?”","Chen Ziyun had chosen to let her escape in a dangerous situation when he didn’t know her real level. He hadn’t abandoned her, and Feng Wu was grateful for that.","Little Phoenix said, “He made his breakthroughs too quickly before. He hasn’t built a solid foundation, and his dantian was injured again before it could recover from the previous injury.”"]},{"number":2783,"title":"Chapter 2783 - New Way Out (1)","paragraphs":["“When this kept happening, it left a crack in his dantian. His spiritual essence will leak whenever he starts to cultivate. Of course he can’t rise to the Spiritual King stage.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is there a way to fix it?”","Little Phoenix said, “The spirit wine. Let him drink it, and his dantian will heal. He’ll become a Spiritual King in no time.”","Meanwhile, Chen Ziyun was still analyzing things for Feng Wu. “After me, there’s Sun Yu. He still has a long way to go before he can become a Spiritual King.","“Sheng Changtian is the Military College’s team leader. He’s a Spiritual King. Another member is also somewhere between a Spiritual Lord and a Spiritual King. His name is Lu Haobei.","“Before you came, we were bound to lose the competition. Now that you’re here, we won’t lose so miserably. At least we’ll have the power to put up a fight.”","Feng Wu was perplexed. “Are you sure we’ll lose?”","Chen Ziyun nodded solemnly. “It’s the truth. I already know it. I just hope we won’t lose too quickly.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “I thought you wanted to win.”","Chen Ziyun said, “I do, but that won’t happen.”","Feng Wu said, “You can do it.”","Chen Ziyun smiled wryly.","He had told Feng Wu what the other team was like. Spiritual Lords could never defeat Spiritual Kings.","......","Feng Wu rose to her feet. “Let’s go.”","Chen Ziyun asked, “Where to?”","Feng Wu looked at Chen Ziyun. “We’re going to a place that’ll make you a Spiritual King.”","Chen Ziyun couldn’t believe it. He was feeling miserable, but the girl was still teasing him.","However, he was glad to have a Spiritual King on his team.","Their opponent had two, so having one on their side wasn’t a bad idea.","Chen Ziyun suddenly stopped Feng Wu.","“We’re already out of the 10km-area,” he said sternly.","Feng Wu said, “I know.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Do you know how important you are? We can’t afford to lose you! We need to turn around immediately!”","Feng Wu said, “Relax. No Spirit Stone Worm can hurt me.”","Chen Ziyun stared at her. “Yes, but that’s only limited to the ordinary ones. What if there are worms of higher levels?","“The Spirit Stone Worms you killed were filtered by Elder Wu beforehand!","“We’re safe within the 10km-radius. Once we’re out of that circle, we’ll be dead if we run into high-level Spirit Stone Worms!”","Chen Ziyun was nagging, when Feng Wu threw something into his hand.","It looked like a pouch and smelled funny.","“What’s this?” Chen Ziyun was perplexed.","Feng Wu said, “It’ll allow you to move around freely in this mine.”","It was what had enabled Ye Hongxue and the others to leave the mine safely.","Chen Ziyun asked, “What’s inside?”","He wanted to open it.","Feng Wu glanced at him and warned him, “I wouldn’t open it if I were you.”","Chen Ziyun was even more confused, but he listened to Feng Wu and didn’t open the pouch.","What confused him even more was that Feng Wu was right. They never met another worm, be it a low- or high-level one."]},{"number":2784,"title":"Chapter 2784 - New Way Out (2)","paragraphs":["However, Chen Ziyun was still worried.","“There are so many tunnels. Do you remember the way?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes.”","Chen Ziyun said, “How can you possibly remember that? Elder Mei said the formation changes all the time!”","Feng Wu didn’t answer.","Chen Ziyun thought he was right and panicked a little.","He could live with the possibility of dying, but Feng Wu was the hope of his team. He couldn’t let anything happen to her!","“Let’s go back now!” Chen Ziyun had never seemed more stern.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Do you know your way back?”","Chen Ziyun was dumbfounded.","Feng Wu didn’t stop.","According to Little Phoenix, the place was right in front.","But Feng Wu had her doubts.","......","Little Phoenix could have picked it up itself, so why did she have to come? Why did they have to bring Chen Ziyun?","Did it involve hard labor?","She had asked Little Phoenix several times, but the bird wouldn’t tell her.","Feng Wu had to wait.","Elder Wu had given them seven days, and a whole day had passed.","Chen Ziyun lost hope.","At first, the team members communicated with Chen Ziyun through the armband, but he was soon out of touch.","Sun Yu was the first to notice, so he immediately reported it to Elder Wu.","Chen Ziyun and Feng Wu were missing.","Elder Wu frowned. He had brought them here so that they could break past their limits in a desperate situation – it wasn’t like he was trying to kill them.","Now that both Feng Wu and Chen Ziyun were gone, Elder Wu felt uneasy.","He took the team to see Elder Mei.","Elder Mei had cleared out another area by then.","However, no one had heard from Feng Wu or Chen Ziyun. Their armbands were out of reach.","Elder Mei was completely absorbed in solving the formation.","Elder Wu told Mr. Xu what had happened.","Mr. Xu was Elder Mei’s disciple and Elder Wu’s junior, but he couldn’t control his temper anymore.","He glared at the team members.","“Didn’t I tell you to stay in the circle? That’s the only safe area! Why wouldn’t you listen?!","“You have no one but yourself to blame!”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Chen Ziyun was never so reckless before Feng Wu showed up...”","She was trying to make Feng Wu the culprit.","Mr. Xu said, “She’s obviously the troublemaker! I knew it from the very beginning! Now she’s done this! Doesn’t she know how busy we are?”","He then turned to Elder Wu. “Elder Mei has been searching every inch for the formation core. He hasn’t slept for days. We just don’t have the energy to look for Feng Wu.”","Zuo Qingluan nodded. “It’s not that we don’t want to. We don’t have the time.”","Elder Wu stepped forward and grabbed Elder Mei’s arm.","Elder Mei had been working on the formation, and he was furious at being disturbed.","Before Elder Mei could say anything, Elder Wu said, “Find Feng Wu! We must find her!”","Elder Mei stared at him. “Is she missing?”","Elder Wu nodded. “I’ll owe you one. Find her for me.”","Elder Mei looked from Elder Wu to the long tunnels."]},{"number":2785,"title":"Chapter 2785 - New Way Out (3)","paragraphs":["Elder Mei shook his head. “Not going to happen.”","Elder Wu said, “What’s that supposed to mean?”","Elder Mei said, “Do you know how many tunnels there are? 80,000.","“They don’t stay the same. They’re constantly changing!","Elder Mei pointed at a board in front of him. “I’ve only figured out several hundred of them so far. They’re already deep inside. How are we going to find them?","“Even I can’t find them,” Elder Mei said sternly. “I want to help you, but I can’t.”","Elder Wu had been through many crises, but he really began to panic now.","Feng Wu was the most talented kid he had ever taught!","He had only looked away for two seconds, and that kid went missing!","Elder Wu said, “If you won’t help me, I’ll do it myself!”","He marched off after that.","Elder Mei shook his head and went back to his work.","The team members looked at one another but didn’t know what to do.","......","Zuo Qingluan suddenly said, “I’ll take you to them.”","Everybody turned in her direction.","Zuo Qingluan said, “I’m the vice chief; helping them is my responsibility. Moreover, I’ve learned a thing or two from Elder Mei. Follow me if you trust me.”","She began to walk away.","Sun Yu and the others exchanged looks before following her.","Feng Wu had no idea that the others were searching for them.","If she had known this would happen, she would have told Elder Wu beforehand.","Even the wisest person couldn’t foresee everything.","Chen Ziyun no longer hesitated.","He had followed Feng Wu all the way here, and it was impossible to go back. He had no choice but to follow her.","He could only hope she was telling the truth.","As they approached their destination, Chen Ziyun sniffed. “Why is there a funny smell?”","Feng Wu didn’t answer because she was talking to Little Phoenix.","She had a far sharper nose and had picked up the scent before Chen Ziyun did.","Given how clever she was, she had some idea of what it was.","“You didn’t bury it under...” Her tone was quite strange. “Did you?”","Little Phoenix cleared its throat.","Feng Wu’s eyes widened. “Seriously?”","Little Phoenix cleared its throat.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s the matter with you?!”","Little Phoenix said matter-of-factly, “The spirit liquid can only turn into spirit wine if it’s buried there! I’m telling the truth!”","Feng Wu didn’t want to speak to the bird.","She said, “I’m not drinking it...”","Little Phoenix said, “Well, we’ll talk about that later...”","The closer they got, the stronger the smell was.","Chen Ziyun looked at Feng Wu. “Are we going in there?”","Feng Wu nodded in resignation.","Chen Ziyun said, “Has your nose stopped working? Can’t you smell it? It stinks!”","Feng Wu said, “Of course I can.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Then why are we going there?”","Feng Wu said, “We have to.”","Chen Ziyun didn’t want to talk to her anymore. “I’m not going.”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t you want to become a Spiritual King?”","Chen Ziyun stared at her."]},{"number":2786,"title":"Chapter 2786 - Spiritual King (1)","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun stared at Feng Wu. “Are you saying the stench can help me become a Spiritual King?”","Feng Wu said, “You’ll know in a minute.”","Chen Ziyun found the girl too whimsical to follow around.","However, she was the only Spiritual King on the team, and he had no choice but to follow her around.","“How strange.” Something occurred to Chen Ziyun. “We haven’t run into any more Spirit Stone Worms.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Are the Spirit Stone Worms avoiding you?”","Feng Wu asked, “Are they?”","Chen Ziyun thought about the possibility.","It was only a blind guess at first, but when he thought about it, he realized it was true.","Not only didn’t they have to fight any Spirit Stone Worms, the worms would also run away from them.","That was why their journey had been so uneventful.","“Are they really running away from you?” Chen Ziyun stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","......","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Chen Ziyun sighed. “You’re incredible...”","Feng Wu said, “Not necessarily...”","Chen Ziyun heard some noise just then.","He turned around and was astonished.","“Spirit Stone Worms!”","Only a second ago, he thought the worms were running away from Feng Wu.","However, that theory had just been proven wrong.","“Worms! They’re coming our way!” Chen Ziyun’s voice trembled.","He wasn’t a timid man. In fact, having fought in Peace Grassland, nothing could scare Chen Ziyun anymore.","However, what he saw was incredible.","They were in one of the many passageways, and behind them were countless tunnels.","Spirit Stone Worms were rushing out of all the tunnels.","They were all coming toward Chen Ziyun and Feng Wu.","Even more were coming.","Everywhere he looked, there were more worms than he could count. It was so frightening.","Chen Ziyun grabbed Feng Wu’s arm. “Spiritual Kings... So many of them are Spiritual Kings...”","How could Chen Ziyun not be frightened?","A single worm would crush him.","Yes, Feng Wu was capable.","However...","She might be able to fight off one or two worms, but what about ten or twenty?","There were far more than ten Spiritual King Worms.","“Why is this happening?” Chen Ziyun shuddered. “Why are there so many high-level Spirit Stone Worms? Are all the capable worms in the mine here?”","Feng Wu was amazed as well. The worms shouldn’t have all gathered here.","Little Phoenix could see what was happening in other parts of the mine, so it told Feng Wu, “It’s your enemy’s doing.”","Feng Wu asked, “My enemy? Who?”","Little Phoenix snapped, “Who else in this mine would consider you an enemy?”","“Zuo Qingluan?” Feng Wu frowned.","“That’s right.” Little Phoenix chuckled. “I didn’t see this coming. How interesting.”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you mean?”","Little Phoenix said, “She knows you’re here, so she has chased all the Spiritual King Worms in this direction. She wants to use the worms to kill you.”","Feng Wu frowned. “How does she know where I am?”","Little Phoenix said impatiently, “You’ve underestimated Firmament Palace.”"]},{"number":2787,"title":"Chapter 2787 - Spiritual King (2)","paragraphs":["Little Phoenix said, “Firmament Palace isn’t famous for nothing. Zuo Qingluan is their sacred lady. It’s not surprising that she would have a few tricks up her sleeve.”","Feng Wu agreed after some thought.","Little Phoenix said, “Plus, she has sensed the threat that you pose. If she knows you’re already a Spiritual King, she’ll kill you at all cost.”","Feng Wu snorted. “I’m about to do the same.”","She had worked so hard to improve herself because she wanted to get revenge and kill Zuo Qingluan.","It might look like she had moved on from her past, but no one could move on from a past like that.","Getting revenge on Zuo Qingluan was her ultimate motivation.","Little Phoenix frowned. “We must kill Zuo Qingluan, but it’s too risky now.”","Feng Wu said, “No, I think now is the best time.","“The Secret Essence Mine is your territory,” Feng Wu said sternly, “and I’m already a Spiritual King.","“We’re both Spiritual Kings. I have a chance.” Feng Wu had never sounded so serious.","Little Phoenix wanted to object, but Feng Wu’s serious tone stopped it.","Zuo Qingluan was a Level 1 Spiritual King last time they checked. What about now?","However, Feng Wu was right. This was Little Phoenix’s territory. What could Zuo Qingluan do?","Chen Ziyun had no idea that Feng Wu was getting ready for a major battle.","“Wait a minute!”","Chen Ziyun was shocked.","The Spiritual King Worms didn’t stop for even a second as they crawled past the both of them.","Some worms bumped into him, but they kept moving as if he didn’t exist.","Chen Ziyun didn’t know what to say.","It took him a while to realize what had happened. He asked Feng Wu, “What’s going on?”","Feng Wu shrugged.","Chen Ziyun said, “Why won’t they eat us?”","He felt ignored.","Feng Wu said, “I’m sure they have more important things to do.”","Chen Ziyun was confused. “What’s more important than eating?”","Soon, he knew the answer to that question.","Excretion!","Chen Ziyun’s mouth fell open when he saw the pile of feces.","He was confused. “Do Spirit Stone Worms have intelligence? They’re so clean. Did they just come here to take a dump?”","He then saw a row of deep pits blocking their way.","The worms’ movements almost reminded them of human beings.","They lined up, moved to the side of a pit, finished their business and moved away. The next worm would do the same.","Chen Ziyun didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu didn’t expect to see this either, and an idea suddenly occurred to her.","She knew how to handle Zuo Qingluan.","Chen Ziyun covered his nose. “Let’s get out of here. I can’t stand the smell anymore.”","However, Little Phoenix said timidly, “It’s buried beneath the third pit over there...”","It almost sounded guilty.","Feng Wu looked at Chen Ziyun.","Little Phoenix nodded. “Let him do it.”","The look gave Chen Ziyun the creeps. He stared at Feng Wu and asked, “Why are you looking at me like that? Are you setting me up?”","Feng Wu almost couldn’t say it. “Chen Ziyun, how about we make a deal?”"]},{"number":2788,"title":"Chapter 2788 - Spiritual King (3)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu looked at Chen Ziyun. “How about we make a deal?”","Chen Ziyun was alarmed. “What do you want?”","Feng Wu said, “It’s over there.”","Chen Ziyun looked in the direction she was pointing.","He saw the enormous cesspit.","The Spirit Stone Worms’ cesspit.","It was surrounded by worms.","Chen Ziyun suddenly had a very bad feeling, and he was even more alarmed.","Feng Wu couldn’t make herself say it.","She asked Little Phoenix, “Can’t you order the worms to take it out?”","Little Phoenix said, “It’s their treasure. If they find out where it is, they’ll never give it to us. We have to take it quietly.","“Plus, what’s in the pit is feces to us. Do you know what they are to the Spirit Stone Worms?”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","......","The bird said, “It’s their life essence!”","Feng Wu burst out laughing.","Little Phoenix said, “Stop laughing! I’m telling the truth. Why do you think I buried the spirit liquid here? Why do you think they come here?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Little Phoenix said, “Let’s take it out as soon as possible before anything goes wrong. Zuo Qingluan is headed this way.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She turned to Chen Ziyun. “Something is buried inside that pit.”","Chen Ziyun was mortified. “You’re not telling me to go in there, are you?”","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","Chen Ziyun shook his head repeatedly. “Never! That’s not going to happen!”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Not gonna happen!”","Feng Wu said, “Alright. In that case, I’ll let Sun Yu and the others rise to the Spiritual King stage after I retrieve the treasure. You can remain a Spiritual Lord.”","Chen Ziyun said, “I don’t believe you.”","Feng Wu smiled and raised her hand.","A green vine extended from within her sleeve.","It was glowing.","However, the glow flickered a little.","Little Phoenix encouraged the vine. “It’s alright. You’re a plant. The feces will be very nutritious for you.”","The vine shivered reluctantly, but it dug into the pit in the end.","Chen Ziyun stared at Feng Wu. “What are you doing? Why are you stirring the cesspit?”","Feng Wu wanted to throw him inside.","However, she didn’t have time for that now.","She had the vine go deeper and deeper, but she couldn’t find anything.","Feng Wu asked impatiently, “Are you sure it’s buried here?”","Little Phoenix said, “Of course! I buried it myself. Why can’t you find it?”","Feng Wu said, “If you could dig the hole before, why can’t you take it out on your own?”","Little Phoenix said, “Well, I...”","Just then, they heard footsteps.","“Zuo Qingluan’s here,” Little Phoenix reminded Feng Wu. “She broke off from the others.”","Feng Wu looked around and gestured at Chen Ziyun to take cover.","Chen Ziyun was confused. “Why do I need to hide?”","Feng Wu said, “You’re a witness. If Zuo Qingluan kills me, do you think she’ll let you live?”","Chen Ziyun asked, “Zuo Qingluan wants to kill you? Why?”"]},{"number":2789,"title":"Chapter 2789 - Confrontation (1)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu asked, “Why do you think?”","Chen Ziyun said, “That’s impossible. I don’t believe...”","Feng Wu kicked him into the pit before he had time to react.","Chen Ziyun was furious.","That evil girl! Was she trying to kill him?","Feng Wu stuffed something in his hand before she kicked him into the pit. He opened his palm and saw that it was a Spiritual Fossil Stone.","It could record things.","What did that mean?","The footsteps quickly approached when Chen Ziyun was about to climb out.","It was indeed Zuo Qingluan.","So what? Chen Ziyun was going to come out of the pit, when he saw Zuo Qingluan attack Feng Wu without warning.","It was a killing move.","OMG!","......","Chen Ziyun was astonished.","He had thought Zuo Qingluan would scold them when she found them. He hadn’t seen this coming!","Ding!","Feng Wu drew out her Fallen Star Sword.","The two swords collided.","Sparks flew everywhere.","Feng Wu stumbled back to cancel out Zuo Qingluan’s force.","Zuo Qingluan stood her ground.","In Chen Ziyun’s eyes, Zuo Qingluan was much more capable than Feng Wu.","He was about to come out, but when he saw how strange Zuo Qingluan’s behavior was, he realized what the Spiritual Fossil Stone was for. He thought, “You clever girl.”","He decided he would wait in the pit and see what Zuo Qingluan was up to.","The two girls landed in their original spots after that one exchange.","Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Wu and gave off terrifying energy.","The temperature suddenly dropped.","Even the air seemed to stir.","Energy surged from her sword, filling the space.","Zuo Qingluan glowered at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu met her gaze with the same intensity.","“You’re a Spiritual King!” Zuo Qingluan gritted her teeth, her voice shaking with rage. “You managed to reach the Spiritual King stage under my nose!”","Feng Wu gave her an indifferent look.","Zuo Qingluan’s face was twisted with rage.","“You really are a genius! I was watching you closely, but you still managed to become a Spiritual King. I’m amazed, Feng Wu!”","Zuo Qingluan hardly ever let her emotions show on her face.","But that was when she was around other people.","She couldn’t control her temper now.","Feng Wu grinned a little. “Do you regret it?”","“Yes, I do!”","Zuo Qingluan ground her teeth. “I regret that I didn’t kill you!”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right. You and your family destroyed my True Phoenix Blood back then. I couldn’t understand why you let me live. Mercy isn’t your thing.”","“Because I hate you.","“I want you to live in a living hell!”","Zuo Qingluan had no idea that Chen Ziyun was hiding in the cesspit nearby with a Spiritual Fossil Stone in his hand. She had no scruples.","The smell was so strong that Chen Ziyun’s scent was completely covered. Had it not been the case, Zuo Qingluan would have discovered Chen Ziyun right away and would never have said those things.","She was telling the whole truth because she thought these were the last moments of Feng Wu’s life."]},{"number":2790,"title":"Chapter 2790 - Confrontation (2)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu frowned.","Zuo Qingluan grew agitated. “Let’s be clear about one thing: I’m the only one who has the True Phoenix Blood in this world. No one else can have it!”","Feng Wu asked, “Can’t we both have it?”","“No! Never!” Zuo Qingluan said decisively. “I want to be the only one in everything! No one can take what’s mine!”","Feng Wu said, “We were only eight years old five years ago. What could I possibly take from you?”","Zuo Qingluan smirked. “You didn’t take what’s mine? Feng Wu, you’re so forgetful!”","Feng Wu asked, “Why do you say that?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “We both have the True Phoenix Blood, but why did you always make faster progress than me?”","Feng Wu thought, “That’s because I’m from another world, and I have my memories from a previous life. Of course I’m a faster learner than you.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Why are you more knowledgeable than me?”","...","Feng Wu’s mouth twitched.","That was because she was taught by her beautiful master, who used to rule the continent and knew pretty much everything. Of course she knew more than Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan said, “Why did that old hag from Firmament Palace want to take you as her disciple, not me?”","The old hag of Firmament Palace? Feng Wu was surprised.","She wasn’t the only one. Chen Ziyun was also shocked.","He had forgotten about the foul smell and only cared about what he was hearing.","He remembered what happened five years ago.","Everybody in the imperial capital did.","It was said that Feng Wu had lost her True Phoenix Blood because she became greedy and her cultivation went awry. As it turned out, that wasn’t what happened.","Her True Phoenix Blood had been destroyed by Zuo Qingluan and her family!","It was such shocking news.","Chen Ziyun felt as if he had been struck by lightning.","True Phoenix Blood.","It was the True Phoenix Blood they were talking about!","Chen Ziyun’s breath became heavier, but because of where they were and how agitated Zuo Qingluan was, she didn’t notice.","Feng Wu frowned at Zuo Qingluan. “How did you know the head of Firmament Palace wanted to take me in?”","Zuo Qingluan laughed. “How could I not know? That old hag complimented you in front of my grandfather all the time! She never mentioned me, who also has the True Phoenix Blood! If she hadn’t done that, my family would never have done that thing!”","Feng Wu smirked. “Who are you kidding? Of course your family would have done it. You’ve probably been trying to get rid of me ever since I was born!”","“No, not at first,” Zuo Qingluan said earnestly. “At first, when they found out we both had the True Phoenix Blood, they trained me with all their might. They wanted me to be prettier and more capable than you.","“But you were too talented!” Zuo Qingluan glared at Feng Wu.","She had always been a proud girl and never showed her emotions. Now that she thought nobody was around, she decided to speak her mind before she killed Feng Wu."]},{"number":2791,"title":"Chapter 2791 - Confrontation (3)","paragraphs":["“We should be equally talented, but you were better than me in every way! Your level was always higher, you were better-looking, and you were good at everything from formations to inscriptions!","“We didn’t want to kill you, but you asked for it. We didn’t have a choice.”","Feng Wu smiled, “You’ve omitted the most important reason, haven’t you?”","Zuo Qingluan stared at her. “What?”","Feng Wu said, “It’s Jun Linyuan, isn’t it?”","Chen Ziyun thought he was going to faint from the foul smell, but his spirit was lifted when he heard the name.","Jun Linyuan?","His Royal Highness?","Why was the crown prince involved?","He immediately turned the Spiritual Fossil Stone toward Zuo Qingluan to record this precious scene.","His heart was thumping with excitement.","Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Wu. “You’re not allowed to mention his name!”","Feng Wu smiled at Zuo Qingluan. “You never thought that the annulment of our engagement would be stopped at the last moment, did you?”","......","Her smile infuriated Zuo Qingluan.","“Yes!” Zuo Qingluan admitted it. “I ruined your reputation so that the royal family would reject you as a daughter-in-law. However, they didn’t do that, so I had to destroy your True Phoenix Blood. You made me do it!”","Feng Wu said, “I never made you do anything. You were trying to take what didn’t belong to you.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “I know you have to fight for it if you want something!”","Feng Wu said, “By ‘fight for it,’ you mean taking it by fair means or foul.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “At least I made your life miserable, didn’t I?”","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","Zuo Qingluan said, “At first, I thought you would die after losing the True Phoenix Blood. It was careless of me.","“I never thought you would survive. Feng Wu, you’re so lucky.”","Feng Wu stared at Zuo Qingluan. The emotion in her eyes was as powerful as a hurricane.","She hadn’t died, but her survival had been at the cost of her beautiful master.","That thought made her want to tear Zuo Qingluan to pieces.","Even if she could revive her beautiful master in the end, he had still missed five beautiful years in her life.","Zuo Qingluan laughed when she saw Feng Wu’s rage.","“When I knew you had survived, I went to see you in the Feng family,” Zuo Qingluan said condescendingly.","“I was going to kill you and finish this nonsense for good, but what did I see? Feng Liu was picking on you.”","Zuo Qingluan laughed. “Feng Liu used to follow you like a dog. She would lick the bottom of your shoes. After you lost your ability, she whipped you.","“And she did the same to your brother and mother. She bullied your family whenever she could and even poisoned your food. I was thrilled to see that.","“I thought there and then that I should keep you alive. I would miss so much fun if you were dead. With you around, I could see you getting bullied when I felt like it, and it would keep me happy for some time. How wonderful that would be!”"]},{"number":2792,"title":"Chapter 2792 - Confrontation (4)","paragraphs":["“It excited me to think about you lying helplessly on the bed.” Zuo Qingluan’s tone was almost maniacal.","Feng Wu took a deep breath. “All those things happened because I’m talented, I make fast progress and I’m engaged to His Royal Highness. Your jealousy was the reason for everything. Zuo Qingluan, I want to kill you.”","Zuo Qingluan chuckled. “I told you already. Everything you used to own would be mine, and I was right. After you lost your ability, I became the center of attention again.”","Feng Wu stared at her.","Zuo Qingluan said, “I became that old hag’s disciple and the sacred lady of Firmament Palace. I’m the only girl who has the True Phoenix Blood. I’m His Royal Highness’s fiancee now...”","Feng Wu said mockingly, “You’re Jun Linyuan’s fiancee? How come I don’t know that?”","Zuo Qingluan glared at her.","Feng Wu said, “I thought you already knew that I’m still engaged to him.”","Her eleventh trial wasn’t done yet, and she needed to make Zuo Qingluan admit that Jun Linyuan was in love with Feng Wu.","That was why she provoked Zuo Qingluan whenever she could. Unfortunately, she still hadn’t succeeded.","There was an indescribable look on Zuo Qingluan’s face.","If she could, she would kill Feng Wu with her eyes.","Feng Wu said, “Didn’t you say I was going to die? Are you still not going to admit that Jun Linyuan is in love with me?”","......","Chen Ziyun didn’t know what to say.","Miss Feng Wu was so bad at speaking her mind. She insisted that she had nothing to do with His Royal Highness, but she was showing off now in front of Zuo Qingluan. She was trying to wind her up.","It was unbelievable!","Zuo Qingluan’s energy made some loud thumps, so powerful that it seemed to stir the air.","Her spiritual essence started a heavy wind in the cave.","Feng Wu stood where she was and smiled at Zuo Qingluan. “You know very well that Jun Linyuan and I are engaged, and you also know he’s in love with me, but you’ve been spreading rumors that you’re His Royal Highness’s fiancee. How can you do such a thing? Don’t you know how it bothers me?”","She tried to make Zuo Qingluan admit the truth.","It was incredible!","Zuo Qingluan had no idea that Chen Ziyun was filming, and she snorted. “That’s right! I did all that! I had people spread rumors about me being His Royal Highness’s fiancee! So what?!","“I did it, and everybody believes me! Do you know why?”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Because you’re going to die. After that, I’ll be the only one with the True Phoenix Blood again. Of course His Royal Highness will marry me!”","Feng Wu sighed. “Why are you so sure that I’m going to die?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Because I’m going to live.”","She made a move after that.","Energy surged from her body.","It rushed toward Feng Wu like a tidal wave.","“You’re a Level 2 Spiritual King, then?” Feng Wu stared at her.","Zuo Qingluan had said all she wanted to say, and it was time to demonstrate her power.","She answered with her actions instead of words.","The air between them stirred.","The Spirit Stone Worms, including the Spiritual Kings, sensed the fierce energy, and ran off immediately.","Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan were left alone.","Of course, that didn’t include Chen Ziyun, whom Zuo Qingluan still hadn’t sensed."]},{"number":2793,"title":"Chapter 2793 - Defeat (1)","paragraphs":["Being a Level 2 Spiritual King, Zuo Qingluan was indeed very capable.","She thought she was definitely going to win this battle.","Zuo Qingluan expected to see Feng Wu sliced into half when her sword landed on the latter.","To her surprise, Feng Wu wasn’t injured.","Not only that, Zuo Qingluan noticed that the spiritual essence on her blade had disappeared.","How did that happen?","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t believe it.","She injected her spiritual essence into the blade and struck at Feng Wu again.","The spiritual essence disappeared again.","Feng Wu was unharmed.","...","Zuo Qingluan was astonished.","She stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “What are you wearing?!”","Only then did Feng Wu remember the treasure Jun Linyuan had given her.","It was a great chance to provoke Zuo Qingluan, and Feng Wu wasn’t going to miss it.","She feigned an arrogant demeanor and glanced at Zuo Qingluan. “What do you think I’m wearing?”","She pulled down her collar a little and showed Zuo Qingluan what she had on underneath.","Zuo Qingluan immediately recognized it.","She had seen Jun Linyuan’s soft armor by chance a few years back and had been trying to get it ever since.","She had dreamed many times that Jun Linyuan would put it on her with his own hands.","But...","Feng Wu was wearing it now.","The armor only accentuated her nice figure.","Zuo Qingluan’s eyes were practically spitting fire.","“That’s impossible! Why would he give it to you? You must be dreaming!”","Feng Wu smiled at her. “If he didn’t give it to me, did I steal it from him?”","Zuo Qingluan was rendered speechless.","How was she going to answer that?!","Feng Wu smiled. “Are you still not going to admit that His Royal Highness is in love with me?”","Zuo Qingluan gritted her teeth.","She would rather die than admit it.","Seeing how unperturbed Feng Wu was, Zuo Qingluan got even angrier.","She struck out without warning.","This time, she focused on the spots that weren’t covered by the armor.","The back of the head, the forehead, and the throat.","There were many ways to kill a person.","To her frustration, Zuo Qingluan realized that she couldn’t kill Feng Wu any time soon.","Zuo Qingluan was a Level 2 Spiritual King, and Feng Wu was at Level 1. There was a difference in their cultivation levels, but the gap wasn’t huge.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t have a 100% chance of winning, and Feng Wu might not lose.","Feng Wu had a 30% chance of winning.","Zuo Qingluan grew anxious as the battle went on.","She didn’t know that Feng Wu was leading her toward where Chen Ziyun was hiding.","Feng Wu was more prepared than Zuo Qingluan.","The prolonged battle only made Zuo Qingluan anxious.","After all, she had thought at the beginning that she couldn’t possibly lose.","She smirked. “Feng Wu, is that all you’ve got? Go to hell!”","As soon as she said that, Feng Wu apologized to Chen Ziyun in her head.","Thump!","The bomb she had buried in the cesspit earlier was set off.","The explosion wasn’t powerful enough to hurt Zuo Qingluan. It couldn’t even injure Chen Ziyun.","However!","The yellow feces splattered everywhere.","Zuo Qingluan was mortified."]},{"number":2794,"title":"Chapter 2794 - Defeat (2)","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan was dumbfounded.","Caught off guard, she was covered by feces.","She looked down and saw that her pretty clothes were stained yellow.","Her hair was dirty as well.","She sniffed and recognized the smell...","Wow!","She threw up.","It was gross.","The idea of what was on her clothes and hair made her want to pass out.","“Feng Wu! I’m going to kill you!”","...","Zuo Qingluan wasn’t so angry before, but now, she was beyond furious.","Her spiritual essence surged, and her eyes glowed with hatred.","Spiritual Kings could be very scary when they lost control.","Feng Wu smirked.","She had deliberately forced Zuo Qingluan into this state.","Although Zuo Qingluan wasn’t the noblest person, she was still very capable. It wouldn’t be easy to find loopholes in her stances.","Fighting her the ordinary way would be disadvantageous for Feng Wu.","That was why she had enraged Zuo Qingluan on purpose.","She needed to push Zuo Qingluan into making mistakes.","After all, someone as proud as Zuo Qingluan would never stand being covered by feces.","Feng Wu had carefully chosen this spot.","Zuo Qingluan had no idea how elaborate this plan was. She took the bait and walked into Feng Wu’s trap.","She was furious.","Her eyes were bloodshot red, and blue veins popped on her forehead.","“Die!”","She kept attacking Feng Wu.","All her stances were killing moves.","Feng Wu ran so fast that she seemed to be wearing wheels. Zuo Qingluan couldn’t even grab her clothes to catch her.","“Feng Wu! Stop right there!” Zuo Qingluan shouted.","Feng Wu stuck out her tongue. “Catch me if you can!”","When Elder Wu found them by sensing the fluctuations of their spiritual essence, he saw the state the two girls were in.","Feng Wu was perfectly calm.","Zuo Qingluan was the one who was losing control.","Elder Wu was speechless.","He shouted, “Stop! Both of you!”","Feng Wu sighed inwardly when she saw Elder Wu. What a shame.","Elder Wu couldn’t have picked a worse time.","She had finally driven Zuo Qingluan to the edge, but the battle had to stop after Elder Wu arrived.","Now that Zuo Qingluan had learned her real capability, it wouldn’t be easy to find another chance like this.","At that thought, she rolled her eyes at Elder Wu.","Zuo Qingluan felt even more frustrated.","Her plan was to kill Feng Wu, but Elder Wu was in her way.","She shouted, “Get lost! I’m going to kill her!”","Elder Wu was trying to help, but Zuo Qingluan shouted at him. Even someone as good-tempered as he became angry.","Seeing Zuo Qingluan charge at him with her sword in her hand, Elder Wu waved his hand impatiently.","Thump!","There was a loud sound!","Zuo Qingluan flew backward and landed in the cesspit.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Elder Wu was speechless.","Chen Ziyun didn’t know what to say.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","Time seemed to freeze.","Everybody fell silent.","All eyes were on Zuo Qingluan, who still seemed stunned."]},{"number":2795,"title":"Chapter 2795 - Screw Firmament Palace","paragraphs":["She was Zuo Qingluan, the sacred lady of Firmament Palace! She was an untouchable beauty, but now...","She retched and threw up.","She felt weak. When she wanted to stand up, she slipped and sat back down.","More yellow liquid splashed everywhere.","Zuo Qingluan wanted to kill herself.","Frustrated, Zuo Qingluan turned around and glared at Feng Wu.","She ground her teeth in hatred.","From what Feng Wu knew about Zuo Qingluan, she would leave, clean herself up and take her revenge later. However, Feng Wu was wrong this time.","Zuo Qingluan rose to her feet, her eyes never leaving Feng Wu.","“Elder Wu, please get out of my way.”","...","Elder Wu frowned at Zuo Qingluan but didn’t reply.","“Please go away!” Zuo Qingluan walked toward Feng Wu, still covered in feces, but Elder Wu blocked her way.","“She’s offended me!” Zuo Qingluan met Elder Wu’s eyes. “I’m going to teach her a lesson. Move!”","Zuo Qingluan’s tone was very serious. In her mind, everybody should give her what she wanted, and Elder Wu should move out of her way.","However, Elder Wu wasn’t a member of the Zuo family. He worked for Imperial College. Therefore, he only glared at Zuo Qingluan.","“You’re a vice chief, but a student almost defeated you! Aren’t you ashamed?!”","OMG!","Feng Wu and Chen Ziyun both stared at Elder Wu, amazed by how bold the old man was.","Zuo Qingluan was already angry, and what Elder Wu said made her want to scream.","She stared at Elder Wu. “Are you taking her side, then?”","Elder Wu said angrily, “You don’t get to decide which side I’m on!”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what Elder Wu was like. The old man had been bullied for half his life, so he hated condescending geniuses.","However, Zuo Qingluan didn’t know any of that. She even tried to threaten him with her family and Firmament Palace. “If you move aside, you’ll be a friend of the Zuo family and Firmament Palace.”","How arrogant!","Firmament Palace was the force which had used to bully Elder Wu.","“Screw Firmament Palace!” Elder Wu was furious.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t expect such a reaction. She was so furious that she laughed. “I’ll remember what you said!”","She then turned to Feng Wu. “It’s your lucky day. Elder Wu is vouching for you, so you get to live another day, but he can’t be there for you all the time!”","She gave Feng Wu and Elder Wu a final glance before marching off.","Feng Wu frowned a little.","Zuo Qingluan had her merits. She could calm down immediately after she threw a tantrum. Once she cooled her head, she wouldn’t be as easy to take care of, but Feng Wu wasn’t scared.","She had been able to start from scratch and catch up with Zuo Qingluan in a year. They were almost at the same level now. Zuo Qingluan didn’t scare her.","“What kind of grudges are there between you? Was that really necessary?” Elder Wu was confused."]},{"number":2796,"title":"Chapter 2796 - I’ll Call Them Dad","paragraphs":["In Elder Wu’s eyes, it was only bickering between two girls, but Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I’m getting back at her for destroying my True Phoenix Blood. Is that serious enough?”","True Phoenix Blood?!","Elder Wu had heard about the incident before, but he didn’t know it involved Zuo Qingluan.","Recalling how frustrated Zuo Qingluan was, Elder Wu realized what had happened.","He patted Feng Wu. “Try not to be on your own from now on.”","“Hachoo!”","Chen Ziyun sneezed.","Only then did Elder Wu realize that there was someone in the cesspit.","He was surprised.","It was a major oversight for someone of his capability.","...","Seeing that Chen Ziyun wanted to come out, Feng Wu immediately said, “Help me dig something out, and I’ll make you a Spiritual King.”","Chen Ziyun didn’t believe her.","To do that, he would have to bury his entire body in the feces, and he wasn’t going to do that.","However, Feng Wu was telling the truth.","Out of all the places, Little Phoenix had to bury the thing in the cesspit because it was where the essence of the Spirit Stone Worms was.","“Wait!” Elder Wu cried out. “These are very precious! However, the spiritual essence has been absorbed by something else. What happened?”","Chen Ziyun looked at Elder Wu. “Is that really possible?’","Elder Wu nodded. “I think you should try.”","Chen Ziyun stared at Feng Wu. “There will be consequences if I can’t find anything down there.”","When he finally found it, Feng Wu came back with a large bucket of water.","Water was difficult to find in a place like this.","The smell was suffocating, and Chen Ziyun immediately poured the water over his head to wash himself clean.","He sniffed at his clothes, but the smell was still there. He felt like crying.","Feng Wu gave him some deodorant.","That finally got rid of the stink, and Chen Ziyun let out a breath of relief.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had cleaned the box.","It was only the size of a basketball basket. She opened it to reveal a porcelain bottle with a thin neck and small bottom. It wouldn’t hold much liquid.","Little Phoenix dashed out of Feng Wu’s sleeve and started drinking from the bottle.","Whoosh —","It stopped after taking three gulps and handed it to the cub.","The cub was confused, but it took the bottle obediently and took three gulps like Little Phoenix before handing it back to Feng Wu.","Little Phoenix said, “Don’t disturb us for a while!”","The bird and the cub disappeared after that. They went back to Feng Wu’s ring space.","They went as fast as they had come, and Chen Ziyun didn’t have time to react.","“They...” He hadn’t seen Feng Wu’s pets before and was intrigued by them.","“They’ve gone back to cultivate. Next time they come out, they’ll be Spiritual Kings.” Feng Wu held the bottle and smiled at Chen Ziyun.","Chen Ziyun found her words idiotic and didn’t really want to talk to her.","Why did she make turning into Spiritual Kings sound so easy?","He stared at her and asked, “Do you know how hard it is to become a Spiritual King? Do you know how long I’ve been stuck at this level? Do you know how hard I’ve worked for it? If someone can make me a Spiritual King, I’ll call them ‘dad’!”"]},{"number":2797,"title":"Chapter 2797 - Who’s Your Daddy? (1)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu smiled at Chen Ziyun. “Do you want to become a Spiritual King or not?”","Chen Ziyun stared at Feng Wu. “Do I want to? Who wouldn’t?!","“Do you know how hard Sun Yu and the others have worked for it?","“Do you know how miserably they were defeated by Spiritual Kings in Peace Grassland?","“Do you know how many people would pay anything to become a Spiritual King?","“You’re already a Spiritual King. You don’t know how frustrating it is for people like me.”","Chen Ziyun waved his hand and looked as miserable as someone who wasn’t understood by other people.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She handed Chen Ziyun the bottle.","Chen Ziyun looked at her in confusion.","Feng Wu said, “Drink it.”","Chen Ziyun shook his head, “No, I won’t.”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure? You earned it.”","......","Chen Ziyun stared at Feng Wu. “Mention it again, and I’ll be angry!”","He then gave Feng Wu back the Spiritual Fossil Stone.","He had recorded everything since Zuo Qingluan’s arrival.","Including everything Zuo Qingluan had said.","The look Chen Ziyun gave her was a mix of pity and compassion. He felt sorry for what she had gone through.","Feng Wu put away the Spiritual Fossil Stone and looked at Chen Ziyun again.","“Are you sure you don’t want it?”","“Yes! Force me again, and I’ll be mad at you!” Chen Ziyun glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","The thought of him being buried in feces made him want to throw up. He had lost all appetite.","Meanwhile, Elder Wu was staring at Feng Wu’s bottle.","He sniffed, and his eyes lit up.","“Is that... Can it be...” Elder Wu’s eyes flickered, and he looked like a hungry wolf.","“Is that spirit wine?” Elder Wu was pleasantly surprised.","Feng Wu was also surprised. “Have you heard of it before?”","Elder Wu smacked the wall in excitement. “Of course I have! All people of my age have!”","Chen Ziyun was stunned. Feng Wu’s bottle had to contain something really amazing to make Elder Wu so excited.","Elder Wu was one of the 36 elders of the school.","They were the foundation and the most effective defense system of Imperial College.","Chen Ziyun was intrigued and looked back and forth between Elder Wu and Feng Wu.","Elder Wu was glaring at Feng Wu. “Are you holding real spirit wine?”","Feng Wu said lightly, “That’s right.","Elder Wu said, “Show me! Show me now!”","Since Elder Wu had criticized Zuo Qingluan, Feng Wu returned the favor by handing it to him.","Elder Wu didn’t gulp it down like Little Phoenix had.","He carefully poured a drop on his fingertip and put his finger in his mouth.","His eyes lit up.","OMG!","The smell and taste indicated that it was spirit wine!"]},{"number":2798,"title":"Chapter 2798 - Who’s Your Daddy? (2)","paragraphs":["It really was spirit wine!","Elder Wu was so excited that he thought he was going to lose his mind.","He stared at Feng Wu. “Yes! It’s spirit wine! I can recognize it from a mile away!”","Feng Wu nodded with a smile.","Chen Ziyun looked at Elder Wu in bewilderment. He still didn’t know what was going on.","Elder Wu then kicked him, and Chen Ziyun dropped to his knees.","The elder made sure that the boy was kneeling in front of Feng Wu.","Chen Ziyun stared at Elder Wu in astonishment.","What was going on?","Elder Wu said angrily, “She’s your daddy now!”","Pffft!","Chen Ziyun couldn’t stop laughing.","......","Was the old man trying to be funny?","Feng Wu felt utterly confused. She didn’t know if Elder Wu was being serious or trying to be funny.","Elder Wu had done it on the spur of a moment, and he felt awkward when he realized what he had done.","He gave Chen Ziyun a stern look and scolded him. “You idiot! I can’t believe you can be so stupid! Even pigs are cleverer than you because they’ll eat what they’re fed! You’ve been given the best thing on this continent, but you won’t take it! How stupid can you be?”","Chen Ziyun was confused, but he seemed to understand a little...","Exactly what was this spirit wine?","Seeing that Chen Ziyun still looked stunned, Elder Wu said, “It’ll take you straight to the Spiritual King stage!”","WHAT?!","Chen Ziyun blinked in astonishment.","“Straight to the Spiritual King stage? How’s that possible? It can’t be!”","How could something so precious exist?","Elder Wu glared at him. “Of course it’s possible! Most of the elders became Spiritual Kings because they drank spirit wine!","“We were a seeded team, too, and we also couldn’t make it to the Spiritual King stage. The wine brought us there!”","What? Chen Ziyun was astonished. “Why weren’t we given any?”","Elder Wu said, “The Secret Essence Mine collapsed, and we couldn’t find it again. Our stock ran out, so we couldn’t give you any.”","Chen Ziyun said, “So, we came into the Secret Essence Mine to...”","Elder Wu nodded. “We came here to train you as well as to search for spirit wine. However, we didn’t have much hope of finding it, but you dug it out!”","Chen Ziyun said, “I didn’t. Feng Wu told me where to dig.”","He didn’t dare take the credit.","Elder Wu nodded, turned to Feng Wu, and tried to find the right words.","The spirit wine meant a lot to the team members, who were still Level 9 Spiritual Lords.","Elder Wu tried to say something but couldn’t bring himself to say it.","Seeing what Elder Wu was getting at, Feng Wu held out her hand.","Elder Wu looked from the bottle to Feng Wu. He didn’t know what to give to her.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She said in resignation, “That’s mine.”","Elder Wu ground his teeth. “I can give it to you, but you have to share it with the team members.”","He was being fair enough. Other people would have taken it away without asking for Feng Wu’s opinion, and there was nothing she would be able to do about it.","Feng Wu said, “It sounds like you really want our team to win.”"]},{"number":2799,"title":"Chapter 2799 - Bargain","paragraphs":["Elder Wu said grumpily, “Why would I want to lose?”","He knew Feng Wu was too clever to believe in some made-up excuse, so he said, “Why do you think there’s a competition between the two colleges every year? Do you think it’s about petty resources, like we’ve been telling the students?","“Of course not!” Elder Wu stared at Feng Wu. “It’s related to how the resources are allocated between the elders of the two colleges!","“If you win, we’ll receive a significant amount of cultivation resources from the empire and the right to command the battle in Peace Grassland!”","Feng Wu asked, “The right to command the battle?”","She didn’t know so much was involved.","“What do you think?” Elder Wu stared at her. “Do you think everybody just fights on their own there? Of course somebody has to command them!”","Feng Wu said, “Isn’t that Northern Feng General’s job?”","The general was, in fact, her godfather.","Elder Wu said, “Yes, he’s the highest command, but cultivators can only fight at their own stages.”","Feng Wu looked at him in confusion.","...","Elder Wu said, “For example, you’re a Spiritual King, so you can only go to the Spiritual King battlefield in the grassland. If you enter Spiritual Lord territory, you’ll be punished for it.”","Feng Wu’s eyes widened. “I didn’t know such a rule existed!”","Elder Wu waved his hand. “You’ve never been to Peace Grassland. Why am I telling you this now? Just remember, the competition is more than a game between students. It’s a battle between two forces.","“All eyes will be on the two teams. The Military Academy’s team already has two Spiritual Kings, and we only have you. We’re at a severe disadvantage!”","Elder Wu said sternly, “Feng Wu, will you contribute to your college and make us proud?”","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","It would take more than that to take the spirit wine from her.","She took the bottle from Elder Wu and put it away before she grinned at the old man. “I’ll give it to whomever I want to give it to. Nobody can tell me what to do.”","Elder Wu was a little displeased. “Feng Wu, this is a serious matter!”","Feng Wu smiled. “Why should it bother me?”","Did Elder Wu think he could persuade her with the speech about the big picture? She wasn’t born yesterday.","“What do you want?” Elder Wu stared at her.","Feng Wu smiled. “I don’t like Zuo Qingluan.”","How straightforward.","Elder Wu stared at her. “So? Shall I have her beaten up in a dark alley? Do you like the sound of that?”","He didn’t even need to ask someone else to do it. He could do it himself.","However, that wasn’t what Feng Wu wanted.","“Where’s the fun in that?” Feng Wu shook her head.","“What do you want, then?” Somehow, Elder Wu felt Feng Wu had a more wicked plan.","Feng Wu grinned. “You’ll see.”","It amazed Chen Ziyun to see how Feng Wu bargained with Elder Wu.","That was amazing!","Who was Elder Wu?","He was a member of the 36 elders, who outranked all the vice chiefs."]},{"number":2800,"title":"Chapter 2800 - Collapsing","paragraphs":["That was to say, Elder Wu was ranked higher than the vice chiefs.","All ordinary students revered the vice chiefs, and even Chen Ziyun didn’t dare look directly at Elder Wu.","However, Feng Wu was actually bargaining with him.","She actually had the upper hand in the negotiation. Chen Ziyun couldn’t help but admire her courage.","However, Feng Wu glanced at him at that moment.","Chen Ziyun suddenly realized something.","The spirit wine! He needed the spirit wine!","He stared at Feng Wu in excitement. “Boss Feng Wu, please let me have it!”","The idea of rising to the Spiritual King stage made him want to jump around.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “So now you want to become a Spiritual King?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Of course! I dream about it every day!”","Feng Wu smiled at him.","Recalling how he had doubted Feng Wu and refused to drink the spirit wine, he felt utterly embarrassed.","......","Luckily, he never stayed embarrassed for long.","He knelt at Feng Wu’s feet and tugged at her sleeve. “Boss Feng Wu, please help me!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. Was this guy really the captain of Dynasty Team?","“Fine, fine. You can get your share.” Feng Wu took out a tiny bottle, filled it and handed it to Chen Ziyun.","“That’s enough spirit wine to help you reach the Spiritual King stage. Of course, if you want to play the generous person and give it to someone else, that has nothing to do with me.”","Chen Ziyun had indeed thought about giving it to his team members.","However, he shook his head when he saw the warning look in Feng Wu’s eyes.","He knew Feng Wu must have her own arrangements.","All of a sudden!","Boom!?","The ground shook violently.","Feng Wu and Elder Wu reacted in time and grabbed onto the wall to steady themselves. Chen Ziyun was bumped back and forth between the walls and was almost knocked out.","It seemed forever before the shaking stopped.","Chen Ziyun felt dizzy and asked Feng Wu, “What happened?”","Feng Wu’s face darkened.","She wanted to know what happened, too. However, Little Phoenix was cultivating and wouldn’t be able to answer the question before it woke up.","However, she had a bad feeling.","Her chest felt tight, her heart was beating abnormally and she had a dull headache.","Back when Zuo Qingluan set her up, she had gotten the same feeling before she went to meet Zuo Qingluan, who then destroyed her True Phoenix Blood.","She knew she would only have this sort of feeling when her life was in danger.","An idea suddenly struck her.","It couldn’t be...","“Oh, no!” Feng Wu shouted. “If I’m right, this mine is going to collapse! Quickly! We must get out now!”","What?","The Secret Essence Mine was going to collapse?","How was that even possible?!","Neither Chen Ziyun nor Elder Wu believed her.","However, the rumbling got closer and closer.","Feng Wu led the way. “Follow me if you want to stay alive!”","Elder Wu was much more sensitive than Chen Ziyun, and he felt the approaching danger as well, so he grabbed Chen Ziyun. “I think it’s really happening! Run!”"]}]);
